window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3401,"title":"Chapter 3401: Master Wang Is Really Not Jealous!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3401: Master Wang Is Really Not Jealous!","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian glanced at him with a probing gaze.","Ye Wangchuan’s face was clear and lazy as if he did not feel her gaze. He leaned over and pulled her back. “Come here. I’ll dry your hair for you.”","Before entering, he said he would help Qiao Nian blow dry her hair. In the end, he had been delayed for almost half an hour.","Qiao Nian touched the end of her hair drying naturally. The corners of her eyes were frivolous as she indifferently said, “It’s fine. Let it dry naturally.”","Then, her gaze swept across a certain someone’s face. She thought for a moment and said, “Aunt Yuan has an untouched raw stone that’s very suitable as a gift.”","She remembered Yuan Yongqin telling her about the raw stone of the suet jade. The size and shape were very suitable for making small accessories.","Wen Ruxia was considered an acquaintance of hers.","She had invited her so many times. Since she decided to go this time, she would at least not go empty-handed.","Ye Wangchuan understood what she meant and nodded. He didn’t say anything about it. “If you want to give it, go ahead.”","“Really?” Qiao Nian glanced at him again.","Ye Wangchuan smiled and leaned back slightly, showing a careless arrogance. “Who asked me to be a freeloader?”","He didn’t say he was angry, but his every move screamed it.","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows and said helplessly, “I don’t even know the person you’re talking about.”","He had just told her that Wen Ziyu liked her.","She had no idea at all.","“It’s fine, he knows you.” Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes, their beauty reflecting the light coming through the window, looking careless and lazy.","He didn’t know why he had risked saying this, but he had already said it when he realized it.","Annoyed and frustrated, Qiao Nian stood up and moved aside. Suddenly, she turned around, lowered her head, and bit his thin lips, leaving a bite mark.","Then, she raised her head and glared at him. “You usually attract a lot of attention.”","Ye Wangchuan felt a sharp pain on his lips. In an instant, it was as if he had been electrocuted. Electricity flowed up his tailbone as he stood motionlessly, with his long legs crossed and his neck exposed, as if he wanted Qiao Nian to bite him as she pleased.","“When?”","“What do you think?”","“I can’t remember.”","“...”","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes. It was as if a stone was pressing down on her heart. The more she thought about it, the more frustrated she became. She buried her head in his neck and collarbone, biting him once more.","This time, she used more strength and gritted her teeth before letting go. She pulled away and looked at the red mark on his collarbone.","Only after slightly venting her anger did the anger in her heart dissipate.","Qiao Nian raised her hand to pull her cap, only to realize she wasn’t wearing it. She slowly lowered her hand, her beautiful eyes dry, as she patted his hand. “Alright, I won’t give it to him. I’ll listen to you.”","It was rare for her to change her mind after making a decision. This time, he “forcefully” changed her mind.","Qiao Nian wasn’t used to being influenced by others but was not appalled by it. She let out a sigh and did not dwell on this small matter.","“By the way, what time tomorrow?”","“Seven o’clock.”","Ye Wangchuan touched the spot on his collarbone where he had been bitten, and the corners of his mouth curled up slightly. He didn’t know if he had been possessed just now. Why did it change from teasing her to arguing about the gift?"]},{"number":3402,"title":"Chapter 3402: Reporters Might be Camping Outside","paragraphs":["Chapter 3402: Reporters Might be Camping Outside","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, he quickly got himself out of the episode like Qiao Nian. “The Wen Family’s going all out this time. Reporters might camp outside to take photos.”","The Wen Family had made a fortune in journalism.","Wen Ruxia’s status in the news industry was one of the best, and she came in contact with many big bosses.","She was also one of the big bosses in the news industry.","Naturally, many people wanted to curry favor with her.","Therefore, celebrities would be attending the banquet tomorrow. Expectedly, many popular celebrities and artistes would also be present.","However, these people weren’t in the same circle as Ye Wangchuan and the others. Everyone would gather in their own circle in the banquet hall. No one would be blind enough to hit on them.","However, these celebrities’ attendance attracted many media and paparazzi to camp outside the hotel.","“Mm.” Qiao Nian didn’t care about this and waved her hand. “We’ll go a little later.”","Ye Wangchuan glanced at her, unable to hide the smile in his eyes. He put his hands in his pockets and said lazily, “Okay.”","**","Night on the next day, outside a hotel on Chang’an Street.","Luxury cars gathered.","The reporters were already waiting outside, not letting go of any car parked at the entrance. They were fully prepared to take photos of the celebrities tonight.","This time, the celebrities arrived early.","Each one was more low-key than the other. Almost no celebrities came in ostentatious, huge vans. They all came in private cars.","Not everyone was qualified to attend the Wen Family’s banquet. The celebrities who were invited were all A-list celebrities.","Even if it was their private cars, it was still Bentley-class luxury cars.","Even so, these luxury cars weren’t too conspicuous in tonight’s event.","No one had even heard the flashes of the reporters’ cameras go off.","When Queen of Cinema, Wu Meiling, got out of the car, she didn’t even greet the reporters. Instead, she followed the rules and entered the hotel under the waiter’s guidance.","Moreover, the celebrities were dressed in low-key outfits. They were all wearing high-end brands, but none as ostentatious as they usually wore when they attended events. They all were wrapped up tightly and did not deliberately expose their chests and backs.","In a group of low-key private cars.","A huge, eye-catching silver van drove over.","“Whose car is that?”","“Looking at the license plate, it looks like Han Luke’s car.”","“She’s here too?”","“Wow, I didn’t receive any news that she would come. Looks like she came with... that rumored boyfriend. Hurry up and take a photo.”","“Okay, okay, okay.”","...","Qin Si had just parked and was preparing to enter with Zhang Yang.","The two of them heard the reporters’ whispers, and Qin Si raised his chin to ask the person beside him as he held the car keys, “What’s going on? What are they excited about?”","Zhang Yang shook his head, also dumbfounded. “I don’t know.”","As they spoke, the silver van stopped in front of the reporters.","Qin Si cursed and looked at the woman getting out of the car as if she were an idiot. He pouted slightly. “Who is this? Who invited her? She must be retarded!”","Zhang Yang was also stunned and did not have the time to answer.","The banquets in their circle were usually low-key, but being low-key did not mean it was low-class.","On the contrary, it was precisely because the industry’s entry-level was high that the participants were especially cautious and low-key."]},{"number":3403,"title":"Chapter 3403: I’ll Call Master Wang","paragraphs":["Chapter 3403: I’ll Call Master Wang","Editor: Atlas Studios","The Wen Family had invited some celebrities this time. Most of them had been in the entertainment industry for most of their lives and could be considered halfway into this circle.","Even if they were not a member of this circle, they knew the rules of the circle and rarely violated them.","For example, this was the first time Zhang Yang had seen such an idiot, let alone Qin Si.","He took a photo of the woman and sent it into the group chat to find out who invited this person.","Soon, someone gossiped about the inside story.","Zhang Yang clicked his tongue and turned to Qin Si. “Young Master Qin, guess who invited her?”","“If I knew, why would I ask you?” Qin Si complained impatiently.","Zhang Yang knew his personality. He blinked and touched his earlobe but did not leave him hanging. “Fu Sinian.”","Fu Ge’s biological brother.","The Ye family’s cheap father in physics.","The infamous scumbag of the Fu family!","Qin Si hadn’t heard this name for a long time and was stunned for a moment. “Who?”","Zhang Yang repeated it.","Then, he sighed. “I’ve heard this gossip before. It said that he found a girlfriend outside and caused a huge commotion. I didn’t expect him to bring her here. Don’t tell me he wants to make it public?”","Other than having a passable appearance, Fu Sinian could be said to be a useless person. At that time, he had not been able to achieve anything even with Ye Lan’s support, not to mention now that the Ye family had cut ties with him and ignored him.","However, even so, being Ye Qichen’s father, no matter how much Ye Lan disliked her ex-son-in-law, she had never done anything to him.","Fu Sinian relied on this relationship to swindle people outside. He was doing alright.","At least with this relationship, as long as the Ye family did not say anything publicly, everyone in the circle would acknowledge him on the Ye family’s account.","“Hehe, public my ass!” Qin Si’s eyes were burning as he looked away. He took out his phone and angrily said, “I’ll call Master Wang.”","...","Ye Wangchuan was still on the way.","Qiao Nian didn’t want to go too early, so they only left at 6:30 pm. It was around 7 pm when they arrived, in time for the banquet’s start.","Ye Qichen was also in the car.","Ye Lan had a meeting in the afternoon and did not have time to go back and pick up the little guy, so she asked the butler to send him to Qiao Nian early.","They all met up at night.","There was nothing wrong with this arrangement. Who knew that someone would go out without looking at the almanac and run into the muzzle of a gun?","“Mm?”","“That’s what happened. That person is still doing interviews. She’s dressed like a butterfly. Those who don’t know she’s here to attend someone else’s birthday party might think she’s the birthday girl! How embarrassing.”","Through the rearview mirror, Ye Wangchuan looked at the little guy in the back pestering Qiao Nian to play games with him. His eyes darkened.","“He sure knows how to pick the time.”","Ye Qichen usually didn’t attend these dinners. It was just that today was special. The little guy had heard from somewhere that Qiao Nian was going, so he pestered Ye Lan to come as well.","He didn’t expect Fu Sinian to be so good at courting death.","If Ye Lan was the only one going today, she might not have cared about such trivial matters. After all, she was degrading herself by arguing with such a person!","But Ye Qichen was also attending..."]},{"number":3404,"title":"Chapter 3404: Sister Nian Is Here, I Think It’s Zhui Guang","paragraphs":["Chapter 3404: Sister Nian Is Here, I Think It’s Zhui Guang","Editor: Atlas Studios","The Ye family had always been known for being protective of their own.","Ye Wangchuan doted on his nephew to the core. Fu Sinian wouldn’t cause any trouble to affect Ye Qichen.","Sure enough.","Qin Si heard him say coldly, “Tell the Wen Family what I want and let them clean up the trash.”","“Okay.”","Qin Si thought so too.","As he spoke, he had already started heading inside.","He tilted his head and gently asked the person bringing them in, “Where is your Manager Wen? I have something to discuss with her.”","Ye Wangchuan hung up.","On the other end, Qin Si had already found an extremely busy Wen Ruxia and told her about the situation outside.","Wen Ruxia immediately frowned. She didn’t expect such an ignorant person to cause trouble outside their family’s carefully prepared birthday banquet.","She coaxed Qin Si before asking her assistant to take a look outside.","The assistant returned very quickly.","It was as Qin Si had said.","That popular female celebrity was still hanging out with the reporters outside, and Fu Sinian would come later.","The two of them caused quite a stir among the reporters.","The reporters thought they had captured the young master of a wealthy family and a female celebrity publicly announcing their relationship. In an uproar, they wanted to interview them.","The scene was lively.","The more Wen Ruxia listened, the more her head hurt. She was speechless. “It should be someone Wen Ziyu invited. He doesn’t know about the commotion in Rao City. I’ll immediately get someone to deal with it.”","Previously in Rao City, Ye Qichen was almost crippled for life by Qiao Chen. Despite being his father, Fu Sinian was on Qiao Chen’s side and spoke up for the perpetrator.","That time, Ye Lan fell out with Fu Sinian and requested to sever ties with the Fu family on the spot, not letting him meet Ye Qichen again.","Not many people knew about this.","Wen Ziyu probably didn’t know, so out of consideration for the Ye family, he invited Fu Sinian to the banquet.","It wasn’t a big deal initially, but who knew this person would cause such trouble?","Wen Ruxia had always been swift and decisive. In addition, the matter caused by Fu Sinian and this female celebrity was not presentable.","Angry, she dealt with it mercilessly.","While Fu Sinian and the female celebrity were being interviewed, the hotel’s security officers came out to deal with them. Not only did they interrupt the interview, but they also chased them away in front of the reporters.","At first, Fu Sinian sneered and waited for Wen Ruxia to come out so that he could explain the misunderstanding in person.","Unexpectedly, upon Wen Ruxia’s order, the security officers did not give him any face. Seeing he wasn’t leaving, they simply dragged him and the female celebrity outside.","It was obvious they were not allowed to enter.","Han Luke was a new popular celebrity this year. She originally thought she had found a rich young master with good looks and age to make such a high-profile announcement. Who knew she would be implicated by Fu Sinian and chased away in public? She had lost all her face.","Just as they were pulling and pushing, causing the reporters to take photos non-stop...","A black Phaeton quietly drove into the hotel. As the waiter quickly opened the door, a man and a woman alighted from the car with an outstanding-looking boy.","Compared to the other people’s impressive outfits, the girl was dressed casually, wearing a hoodie and a baseball cap, with her hands in her pockets.","When the child alighted, she casually held the child’s hand and lowered her head to say something to him.","The little boy raised his head and smiled like a flower as he obediently followed her into the hotel.","“That person...”","A reporter noticed the commotion at the door and saw the arrogant back view of the person who had entered.","“That person seems to be Zhui Guang.”"]},{"number":3405,"title":"Chapter 3405: Sister Nian Scared Him With a Look","paragraphs":["The man was in the midst of the group of reporters as he looked in the entrance's direction in a sorry state. Sure enough, he found a familiar figure in the crowd.","\"Chen Chen.\"","With his suit wrinkled by the security officer's pushing, Fu Sinian awkwardly called out to the little guy following Qiao Nian.","However, his voice was drowned out by the crowd. The little boy did not hear him at all. He happily held the girl's hand and did not turn around the entire time.","\"Chen Chen!\"","Fu Sinian raised his voice, trying to get the little guy's attention.","The security officer exerted more force. \"Sir, please don't make a scene. Otherwise, we won't be polite anymore!\"","The reporters kept snapping away.","Han Luke's face was so red that it was practically dripping blood. She grabbed his sleeve and stomped her feet as she lowered her voice and said, \"Do something.\"","She had a magazine event tomorrow.","If this continued, how was she going to face anyone tomorrow?","Unfortunately, Fu Sinian's heart and eyes were on the small figure about to enter the hotel, so he did not notice what she said. \"Let go.\"","Fu Sinian roughly pulled her by the hand, trying to go after his son.","At this moment.","Seeming to sense something, the girl holding Ye Qichen's hand stopped and turned around.","That wild gaze passed through the crowd and accurately landed on Fu Sinian.","Seeming nailed to the ground, Fu Sinian's legs could not move at all. A chill crawled up his feet to his spine, and he did not dare to move again.","\"Sister, what's wrong?\" Seeing that she stopped walking, Ye Qichen grabbed her hand and was about to look back.","Qiao Nian indifferently looked away.","Before Ye Qichen turned around, she pulled down her baseball cap and replied gently, \"Nothing. Let's go in.\"","\"Oh.\" Ye Qichen liked her the most. He did whatever she said and did not overthink about it. He immediately followed Qiao Nian into the hotel happily.","\"Nian Nian.\" Wen Ruxia saw Qiao Nian and them coming in and abandoned the guests she was exchanging greetings with. She walked over quickly with champagne in her hand. \"You're here.\"","Qin Si greeted her naturally. \"Aunt Wen.\"","Ye Wangchuan and Wen Ruxia could only be considered acquaintances, so he only nodded politely.","Wen Ruxia's gaze slid past Qin Si, Ye Wangchuan, and the others to land on the girl's face as she greeted them.","Along the way, she said to Qiao Nian, \"Master Nie is already here. I'll bring you to him.\"","\"Okay,\" Qiao Nian replied. \"Thank you.\"","\"You don't have to be so polite with me.\"","Although Wen Ruxia said that, she was actually smiling like a flower as she led them through the crowd towards Nie Mi.","The Wen Family's banquet was indeed extravagant.","The state banquet hall was filled with people, many of whom could only be seen on television.","However, compared to them, Qiao Nian's group was the most eye-catching.","Wen Ruxia was in her forties and was born into a prestigious family. With her successful career, not many people in Beijing needed her to receive them personally.","However, when Qiao Nian arrived, she put down the chores on hand and personally brought Qiao Nian to Nie Mi, Liang Conglin, and the others.","Because of Wen Ruxia's behavior, many people stole glances at Qiao Nian and the others.","Qin Si was fine.","Many had seen him on many social occasions in Beijing.","Someone in the crowd immediately recognized him.","\"It's Young Master Qin.\"","\"No wonder. It's the Qin family.\"","\"The one beside him seems to be...\" Someone noticed Ye Wangchuan."]},{"number":3406,"title":"Chapter 3406: Master Wang Is Scheming","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan was the same as Qiao Nian today. He wasn't wearing a suit but a shirt of the same color as Qiao Nian plus a pullover. He looked very casual from head to toe.","However, his aura couldn't be hidden at all.","It was quite expensive.","\"Master Wang.\" At this moment, Qin Si suddenly leaned over and tilted his head to whisper, \"Aren't you a little too coquettish?\"","\"Huh?\" The man only raised his eyebrows at him. His gaze was enough to make people fearful.","Qin Si shrunk his neck, but he couldn't help but point at his neck near his collarbone. \"Didn't you look in the mirror before coming out?\"","He looked at the red plum-like mark Qiao Nian left in the afternoon. It was exposed on his neck. Although it was beautiful, anyone who was not blind could tell what it was.","Sister Qiao was so fierce!","Qin Si touched his neck and thought to himself, Can Master Wang be a bottom?","However, he only thought about it and did not have the guts to ask directly.","\"Well, you should at least get a turtleneck sweater to cover yourself.\"","Ye Wangchuan only gave him a solemn look.","Stifled, Qin Si felt as if he was looking at a fool.","Suddenly, Wen Ruxia, who was walking in front, stopped. Qin Si turned around and saw Nie Mi, Liang Conglin, and the others not far away.","Besides Nie Mi and Liang Conglin were a few younger boys.","Zhang Yang looked to be in his early twenties.","Qin Si couldn't help but say, \"I remember that Wen Ziyu and Sister Qiao are from the same school. Sister Qiao is known as Qing University's treasure...\"","Zhang Yang quickly tugged at his sleeve and mouthed, \"Stop talking.\"","Qin Si blinked. As expected, Wen Ziyu's eyes lit up the moment he saw Qiao Nian. He shook off his companions and walked over to greet the girl.","\"Qiao Nian, why are you here?\"","His voice was filled with a throbbing that he did not even notice. His heart was pounding, and he could not see anyone else.","Fortunately, Wen Ruxia quickly glared at him to resolve the awkwardness. \"I invited Nian Nian.\"","\"Oh, oh, oh.\" Wen Ziyu was still smiling as he scratched his head, revealing his white canine teeth. He was sunny and handsome.","His eyes never left the girl.","Not having brought a gift and feeling awkward under his gaze, Qiao Nian could only say, \"Happy birthday.\"","Wen Ziyu's eyes lit up as he nodded repeatedly. \"Happy, indeed. Everyone is happy.\" Wen Ruxia couldn't bear to see her nephew's silly expression and tugged at him, reminding him to look behind. \"Young Master Qin and the others are here too.\"","Only now did Wen Ziyu notice the people behind Qiao Nian.","Who else could it be but Qin Si and the others?","His gaze immediately landed on the most outstanding man among them. As expected, the other party met his gaze. Then, he raised his eyebrows frivolously and handed over a gift.","\"I didn't know what you liked, so I randomly chose this.\"","|| ||","Wen Ruxia elbowed Wen Ziyu and he suddenly returned to his senses. He took the gift aggrievedly before saying, \"Thank you.\"","His expression was as unwilling as it could be.","The corners of Ye Wangchuan's mouth curled up, not seeming to care about his disappointment at all. He passed by him and walked up to the girl, then tilted his head and spoke to her.","Wen Ziyu's gaze followed him. Soon, he realized the eye-catching redness on the man's fair neck. His face instantly turned ashen, and the light in his eyes extinguished."]},{"number":3407,"title":"Chapter 3407: The Ji Family Comes to Beijing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3407: The Ji Family Comes to Beijing","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qin Si saw this scene and secretly cursed. He immediately understood why Master Wang deliberately did not wear a turtleneck sweater today.","It was for a one-hit kill!","After the light in Wen Ziyu’s eyes suddenly dimmed, he did not speak much the entire time. It was obvious he had been dealt a huge blow and could not recover for a while.","It was mainly because Wen Ruxia and Nie Mi were talking about the new arrangement with Qiao Nian. Zhang Yang occasionally interrupted to liven up the atmosphere, making the scene harmonious.","However, Wen Ruxia was responsible for receiving the guests. She couldn’t be with them all night.","After her assistant came over two or three times, Wen Ruxia could only reveal an apologetic expression and say to them, “Master Nie, Nian Nian. You guys chat. I have to greet the other guests, I won’t be able to accompany you anymore.”","“Alright.” Qiao Nian wasn’t a talkative person and did not like such occasions. She didn’t feel neglected. She nodded straightforwardly and let her go.","Wen Ruxia said something to Liang Conglin and the others before hurriedly following her assistant.","On the other hand, when Wen Ziyu’s friend saw Wen Ruxia leave in a hurry, he asked curiously, “Where did your aunt go?”","“Probably to greet a guest.” Wen Ziyu had long known that it was impossible with Qiao Nian, but it was another matter to see it with his own eyes. He said weakly, “A friend from out of town is coming. He seems quite important. He should have arrived.”","Qiao Nian was replying to a message with her head lowered and accidentally heard what he said. Her eyes narrowed slightly.","From out of town? Someone important?","She looked at the message Slim Waist Control sent her half an hour ago.","[Big boss, the Ji family has come to Beijing.]","Attached to the message were two photos of entry passes.","Before clicking on them, Qiao Nian replied, [I’m outside. Busy now.]","She suddenly wanted to see the photos.","Hence, Qiao Nian handed Ye Qichen to someone before saying to Nie Mi and the rest, “I’m sorry, I’ve to go to the washroom.”","**","The banquet hall was huge and magnificent.","Qiao Nian walked through the crowd and finally walked out. At a corner outside the hall, she took out her cell phone, lowered her head, and looked for the photos Slim Waist Control had sent her.","As expected, they were acquaintances.","One was Ji Xiao and the other was an older man.","With triangular eyes and thin lips, who else could it be but Ji Hongyuan?","Ji Xiao and Ji Hongyuan?","What were they doing in Beijing?","Leaning against the wall, Qiao Nian looked at the photo and stretched her legs, wanting to take out the lighter to play with.","Right at this moment, she looked up and saw Wen Ruxia and her assistant leading two people in from the side door.","One was Ji Xiao, dressed in a suit and leather shoes. His steps were steady and imposing, and he looked very eye-catching.","The other was Ji Hongyuan, being ushered in by the Ji family’s bodyguards.","Ji Hongyuan was still mostly the same. He just had aged a lot. His originally gray hair was almost completely white, and his sideburns were gray. However, he did not look as peaceful as he should be at this age. Instead, he looked gloomy and cold.","Wen Ruxia was talking to them. They seemed to know each other.","A little frustrated and feeling a headache, Qiao Nian massaged her temples as she walked to the side to call Ji Nan."]},{"number":3408,"title":"Chapter 3408: Keep an Eye on Them the Next Few Few Days, See What They Do","paragraphs":["The other party picked up instantly.","\"Nian Nian, what's wrong?\"","Qiao Nian cut to the chase and asked directly, \"Does the Ji family have an ally in Beijing?\"","What?","Ji Nan seemed a little stunned by her question. He paused momentarily before saying, \"Let me think. It's not really an ally. It's just a faction that's on good terms with us. They've always wanted to develop in the independent continent, but you know the rules here. It's hard for foreign factions to take root here. The two sides are only in the contact stage and haven't discussed a collaboration.\"","The independent continent had always been a lawless place.","However, the difference between the independent continent and the illegal zone was that anyone could develop their business in the illegal zone, but the independent continent had higher requirements.","It was hard for ordinary factions to enter the independent continent, let alone develop there. Under such circumstances, the independent continent developed a cooperation model.","For example, foreign forces would come into contact with a faction on an independent continent and reach cooperation by relying on them or splitting the profits, thereby achieving their goal of successfully taking a share of the loot in the independent continent.","So far, the only family in Beijing that relied on themselves to have a business line in the independent continent was the Ye family.","Qiao Nian immediately understood the situation.","The Wen Family must have been looking for a chance to break into the independent continent all these years. Hence, they interacted with the Ji family.","However, this became a small matter because the Wen Family wasn't a good business partner. Ji Lingfeng definitely did not have the time to care about such trivial matters.","Hence, for some reason, Ji Xiao and Ji Hongyuan came to participate in Wen Ziyu's birthday party in the name of the independent continent's Ji family.","\"Tsk!\" The girl's eyebrows raised, and she suppressed her anger. Her red lips curled up as she got annoyed. \"They're so free!\"","\"What's wrong?\" Ji Nan still didn't know why she suddenly asked this.","Qiao Nian suppressed her impatience and tried to speak calmly. \"It's nothing. I'll fly to the independent continent in three days.\"","Ji Nan's attention was successfully diverted. \"Do you want me to pick you up?\"","\"No need.\" Qiao Nian rejected him before adding, \"I might have to go somewhere first before I go home. I'll look for you after I'm done with my matters.\"","She hadn't been back in months.","There were still many things to do at the First Research Institute. Feng Yu and Xu Yi were both waiting for her. Then, the last experiment on the USB drive required her to go through the First Research Institute's archives again.","And Ji Lingfeng...","At the thought of so many things waiting for her, Qiao Nian felt a headache coming on. She looked at Ji Xiao and Ji Hongyuan, who had come to Beijing for some reason, and her eyes turned cold.","\"Anyway, we'll talk about it when I get back.\"","\"Okay.\"","Ji Nan knew she was busy and did not ask why she had asked him those questions just now. They spoke some more before hanging up.","The girl leaning against the wall looked at her cell phone. Looking back up, she could no longer see Ji Xiao and Ji Hongyuan.","Slowly straightening up, she casually replied to Slim Waist Control, [Keep an eye on them for the next few days and see what they do.]","If Ji Xiao and Ji Hongyuan didn't have ulterior motives, given Ji Lingfeng's current situation, she did not want to have a conflict with the Ji family.","However, if they insisted on courting death, she didn't mind sealing the coffin lid for them!","Anyway, Nie Qixing, Zhou Zheng, and the Zhou family... She was running out of patience now. If Ji Xiao and Ji Hongyuan insisted on causing trouble, they couldn't blame her for not giving them another chance.","Qiao Nian put her cell phone in her pocket and turned to go back."]},{"number":3409,"title":"Chapter 3409: Sister Nian Originally Planned to Leave Early","paragraphs":["The banquet began not long after she returned.","Wen Ruxia originally arranged for Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan to sit at the main table with Old Master Wen and the others.","Later on, Ye Wangchuan considered that Qiao Nian did not like such a lively social occasion and asked Wen Ruxia to arrange for her to sit in an inconspicuous corner in the back row.","Qin Si and Nie Mi naturally followed them.","Originally, the Wen Family's banquet was arranged according to status, and only insignificant guests would be arranged to be seated so far back.","But since Ye Wangchuan was sitting there, the area became eye-catching.","\"Why is Young Master Ye sitting back there?\"","\"If I had known earlier, I wouldn't have sat in the front. I would have chosen a seat at the back. Perhaps I could have gone over to offer a toast.\"","\"Ay...\"","Qiao Nian heard rustling sounds around her as she approached the table.","She pulled out the empty seat between Ye Wangchuan and the little guy and looked at him. \"Why aren't you sitting with Auntie Lan?\"","Ye Lan was here too.","As someone who came on the Ye family's behalf, Ye Lan couldn't be as willful as Ye Wangchuan.","Hence, Ye Lan sat at the main table with Old Master Wen and exchanged pleasantries. Ye Wangchuan poured Qiao Nian a glass of water, lazy and indifferent. \"It's quiet here.\"","Qiao Nian picked up the glass and gave him a look. She had a feeling he didn't choose this table just because it was quiet.","However, since Ye Wangchuan said so, she went with it. Anyway, she didn't like to eat with people she didn't know. Hence, she lowered her head and pursed her lips, not saying anything else.","On the other hand, not having the chance to talk to her properly this entire time, Nie Mi took advantage and they were all seated close by and asked her, \"Nian Nian, when are you leaving?\"","\"In three days.\"","Qiao Nian lazily reclined in her seat.","At this moment, the congratulatory speech was almost over.","The birthday boy stood under the spotlight, thanking the guests for coming.","Qiao Nian lowered her head, causing a strand of hair to slide down her brow bones, hiding her anxiety. She paused before saying, \"I originally planned to leave early, but I'm afraid once I leave Beijing, the reclusive families will take the opportunity to make a move.\"","Zhou Zheng had something to do with Nie Qixing's death.","Nie Qingru was strong and loved to blame others for her mistakes. She must want to bring Zhou Zheng back to vent her anger.","Qiao Nian twirled the cup with her fair fingers, made even fairer under the light. She tried to suppress her surliness as she said, \"Zhou Zheng almost killed Master Cheng. I don't care if he's involved in anything else, but he has to pay for what he did to Master Cheng.\"","Therefore, she had to wait for the trial's final verdict because Zhou Zheng would be imprisoned once the final verdict was out.","Once that was done, the possibility of Nie Qingru using unorthodox methods to extradite him would be negligible.","There was another reason why she wasn't in a hurry to leave. She wasn't sure if the person who looked for Zhong Yiliu for medicine was Ji Lingfeng.","She guessed it was him.","However, guesses were guesses, after all. Without concrete evidence, she couldn't be 100% sure about it.","\"Moreover, a few parasites have come to Beijing in the past two days. Before leaving, I have to see what they want to do.\" Qiao Nian was very vague.","Nie Mi didn't know the messy situation in the independent continent, nor did he know the inside story of the reclusive families. He only saw her frown as she spoke."]},{"number":3410,"title":"Chapter 3410: Someone on a Different Level from This Circle","paragraphs":["Chapter 3410: Someone on a Different Level from This Circle","Editor: Atlas Studios","He was silent before asking Ye Wangchuan, “Xiao Ye, are you going?”","Ye Wangchuan knew what he was worried about. He poured him a cup of tea before saying frankly, “Don’t worry, Master Nie. I’ll take good care of Nian Nian.”","With this, Nie Mi did not mention Qiao Nian’s departure for the rest of the meal.","Zhang Yang and Qin Si were also at the table.","Zhang Yang had always been a talkative person.","One moment, he would talk to Nie Mi about the music festival, the next moment, he would ask Qin Si about the international gaming competition, and the next moment, he would talk to Ye Wangchuan about the stock market trend...","Throughout the meal, he was the one leading the conversation. Even if they didn’t talk about serious matters, just the topics he covered were catered to everyone. He managed to pay attention to everyone.","Soon, the meal was over.","Wen Ruxia probably knew they would leave immediately, so she especially came to chat with them.","Qiao Nian had no intention of staying behind to chat. So, she left first to get some fresh air and waited for Ye Wangchuan and the others to come out.","Outside.","Most of the reporters had already left. Only a small group insisted on staying to take photos of celebrities coming out after socializing. At this moment, they were tidying up their cameras and chatting.","“Han Luke was a surprise today. I didn’t expect her to make such a big joke. Tsk tsk, let’s see how her company’s public relations department handles this and whether she can buy out this news.”","“Dozens of media outlets have taken photos of her making a fool of herself today. I’m afraid it won’t be easy this time.”","A reporter disagreed. “Didn’t they say she had a backer?”","A sneering man who was slightly older who knew a little about Beijing’s rules raised his eyebrows at the hotel and said, “Someone? Who could she be? She just knows a few film and television bosses. Those people are not on the same level as the people in this circle. You’ll understand in the future.”","His last sentence was especially meaningful.","He knew that today was the Wen Family’s banquet. The Wen Family was considered one of the top families in the circle, just behind two or three families.","The Wen’s were definitely one of the top families in Beijing.","On such an occasion, Han Luke dressed like a butterfly and violated this circle’s taboo. Furthermore, she followed the wrong person and caused a ruckus at the door with Fu Sinian, making the hotel security officers come out to chase her away.","The hotel security officers couldn’t chase them away themselves. Someone must have instructed them to do so.","After thinking about it, the matter became interesting.","“Is it that exaggerated? Isn’t Han Luke popular? Her company has to think of a way to protect her.” This reporter was probably her supporter. He was stunned and did not believe it.","The old reporter didn’t bother to explain. After all, he wasn’t obligated to teach him these rules. He took out a cigarette from his pocket before switching the topic. “Speaking of which, I saw Zhui Guang today.”","“...You must have seen it wrongly, right?” The young reporter did not care too much about this. Instead, he caught a gossip point. “When filming Han Luke’s boyfriend, he seemed to be shouting for a child. Do you think Han Luke’s boyfriend has a child? If he does... Wouldn’t it be more interesting to expose it!”","He even paid special attention to that little boy today. His looks were outstanding. He would definitely recognize him if he saw him again.","At this moment, he noticed someone coming out of the hotel’s brightly lit entrance from the corner of his eye.","He subconsciously picked up his camera and pointed it in that direction. Then, he saw an adult and a child walking out of the hotel."]},{"number":3411,"title":"Chapter 3411: Sister Nian Discovered","paragraphs":["Chapter 3411: Sister Nian Discovered","Editor: Atlas Studios","The girl’s hoodie was pulled up high, revealing only her snow-white outline. It wasn’t very clear from afar.","The reporter could sense a unique personal temperament.","This wasn’t the point.","The reporter’s focus was on the child following her.","Wearing a custom-made suit like an adult, the little boy was an adorable six or seven years old. His obsidian-like eyes were round and his eyelashes were long and curled like a doll. He followed the girl obediently, his eyes never leaving her.","“Damn, I’m so lucky?!” The young reporter exclaimed before quickly aiming the camera at Ye Qichen and taking photos.","...","Not far away.","Qiao Nian sensed something and suddenly looked in the three o’clock direction.","Sure enough, she saw a reporter taking photos of them.","She said something to Ye Qichen before walking towards the reporter.","The other reporters only noticed Qiao Nian when she walked over and gestured to one of the bespectacled men.","“Hand me the camera.”","The young reporter had just taken a photo of the child and was secretly delighted to take a big piece of news when he noticed Qiao Nian.","Terrified, he hid the camera behind him. “What are you doing? Why should I give it to you?”","The old reporter, who had just persuaded him, looked at him as if he were a fool. He distanced himself from him without making a sound, determined not to be tainted by this fool.","Did he really think that he was waiting for a celebrity today?","Although the girl looked young, which of the guests attending the banquet today was someone they could afford to offend?","The other party had already discovered him secretly taking photos and came to ask to delete them. He could have quickly deleted the photos and apologized, but he just had to fight her head-on.","“You took a photo of the child just now.” Qiao Nian patiently retracted her outstretched hand and looked at him with clear eyes.","This kind of insight and understanding made the young reporter very embarrassed. He gritted his teeth and refused to admit it. “Did you see me take a photo? Do you have evidence?”","“Mm, I’ll just have to look at your camera.” Qiao Nian was very calm.","The young reporter’s face flushed red, but he refused to cooperate. He hid his camera behind his back and said with an unyielding attitude, “I’m sorry, this is my camera. If you don’t have evidence, I can’t hand the camera to you! Otherwise, you can call the police.”","Compared to his irritable and agitated attitude, the girl was too calm. She looked at him and said coldly, “I’ll repeat it. Hand me the camera. I’ll delete the photos and that will be all.”","She knew Ye Qichen’s personality. He had been despised and talked about since he was young. He was meticulous and sensitive.","If she hadn’t come today, the little guy probably wouldn’t have come either.","She didn’t want anyone to take advantage of him.","Even if this news might not be released, she didn’t want anyone to expose Ye Qichen’s photo anonymously.","“I’m not negotiating with you.”","She meant there was no room for compromise.","The young reporter glared at her, as if he wanted to stare at Qiao Nian until something changed.","Seeing he was unwilling to cooperate, Qiao Nian did not waste more time with him and glanced at the media company on his nameplate.","Next, she took out her cell phone and made a call. “Aunt Yuan, do you know Star Entertainment? Do me a favor.”"]},{"number":3412,"title":"Chapter 3412: Standing Up for Chen Chen","paragraphs":["The young reporter was not particularly flustered after seeing that she knew his company's name. His eyelids only twitched twice.","A few minutes later.","His cell phone rang, sounding exceptionally loud in the quiet night.","He subconsciously looked at Qiao Nian as his heart raced. Then, he took out his cell phone and looked at the caller ID.","It was actually his superior.","It couldn't be...","Still holding onto a sliver of hope, he accepted the call. \"Hello, Team Leader...\"","The next second, his expression changed drastically. A tinge of red in the green and a tinge of black in the red bloomed on his face.","It was unknown what his superior said, but after hanging up after a 10-second call, the young reporter looked as if he had been electrocuted. Then, he gritted his teeth and silently handed the camera to Qiao Nian. \"I only took two photos.\"","He had only taken two photos before Qiao Nian discovered him.","The young reporter watched as she took the camera and deleted the photos, not forgetting to take out the memory card. Then, she bluntly said, \"I'll take this away.\"","All the photos he had taken were inside the memory card. Seeing that the girl was about to leave, the reporter indignantly complained, \"Didn't you delete the photos? Why are you taking my memory card? I don't know how to recover the photos. There are many photos in there. Can you...\"","Unexpectedly, the girl turned around and glanced at him meaningfully. \"No.\"","The reporter's face turned beet red. \"You...\"","He was furious at her for bullying an ordinary person with no background like him. His expression became twisted and humiliated as if he had suffered a huge grievance. The girl seemed to know what he was thinking and snorted. Her eyes were cold, but they seemed to contain a prairie fire. \"You target an unrelated child for your own benefit and then feel wronged because someone took your memory card. If you feel so wronged, there's nothing I can do!\"","The young reporter was embarrassed after she exposed his thoughts. He momentarily forgot to control his facial expression and could no longer maintain the angry and indignant expression of an ordinary person being bullied.","None of the other reporters wanted to be associated with him, so they stayed far away. After a while, they formed a circle, and he stood in the center alone like a clown.","**","\"Sister Qiao, where did you go?\"","Qiao Nian had just returned with the memory card when she bumped into Ye Wangchuan and the others, who had just finished chatting with Wen Ruxia.","Qin Si was curious upon seeing she was coming from the reporters' direction.","\"You know one of them?\" Qin Si looked at the row of reporters who had yet to leave and felt that one of them seemed especially eye-catching.","He didn't overthink. He was just wondering how Qiao Nian knew these reporters.","Ye Wangchuan glanced at the reporters waiting outside the hotel after handing the little guy a piece of candy. He didn't say anything, but his eyes turned cold.","\"Let's go back.\" He diverted Qin Si's attention at the right time and let him drive.","Qin Si took the car keys and told Zhang Yang to enter the car.","Zhang Yang was chatting with him, to begin with, so he naturally accompanied him without saying anything.","With them leaving, the surroundings became much quieter.","Qiao Nian suddenly remembered something and turned to ask Ye Wangchuan, \"By the way, where is Chen Chen going later?\""]},{"number":3413,"title":"Chapter 3413: Isn’t It Just Because You Have Some Stinky Money?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3413: Isn’t It Just Because You Have Some Stinky Money?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan glanced at the little guy standing obediently beside him.","Ye Qichen looked very obedient dressed like an adult, his beautiful face tense and his lips pursed. One look and one could tell that he was a “very obedient” child.","If one ignored his pricked ears, it would be even more so!","Ye Wangchuan looked at the girl in the baseball cap. “His Grandma hasn’t come out yet.”","Qiao Nian didn’t overthink and reached out for the little guy’s hand. “Then come to my place. I’ll call Auntie Lan and tell her you’re coming with me.”","Ye Qichen’s eyelashes fluttered and his tense lips relaxed as he looked at her with surprise. He didn’t expect his Sister to bring him back with her.","Qiao Nian rubbed his soft hair and said good-naturedly, “We have a game console at home. I’ll play two rounds with you later.”","“Okay.”","Ye Qichen nodded obediently with his big eyes. It was so cute that it melted people’s hearts.","When Qin Si drove over, he saw the little devil pretending to be obedient in front of Sister Qiao again. He rubbed the goosebumps on his arms and did not dare to provoke the little devil of the Ye family. He rolled down the window and said, “Get in the car.”","“Let’s enter the car.”","Qiao Nian opened the door and let Ye Qichen get in first. After the little guy sat down, she unhurriedly looked in the young reporter’s direction with cold eyes before she got into the car and closed the door.","The young reporter naturally noticed her glance, and their expressions became ugly.","What did she mean by that?","She looked at him before leaving.","Was that a warning?","Wasn’t she just relying on her stinky money to bully him!","He gritted his teeth in hatred before looking up and realizing the car hadn’t left. The man who had walked to the front passenger seat was also looking at him.","The reporter couldn’t explain why, but he panicked and subconsciously avoided the gaze.","... Why did he feel like he had gotten into trouble?","Soon, he rejected this idea.","He had only taken two photos of a child, and that girl had snatched his memory card. The photos had also been deleted. What else could she do...?","**","Rhine.","Qiao Nian brought Ye Qichen to her room to play games as soon as they arrived.","In the living room.","Ye Wangchuan took off his jacket and draped it over the sofa. Then, he took out his cell phone from his pocket and walked to the water dispenser to get water.","Meanwhile, he called someone.","10 minutes later.","He held a glass of water in one hand and drank slowly while holding his cell phone in the other. He pursed his thin lips and said in a low voice, “I understand.”","Gu San arrived at this moment, seeing Ye Wangchuan on the phone as soon as he entered. But he didn’t say anything and just listened.","He touched his earlobe and obediently went into the kitchen to make two cups of coffee.","When he came out, he detected suppressed anger in the man’s low voice.","Gu San quietly placed the steaming coffee beside the man’s hand. When Ye Wangchuan put down his phone, he carefully asked, “Master Wang, did something happen?”","“It’s a small matter.”","After Ye Wangchuan searched his contact list, Gu San’s sharp eyes saw Old Master Ye’s name.","He shut his mouth.","Sure enough.","Ye Wangchuan called Old Master Ye.","It was already 9:30 p.m. when they returned. According to Ye Maoshan’s habits, he was already preparing to sleep at this time. If it wasn’t something important, Ye Wangchuan rarely looked for him after 9:00 p.m."]},{"number":3414,"title":"Chapter 3414: Completely Cut Off His Path to Success","paragraphs":["Chapter 3414: Completely Cut Off His Path to Success","Editor: Atlas Studios","It rang a dozen times before Old Master Ye picked up.","“Why are you calling me so late into the night?” Old Master Ye’s voice was hoarse. After all, he was old and it was normal for him to be in low spirits at night.","Ye Wangchuan briefly explained what Fu Sinian did before adding, “He’s been in Beijing for so long. Other than playing with women, he’s also mixed in clubhouses... It’s not good for Chen Chen’s development if someone like that is around him all the time.”","Old Master Ye was silent for a moment before sighing. “What do you think we should do?”","He thought Ye Wangchuan meant to chase Fu Sinian back to Rao City and not let him come back to Beijing.","Who knew...","His grandson’s voice was steady and decisive. “Send him overseas.”","Ye Maoshan was shocked for a moment. Then, he seriously thought about it.","Ye Wangchuan knew he couldn’t make an immediate decision. Thus, he said lightly, “As Chen Chen grows up and continues to stay in the country, more and more such things will happen. Why don’t we send him overseas now? If he wants to be ridiculous, he can do so overseas. Out of sight, out of mind.”","“I can’t give you an answer right now. I have to discuss this with your aunt.” Old Master Ye was more composed.","After all, Fu Sinian involved his granddaughter, who had died early. He still had to explain this matter to Ye Lan and see what she thought.","“Sure,” Ye Wangchuan replied. Then, he casually said, “I’ll warn him not to repeat what he did tonight.”","“Are you trying to warn him, or do you think the trouble he caused has affected Nian Nian?” Old Master Ye did not treat Fu Sinian as family, to begin with, so he was still relaxed.","He couldn’t expose his grandson.","Then, he said, “Alright, you can warn him however you want. He brought this upon himself. He can’t blame anyone!”","Old Master Ye wasn’t being casual about this matter.","It was the truth.","The Fu family was originally only a little famous in Rao City and wasn’t ranked in Beijing. With their decline in Rao City, Fu Sinian, this young master, wasn’t qualified to mix in the Beijing circle at all.","However, not only did he stay in Beijing all these years, but he was also praised by some people.","To put it bluntly, he relied on his blood relationship with Chen Chen to freeload.","Logically speaking, as long as he behaved himself, Ye Maoshan and Ye Lan wouldn’t be calculative with him. They would turn a blind eye for Ye Qichen’s sake.","Of all the things he could do, he just had to run into the muzzle of the gun.","And he even brought an indecent woman to such an occasion tonight.","This matter reminded Old Master Ye.","Chen Chen would integrate into the Beijing circle as he grew older. At that time, if Fu Sinian continued to act like this and smeared Chen Chen’s reputation, how would the people in the circle think of Chen Chen in the future?","Old Master Ye had raised Chen Chen as if he were his own son and doted on him heavily. Back then, the little guy was born with a leg problem and was despised and gossiped about behind his back.","How could Old Master Ye bear to see him continue being the subject of gossip in the future?","So, Fu Sinian had hit the jackpot this time and completely cut off his own path to success!","“By the way, he’s here with me. He won’t be going back tonight. Tell Aunt later.” Ye Wangchuan remembered before hanging up."]},{"number":3415,"title":"Chapter 3415: Sister Nian: Just an Ordinary Grandpa","paragraphs":["Only now did Old Master Ye pull himself out of his uncomfortable mood. \"Huh?\"","Ye Qichen never spent the night outside due to his childhood experience.","Because he didn't feel safe and didn't like unfamiliar environments.","This was new.","\"He's playing games with Nian Nian.\" Ye Wangchuan's voice carried a smile. It was an indescribable spring breeze and inexplicably warm.","The last trace of discomfort in Old Master Ye's heart disappeared, and he couldn't help but say happily, \"Alright, I'll send someone to pick him up tomorrow morning.\"","**","Upstairs.","Qiao Nian connected the game console to the projector and handed a controller to the little guy. She sat down cross-legged beside him and held the other controller, operating the foreign game that popped up on the screen.","\"I'll take you for a round.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"I'll just watch from the side after. You can play it by yourself.\"","This was a mecha-genre game. It also involved various mecha assembly and usage manuals. It had long surpassed the scope of a simple game.","Qiao Nian had always been proficient in playing games.","She taught Ye Qichen how to clear the round.","One level after another.","At first, Ye Qichen was a little nervous and distracted, but later on, he was completely immersed in it and became more and more familiar with it.","Qiao Nian brought him to the last stage and changed her equipment to deal with the big boss. Then, she placed the controller on her lap and her hands behind her head before sloppily saying, \"It's your turn. You have to do it on your own this time.\"","Ye Qichen was an adult and a boy at the same time. He liked mecha games. At this moment, his eyes lit up and he promised her with a red face, \"Sister, I can definitely do it!\"","Qiao Nian wasn't wearing a baseball cap right now. Her beautiful face was quite eye-catching, and her gaze was unrestrained. Her expression was arrogant. She rubbed the little guy's head, and the corners of her lips curled up casually. \"I'll watch you from here.\"","Encouraged, Ye Qichen nodded and immersed himself in the game, trying his best to show Qiao Nian the mecha assembly knowledge he had just learned.","It was boring to watch others play games, but Qiao Nian kept her promise and watched Ye Qichen play silently.","Occasionally, she would look at her cell phone.","Or when she saw the little guy encountering a more difficult obstacle, she would remind him from time to time.","Ye Qichen was undoubtedly talented. This game was also an entry-level weapon game. Only people who knew a little about it could play it.","Otherwise, 99% of players would be discouraged just trying to assemble their weapons.","Besides stumbling in the beginning, Qiao Nian realized that Ye Qichen's memory was exceptional. He already knew how to assemble the weapons he liked using the assembly method she taught him just now.","Sometimes, he could draw inferences and put together one or two simple new weapons.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes as she looked at the little guy playing attentively beside her, then at the little guy Ye Qichen was controlling on the screen. She paused before saying, \"Chen Chen, how about I find you another teacher?\"","\"Huh?\" Ye Qichen was focused on playing. If it was someone else talking to him, he might have ignored them.","But the person speaking to him right now was Qiao Nian.","He still shifted his attention out of the game with difficulty and looked at Qiao Nian with his big obsidian eyes. \"Sister, what teacher?\"","Qiao Nian especially liked his beautiful and obedient appearance. She rubbed his head and thought before saying, \"Just an ordinary grandpa.\""]},{"number":3416,"title":"Chapter 3416: Ji Lingfeng Finally Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 3416: Ji Lingfeng Finally Appears","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Qichen blinked, thinking about what kind of grandpa an “ordinary grandpa” was.","Qiao Nian wasn’t good at describing people. Seeing his confusion, she pondered before saying, “He can be considered half my... teacher. You can call him Grandpa Feng.”","Ye Qichen didn’t know that the “ordinary” old man she was talking about was the dean of the First Research Institute, Feng Yu.","He nodded obediently. “Okay.”","Qiao Nian let him continue playing as she picked up her cell phone and typed a message to Feng Yu, telling him about Ye Qichen’s situation.","Feng Yu neither agreed nor rejected her. He only said he would come to Beijing to meet him when he was free and see if the little guy had talent in this aspect.","Of course, Qiao Nian had no problem with it. She would talk to Feng Yu for the time being.","**","The next day.","Noon.","Slim Waist Control called her.","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows and pulled out a chair, preparing to go downstairs for dinner later. “Tell me, what did you find?”","“Interesting.” Slim Waist Control smiled cheekily. “Do you know what those two from the Ji family are doing in Beijing?”","Qiao Nian didn’t like people beating around the bush.","Fortunately, Slim Waist Control immediately continued, “At first, I thought they came for you again. I was wrong. They’re here for the Ninth Branch this time. These guys must be crazy to be after the Ninth Branch’s secret, the Tsar’s data.”","Ji Xiao and Ji Hongyuan wanted the Tsar’s data?","Qiao Nian pressed her forehead and quickly understood what they were thinking.","As expected, after Ji Ziyin was taken away by Leonard’s family, these two, who had placed all their stakes on her, did not have a good time.","Ji Xiao and Ji Hongyuan were both ambitious people.","They wanted to make a comeback, so it wasn’t strange for them to target the Tsar, which had shone at the weapons exhibition.","She didn’t even need to guess to know these people wanted to negotiate with the reclusive families and Nie Qingru after getting the Tsar’s data.","“It’s not night yet, but they’re already dreaming.” Qiao Nian thought for a moment and said, just in case, “Bring a few more people and keep an eye on Master Cheng. Don’t give them a chance to take advantage of the situation.”","“Boss, you don’t have to tell me that.” Slim Waist Control had already arranged for people, specifically the ones Guan Yan wanted.","After saying that, he remembered something important. “By the way, I found something interesting.”","“What is it?”","“Ji Lingfeng will be holding an internal meeting of the Ji family tomorrow, which means he will show up... From the looks of it, he doesn’t want the news that he’s still severely injured to spread.”","The rumors about Ji Lingfeng in the independent continent were getting more and more ridiculous.","Some rumors even said he was about to die.","However, looking at He Lin’s stance, everything was fake. Ji Lingfeng seemed fine!","“He hasn’t shown his face since he returned. Perhaps he wants to see which fish are moving under the muddy waters of the Ji family.","“Now that he’s seen it clearly, he’s prepared to clean them up.”","This was the first reaction of everyone in the Ji family who received the news.","Some people played tricks behind his back when Ji Lingfeng was not around. Naturally, they couldn’t eat or sleep well and were anxious now that he was making a move.","Some people were more well-behaved and did not mess around during this period. They just waited patiently for the internal family meeting.","“Sun, I think Ji Lingfeng’s making a big move this time. Even the main members of the Ji family are attending the meeting. Even the people from the various halls have to attend. It looks like he has made a major decision.”"]},{"number":3417,"title":"Chapter 3417: Where’s Your Patriarch? I Want to See Him!","paragraphs":["The next day.","Under the seemingly calm surface of the independent continent was a fierce undercurrent.","Without exception, all the forces on the independent continent were closely watching the Ji family's meeting. For example, the Chamber of Commerce Alliance and other more powerful forces had even contacted the Ji family's internal connections, determined to dig out first- hand information.","\"Do you think Ji Lingfeng is injured?\"","\"You never know.\"","|| ||","\"Everyone thought he was so badly injured that he couldn't get up from the bed, but in the end, he summoned the main members of the family for an internal meeting as if nothing had happened.\"","The speaker shrugged his shoulders and played with the ring on his thumb in satisfaction. \"So who knows if he's injured? I'm afraid only Ji Lingfeng himself knows the answer.\"","Simon rubbed his temples. Feeling what the other party said made sense, he said in a low voice, \"Anyway, I've already spoken to my contact in the Ji family. Let's see what Ji Lingfeng wants to do!\"","***","Those at the Chamber of Commerce Alliance weren't the only ones restless.","Besides them, the Hacker Alliance and other forces were all waiting for Ji Lingfeng to appear.","Everyone wanted to see Emperor Ji's physical condition, who had miraculously escaped death and returned.","This was also related to their attitude towards the Ji family.","10:00 AM.","The autumn air was refreshing and the sky was cloudless.","The Ji family elders were the first to arrive at the old residence. According to the rules, they handed their weapons to He Lin's men and entered the Righteousness Hall to wait for the Patriarch.","Then, the team leaders of the various important halls arrived one after another, also handing their weapons and entering. Naturally, they had to comply and respectfully let He Lin's men search them.","There were so many people this time.","All kinds of cars were parked at the entrance.","It had been a long time since the entrance of the Ji family's old residence was so lively.","Xie Yun arrived at this moment.","Someone recognized her car and whispered, \"Is that Madam's car?\"","\"Where?\"","\"Oh, the car that just arrived, the black Porsche parked behind Chief Wu's car.\"","There were so many people here this time. The inspection at the door was extremely","meticulous, so it was naturally impossible for them to enter immediately. Many people were","still queuing outside and waiting for inspection.","Xie Yun got out of the car under everyone's gaze.","Everyone stopped talking and looked at her.","He Lin was monitoring the security checks at the door. Upon seeing her, his eyebrows twitched and he quickly went over. \"Madam.\"","\"Mm,\" Xie Yun replied softly, but her expression did not soften.","She met He Lin's evasive gaze and concisely asked, \"Where is he?\"","\"Madam...\" He Lin hesitated, as if he was begging her not to cause trouble.","However, He Lin didn't dare to say anything in front of so many pairs of eyes.","However, Xie Yun acted as if she did not notice his expression and brushed past him. \"I want to see him!\"","This was not a negotiation.","It was an order!","He Lin had no choice but to follow her. When he passed by his subordinates at the entrance, he did not forget to remind them sternly, \"I'll enter first. You guys have to check carefully! Do you understand?\"","\"Yes.\"","The person in charge of the inspection at the door quickly responded."]},{"number":3418,"title":"Chapter 3418: You Plan to Hand the Ji Family Over to Nian Nian Today","paragraphs":["He Lin followed Xie Yun all the way to Ji Lingfeng's residence. At one point, he couldn't keep up with Xie Yun and had no choice but to speed up.","\"Madam.\"","Silence.","Xie Yun had no intention of speaking to him. She walked without looking back.","He Lin grew anxious upon seeing she was about to barge into Ji Lingfeng's office. Not caring about seniority, he quickly reached out to stop her from rushing in.","\"Madam, why don't you wait outside while I go in and tell the Patriarch you're here?\"","Xie Yun narrowed her eyes and scanned at him from head to toe. \"You dare to stop me?\"","\"How would I dare...\" He Lin smiled bitterly and tried to calm her. \"But Madam, you should know the Patriarch's current condition. I'm worried...\"","He should have ended up mediocre in this life but had managed to be promoted to his current position all because of the Patriarch.","He Lin naturally did not dare to offend his superiors.","However, the Patriarch really couldn't waste the strength quarreling with Madam anymore. If they quarreled again, he suspected the Patriarch wouldn't be able to force himself to attend today's meeting.","Seeing that her expression had softened, He Lin dared to say in a low voice, \"Madam, you know the Patriarch's health. He...\"","The harshness in Xie Yun's eyes faded, but she had no intention of backing down. \"I'm just going in to talk to him.\"","Seeing her attitude, He Lin knew he couldn't stop her. If he forcefully stopped Xie Yun from entering, it might alarm the people in the Righteousness Hall.","He could only make way with pursed lips. \"The Patriarch is inside.\"","Xie Yun glanced at him but did not say anything. She walked past him and went straight through the corridor, pushing open the door of Ji Lingfeng's study.","Click.","The door closed.","Although He Lin was anxious and worried that Xie Yun would argue with Ji Lingfeng, he still had an even more important mission at this critical moment and could not stay outside the room all the time.","He stood outside for a few minutes and, not hearing anything from inside, gritted his teeth and went to do what Ji Lingfeng had instructed him to do.","In the room.","Xie Yun wasn't as aggressive as He Lin had imagined she would be.","Instead, when she saw the man in a suit sitting behind the desk, she stopped a few steps away from him and watched as he opened the drawer and silently placed an old photo back inside.","When he looked up at her, his deep eyes were calm as if he was looking at an old friend. \"You're here. Sit.\"","Ji Lingfeng pointed to the sofa, indicating for her to sit down.","Xie Yun took a deep breath but did not move. She stood still, facing him. Her gaze slid over his thin face as she bluntly asked, \"Are you planning to hand the Ji family to Nian Nian today?\"","Ji Lingfeng told her this a few days ago.","At that time, she did not agree.","The reason was simple.","She didn't care how chaotic the previous generation of the Ji family was. As a mother, she only wanted to protect her child's interests.","That was why her reaction was so intense. She had no intention of talking to him and clearly rejected Ji Lingfeng's suggestion.","However, since she received the news yesterday, she knew this man did not take it to heart at all. He still insisted on doing what he had decided.","Xie Yun was angry before entering this room. However, her anger dissipated the moment she saw him."]},{"number":3419,"title":"Chapter 3419: He Told Me Everything","paragraphs":["Chapter 3419: He Told Me Everything","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ji Lingfeng was in a terrible state.","Even though he had washed his face, shaved his beard, trimmed his hair, and changed into a vigorous suit, he looked too thin! His thin figure almost couldn’t support the suit. This was something Xie Yun had not thought of before coming.","Ji Lingfeng was like a terminally ill person on his final dying breath. Besides his eyes still as sharp as an eagle’s, his sickly state could not be disguised.","Ji Lingfeng nodded, seemingly having no intention of hiding it from her. “Yes.”","Xie Yun originally wanted to ask him if he thought about his biological son and if he had discussed it with him... but what came out of her mouth was, “What did Elder Zhong say? How long can you hold out for?”","Ji Lingfeng looked at her in surprise. “Huh?”","Xie Yun took a deep breath and tried not to sound stiff. “I saw that medicine on your desk the other day, so I called Elder Zhong and asked him what kind of medicine it was.”","Ji Lingfeng did not expect her to remember the medicine with just a glance. She even contacted Zhong Yiliu. For the first time, his handsome face revealed a stunned expression.","Xie Yun: “He told me everything.”","Ji Lingfeng didn’t know how to face her. He looked at her tiredly. “I didn’t want to tell you so you wouldn’t worry.”","Xie Yun wanted to laugh, but the corner of her mouth just twitched. Instead, she asked him, “How long can you last?”","“I don’t know.” Ji Lingfeng smiled. It was a relaxed and liberating smile that rarely appeared on his face. He looked at Xie Yun and said very relaxedly, “Maybe a few days, maybe 10 days, maybe tomorrow...”","Xie Yun suddenly felt as if a rock was pressing down on her chest. She clenched her fists and wished she could slap him, but she held back. “This is why you called these people here today!”","He was running out of time!","Therefore, he had to arrange everything before time ran out.","And everything he had arranged did not include his wife, whom he had lived with for decades, or his biological son.","Xie Yun felt she shouldn’t be angry because she knew from the beginning that they were connected by marriage and not because of feelings. She had been like this all these years.","But at this moment, she realized she was still not as open-minded as she imagined.","“Have you thought about Ji Nan?”","“I’m sorry.”","Xie Yun closed her eyes, pinched her palm, and looked at him again. “What’s the use of apologizing? If I had known this would happen, I wouldn’t have agreed to the family’s arrangements no matter what! I can ignore what my husband is like, but I can’t accept him not even caring about his son! You made up for what you owed Ji Qing in the past, but what about what you owe Ji Nan? What do you have to make up for it?!”","Ji Lingfeng faced her questioning silently. After a long time, he said, “I’ve already decided. I won’t change it.”","Xie Yun stared at him for a few seconds before sneering. Her wildly beating heart could not compare to her anger and resentment. “You’re always like this. That’s why I feel I’ve married the wrong person!”","They were linked by interests and benefits.","However, Ji Lingfeng did not mistreat her.","In the past few decades, they treated each other like guests and lived a more harmonious life than ordinary couples.","However, Xie Yun knew well that this harmony was just tacit cooperation. She had accepted this cooperation in the past, but now she regretted it."]},{"number":3420,"title":"Chapter 3420: You Said It Was a Rumor, It Must Be False","paragraphs":["Ji Lingfeng looked at the red-eyed woman in front of him and the fine lines at the corners of her eyes. He looked away and opened his mouth, but only one sentence came out.","\"I'm sorry.\"","Xie Yun felt a surge of anger rising from the soles of her feet to the top of her head. She wished she could have a big fight with him.","However, she couldn't vent her anger on a dying person.","Tightening her back, she turned around and said coldly, \"Even if I agree, the elders are not easy to deal with. They won't agree with you!","\"Also... you decided on this matter without asking Nian Nian.","\"You think that giving the Ji family to her is the only thing you can do for her and the only way you can make it up to Ji Qing. But you have to be clear that you're not her! She has her own thoughts. You're not being a good uncle by making decisions for her like this.\"","The Ji family had always been domineering.","She knew what kind of person Ji Lingfeng was.","He was doing this for Nian Nian's own good, but did Nian Nian really want the Ji family?","She wasn't saying this for Ji Nan's sake, but from the perspective of an elder. She mentioned it in the hope he would consider it carefully.","\"Back then, in order not to let the people from the reclusive families discover her strength, you didn't hesitate to fall out with her and not let her acknowledge her roots and ancestors, causing both sides to become enemies.","\"Now, you took the initiative to hand the Ji family to her and let her take over your position. You didn't even ask for her opinion from the beginning to the end... I don't think she will appreciate your actions.\"","Xie Yun couldn't be bothered to say more and let out a shaky breath, still not facing him. \"I won't go against you in front of those people, but I hope you can think about what I just told you!\"","After saying that, Xie Yun did not stay to suffer. She opened the door and left without looking back.","Ji Lingfeng was left alone behind the huge desk, deep in thought.","***","The Righteousness Hall.","The elders Ji Lingfeng had called over, including those from the various halls, were all present.","The Righteousness Hall could accommodate 200 people. At this moment, it was filled to the brim. Everyone gathered with familiar people to exchange pleasantries or inquire about what was happening today.","However, whether it was the Ji family's elders or those from the halls, none of them knew why Ji Lingfeng had called them over today.","At this moment, Xie Yun walked into the Righteousness Hall.","The moment she entered, she naturally attracted everyone's attention.","The second and fourth elders were relatively familiar with her and went over to greet her. \"Madam, you're here too.\"","\"Mm.\" Xie Yun walked inside.","Second Elder couldn't hold back and asked her indirectly, \"You just went to see the Patriarch, right? Is the Patriarch alright? There are rumors outside about his... health. I'm a little worried.\"","As he spoke, he constantly paid attention to Xie Yun's expression. He could form a guess as long as something in her expression changed!","However, there was no change in Xie Yun's expression, as if she did not care about what he said.","\"Since when did Second Elder believe in rumors?\" She looked at the shrewd old man in front of her with a faint smile and said coldly, \"There are always rumors about our Ji family outside. It's found to be made up every time. It's the same this time.\"","Second Elder laughed and touched the bridge of his nose. For a moment, he did not know how to continue. \"I've heard too much. I'm relieved since you said that it's nothing.\""]},{"number":3421,"title":"Chapter 3421: You Know My Background Very Well","paragraphs":["Chapter 3421: You Know My Background Very Well","Editor: Atlas Studios","Those in the Righteousness Hall couldn’t continue guessing what would happen next when Xie Yun arrived.","Everyone tacitly shut their mouths and waited for Ji Lingfeng to arrive.","After Xie Yun went in, she found a seat and sat down. He Lin’s men served her a cup of tea. She picked it up and took a sip.","The others couldn’t tell what she was thinking. They exchanged glances and could only give up!","Half an hour later.","Just as everyone in the Hall was getting restless, Ji Lingfeng finally arrived.","“The Patriarch is here!”","“Look, it’s the Patriarch.”","“Finally.”","There was a commotion in the Righteousness Hall.","Only Xie Yun remained sitting. She didn’t even raise her head, as if the person who arrived was irrelevant.","Second Elder looked at her expression and frowned slightly as an uneasy feeling arose in his heart.","However, he couldn’t figure out where his uneasiness came from.","Soon, Ji Lingfeng walked out of the crowd and sat at the head of the table.","Only now did Second Elder, Fourth Elder, and the others realize his bad complexion. The thin bones on his strong face protruded. The others realized it was far from what Xie Yun had said about the rumors outside being fake.","The Patriarch’s current state was visibly serious. As for how serious it was? They couldn’t tell with just a look.","However, it was definitely more complex than being injured and not recovering.","Second Elder considered for a while before breaking the silence. “Patriarch, why did you call us here this time?”","The Righteousness Hall, which had been rustling, instantly fell silent.","All eyes were on the man sitting at the head of the table.","He Lin stood behind Ji Lingfeng and felt his heart tighten when he saw their gazes. He couldn’t help but sweat on the Patriarch’s behalf.","From Second Elder’s attitude, what the Patriarch wanted to do was probably not simple!","Ji Lingfeng placed his hand on the table and, with no change in his mature and tough face, calmly said, “I have something to discuss with everyone.”","“What is it?”","“Patriarch, please speak.”","Many people talked at once.","Most people maintained a cautious attitude and did not talk easily.","Ji Lingfeng’s eagle-like sharp gaze swept across everyone, not stopping at any one of them. His gaze only paused on Xie Yun for a moment before moving away.","The power in his gaze was still there, and many people lowered their heads the moment he looked at them.","Ji Lingfeng did not care. “As you can see, my health is not very good. According to the Ji family’s rules, I have to choose a successor for my position. Who do you think is suitable?”","Second Elder and Fourth Elder looked at each other, seeing surprise and caution in each other’s eyes.","The Patriarch suddenly admitted in public that his health was not good. This was unprecedented! Moreover, the Patriarch mentioned the successor at this time...","Second Elder hesitated before throwing the question back. “Patriarch, do you have a suitable candidate?”","He reckoned that Ji Lingfeng had chosen a suitable candidate. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have brought up this topic.","Sure enough.","Ji Lingfeng didn’t even beat around the bush. “There are two people left in the direct line of descent of the Ji family. One is my son, Ji Nan, and the other is my... niece, Qiao Nian.”","He looked at the elders around the table. “You should know my background very well. Strictly speaking, I’m only half a direct descendant. I can’t even be considered a direct descendant.”"]},{"number":3422,"title":"Chapter 3422: Patriarch, Isn’t This Too risky?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3422: Patriarch, Isn’t This Too risky?","Editor: Atlas Studios","“In the Ji family, only one person is truly qualified to lead the family—Qiao Nian. She’s from an orthodox family, a true direct descendant. In this aspect, Ji Nan is inferior to her.”","Xie Yun’s eyelids twitched. She controlled herself and drank half a cup of tea to suppress the anger in her heart.","However, she still could not control her cold expression.","She really did not expect Ji Lingfeng to mention his background in public for Qiao Nian. He did not hesitate to expose his scars for everyone to see.","Everyone knew that Emperor Ji was an illegitimate child back then!","However, over the years, no one had dared to mention the words ‘illegitimate child’ in front of him, but he had implicitly mentioned it in public today!","Xie Yun took a deep breath and tried to calm her chaotic heartbeat, but in the end, she couldn’t help but look up at the man sitting at the top.","The Righteousness Hall was in an uproar. Everyone was discussing what he had just said.","He was the only one sitting in the center of the storm, as if he had prepared everything and was just waiting for the outcome.","As for the process... he was not afraid even if he was smashed into pieces!","Xie Yun suddenly felt that she didn’t understand this man.","Or rather, they had lived together for decades, but she had never understood him.","Second Elder finally recovered from his shock, and his eyes turned complicated. “Patriarch, you mean... you want Qiao Nian to be the successor?”","“No.” Ji Lingfeng interrupted him. “That’s not what I meant.”","Second Elder frowned. “That is...”","Ji Lingfeng’s large palm brushed across the table. Even though he was ill, his aura was commanding!","In front of everyone, he stated his purpose for today word by word. “I’m not in good health. I’m afraid I don’t have the energy to nurture a successor step by step. Therefore, I called everyone here today to discuss how she can directly take over the Ji family.”","Silence.","It was like a bomb thrown into the ground.","Everyone was stunned.","Including Second Elder and Fourth Elder!","Restrained by his presence, they previously kept their voices lowered and discussed carefully.","But at this moment, they couldn’t control themselves anymore.","“What?! Letting a little girl become our Matriarch? That’s not appropriate!”","“Yes, what does she know? Can she control the Ji family?”","“That’s right! Even if she has some relationship with the First Research Institute, besides being talented in weapons research, she knows nothing about managing a large family! Is the Patriarch crazy? Why would he hand the Ji family over to a little girl?”","This was unheard of in the independent continent. It was even shocking!","The Ji family had suffered consecutive setbacks because of Ji Ziyin’s matter. During this period, their reputation in the independent continent had decreased quite a bit. Even the Chamber of Commerce Alliance and the Hacker Alliance dared to come after them... At this critical juncture with wolves and tigers surrounding them, it was too risky for Ji Lingfeng to suddenly suggest that Qiao Nian take over the Ji family.","At the very least, a few elders disagreed.","Fifth Elder’s expression darkened. He slammed his teacup on the table and rejected it without thinking.","“No! This is against the rules. Moreover, she’s not a member of our family. She isn’t even in the family tree. How can she bypass all the tests and directly take over the family?”","Fourth Elder pondered and frowned at Ji Lingfeng. “Patriarch, isn’t this too risky?”"]},{"number":3423,"title":"Chapter 3423: Emperor Ji Really Wants to Leave Everything to Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Chapter 3423: Emperor Ji Really Wants to Leave Everything to Sister Nian","Editor: Atlas Studios","The Hall Master and the others were not qualified to interrupt a conversation of this level, but most of them stood on the side of the protesting elders. They didn’t approve of Ji Lingfeng’s decision.","Ji Lingfeng didn’t care about these objections at all. He resisted the pressure and leaned back on his seat, his gaze sharp and domineering. “I’ve made up my mind!”","It was non-negotiable!","Fifth Elder didn’t expect him to change so much. Slamming the table, he stood up and waved his hand. “In that case, the Patriarch can make the decision alone. I’m not feeling well. I’ll leave first.”","Among the elders of the Ji family, he was the only straightforward one.","He immediately turned around to leave.","Second Elder and Fourth Elder’s eyebrows twitched. They instinctively felt that something was about to happen and looked at the man sitting at the head of the table.","Sure enough, Ji Lingfeng glanced at the door leisurely. “He Lin, please invite Fifth Elder to sit.”","“Yes, Patriarch.”","The person who had been standing behind as a shadow put his hand in his mouth and whistled. Dozens of armed men in black suddenly appeared at the door, pointing black muzzles at everyone in the Righteousness Hall.","Besides them, snipers could barely be seen in the distance.","Long-range infrared lights appeared on the foreheads of the few main elders and hall masters. They were all aiming at their temples.","As long as Ji Lingfeng gave the order, they would all die here!","At this moment, He Lin arrived in front of Fifth Elder and bowed politely. “Fifth Elder, please take a seat.”","Seeing the guns pointed at him, Fifth Elder momentarily froze. His face was tense as he returned to his seat without saying a word and pulled the chair until it made a scraping sound.","However, these sounds were no more shocking than the sudden appearance of these people at the door.","Under everyone’s panicked gazes, Ji Lingfeng placed his hands on the table and said in the same negotiating tone, “I called everyone here today to discuss this matter. Since this matter hasn’t been discussed, bear with it for now even if anyone feels unwell. If you really can’t take it anymore, I’ve arranged for a doctor next door to examine you on the spot.”","Everyone present no longer dared to show their temper.","Given the current situation, they wouldn’t be surprised even if Ji Lingfeng said he had arranged a funeral service for them next door.","Ji Lingfeng’s gaze swept across the crowd and said domineeringly, “Then... shall we continue?”","Someone quietly took out his cell phone under the table and tried to contact the outside world.","However, this person immediately realized that his cell phone—the only thing they were allowed to bring in—didn’t have a signal. Besides arranging for these armed people, the Patriarch should have cut off the signal to the outside world.","The situation before them was already obvious.","Whether they were willing or not, they had to sit here and discuss the Patriarch’s proposal.","And there was only one outcome—to hand the Ji family to Qiao Nian.","“Is this how you act as the Patriarch?” Fifth Elder’s face darkened. He pulled a long face and said coldly, “Even if you have a candidate in mind, at least everyone is here to discuss. Our goal is for the good of the family, not for outsiders.”","These words couldn’t be said to be harsh.","Ji Lingfeng had been the Patriarch all these years. Besides helping Ji Ziyin, he was basically gentle and respected the elders’ opinions.","He was also willing to ask them for their opinions when he encountered some big matters.","This time, Ji Lingfeng’s methods truly exceeded their expectations. This was also the reason why Fifth Elder was so angry."]},{"number":3424,"title":"Chapter 3424: The Ji Family Is Crazy","paragraphs":["He thought that Ji Lingfeng would at least consider it.","Unexpectedly, Ji Lingfeng's eyes were cold as he softly said, \"Don't you know? The Ji family is crazy to begin with.\"","**","\"How was it? Did you get the message?\"","\"What, there's no signal?\"","\"Why can't I contact him?\"","Those keeping an eye on the Ji family's internal meeting realized that all the spies they had painstakingly found couldn't be contacted.","The Ji family was like an iron bucket that not even a drop of water could flow into.","This situation undoubtedly made those trying to find out about Ji Lingfeng's health extremely anxious.","Even the always-calm Simon had gloomy eyes at this moment. He turned back and asked, \"What exactly is going on with the Ji family?! What is Emperor Ji trying to do? If he just doesn't want outsiders to know about his physical condition, he can just hide like before. Why did he seal off the news after appearing? He can't possibly detain the elders, right?\"","They were collaborating with Second Elder this time.","Actually, it was not really a collaboration. It was just a private deal.","Second Elder promised to reveal some information to them. In return, the Chamber of","Commerce Alliance naturally had to stand on Second Elder's side.","Simon thought he would be able to get first-hand news this time, but who knew that even the respected Second Elder of the Ji family would become uncontactable?","That was why he was so irritable. He really couldn't understand what Ji Lingfeng wanted to do.","There had always been someone in his office.","That person sat on the sofa with his back facing him, with a cup of afternoon tea in front of him. The exquisite porcelain cup was filled with black tea.","Compared to the others pacing anxiously, that person was incomparably calm from the beginning to the end.","\"Ji Lingfeng is not someone to be trifled with.\"","He concluded leisurely, and Simon suddenly appeared in front of him. \"What do you mean?\"","\"Emperor Ji is not called Emperor Ji for nothing.\" That person sneered, with the same attitude as before. \"Since he sealed the news, it means he's either taking the opportunity to clean up the small fishes and shrimps that have been restless in the Ji family recently or... something more important.\"","\"Something more important than cleaning up the Ji family? What is it?\" Simon did not quite understand.","The Ji family's biggest problem right now was that those below were unconvinced by their leader and were starting to develop their own ideas.","Of course, this was a good thing for foreign forces like them.","At the very least, if the Ji family was not united, they could take the opportunity to reap some benefits and weaken the Ji family's strength. Only then would they have a chance to rise.","\"We'll know when we see it,\" the man said meaningfully.","Simon stared at him fiercely for a while.","The man didn't say what it was about. He probably really did not know.","Simon could only tug at his tie and look away in frustration.","\"All we can do is wait.\"","**","Beijing.","In the blink of an eye, it was the day of Zhou Zheng's final trial.","Because Old Master Ye had already informed them, the trial went smoothly and no reporters disturbed them outside.","Zhou Zheng's final verdict came out. It was still the original verdict: 20 years.","Qiao Nian watched as he was escorted to the transport car and sent to prison.","To prevent any accidents on the way, Ye Wangchuan even asked Gu San to keep an eye on the handover at the prison until he confirmed that Zhou Zheng was in jail.","Gu San had just returned with news that Zhou Zheng had been imprisoned.","Qiao Nian had been distracted since she returned from the trial in the morning. Hearing this, she only hummed. She held her cell phone with her eyes lowered, thinking about something."]},{"number":3425,"title":"Chapter 3425: Sister Nian Is Used to Trusting Master Wang to Settle The Loose Ends","paragraphs":["Chapter 3425: Sister Nian Is Used to Trusting Master Wang to Settle The Loose Ends","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan walked over. “What are you thinking about?”","Qiao Nian crossed her legs and played with the lighter, as if she was distraught. “What time is our flight?”","“Three in the afternoon.” Ye Wangchuan sat beside her and handed her water. “Are you worried about the independent continent...”","Qiao Nian took the water from him and did not deny it. “There hasn’t been any news from the Ji family since yesterday. It’s said that Ji Lingfeng hasn’t released them yet. The subordinates of the various halls can’t sit still anymore. They’ve started to wander outside the old residence. Sooner or later, they’ll rush in.”","No one dared to oppose Ji Lingfeng before.","But it was different now.","Ji Lingfeng had been missing for more than half a year due to serious injuries, and his physical condition was still unclear.","Under such circumstances, many people had crooked thoughts and always wanted to take a gamble. Some of the stronger clansmen nursed different thoughts.","It could be said that the current situation was not so optimistic for Ji Lingfeng and the entire Ji family.","“Where’s Ji Nan?” Ye Wangchuan saw she was not drinking the water and rolled up his sleeves. His fingers were long and slender, and his nails were neatly trimmed; they were lustrous and beautiful.","Qiao Nian followed his hands and took another look. Then, she looked up and met his dark eyes. Other than the deepness of the vast starry sky, there was also something reassuring.","She was suddenly less irritable.","Qiao Nian shook off the lighter’s lid and pursed her lips. “He can’t enter either.”","“The old residence has been locked down by Ji Lingfeng’s men. If the people outside want to enter, they can only force their way in! Even Ji Nan can’t enter.”","This was why she felt that something was wrong.","It was fine if outsiders couldn’t enter, but there was no reason why Ji Nan couldn’t enter.","However, the truth was that Ji Lingfeng even stopped Ji Nan from entering. She had no choice but to think about what was going on inside.","Qiao Nian had always disliked being conflicted.","At this thought, she slapped the lighter on the table and looked at the man’s deep eyes. “Bring forward the flight time. I’ll set off immediately.”","There were no flights to the independent continent at this time.","They needed to use the Ye family’s plane.","Private routes needed to be communicated with the tower in advance. They couldn’t just take off.","Ye Wangchuan didn’t say anything else. He stood up and picked up his cell phone. “Wait for me. I’ll confirm the time.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian pulled down her baseball cap. She wanted to thank him but felt it would be too distant.","In the end, she didn’t say anything.","Ye Wangchuan watched as her lips moved, but she did not say anything. The corners of his mouth curled up, and he was in a good mood. He touched the girl’s baseball cap. “Don’t worry, I’ll get it done as soon as possible.”","Qiao Nian wasn’t used to being touched on the head. The main reason was that this action did not suit her. It always made her feel strange and resistant.","However, as Ye Wangchuan’s large hand landed on the top of her head and gently rubbed it, she actually did not feel too disgusted, as if she was already used to his touch.","In the past, this habit seemed ridiculous to her, but now, she did not feel it anymore. It was as if she felt at ease leaving her back to him.","* * *","Half an hour later.","Qiao Nian and the others arrived at the terminal of Beijing International Airport.","Master Cheng still needed looking after, so Gu San stayed behind.","As an idle person, Qin Si was arranged by Gu San to accompany them.","Bo Jingxing was also coming."]},{"number":3426,"title":"Chapter 3426: Departure to the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["Chapter 3426: Departure to the Independent Continent","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, Bo Jingxing was mainly going to the independent continent to deal with something related to the Ninth Branch and was taking a free ride.","This time, Qiao Nian was leaving in a hurry.","She was already at the airport when Old Master Ye and the rest received the news.","Old Master Ye couldn’t make it in time to send her off. He could only call her to remind her to be careful and to take care of herself.","Qiao Nian had never been patient, but she was always more tolerant when dealing with elders.","“Mm, I know.”","“Okay.”","“Mm, I’ll send you a message.”","“Alright, don’t worry.”","Qin Si swayed left and right beside Ye Wangchuan. Seeing the girl on the phone, he couldn’t help but mutter beside Ye Wangchuan.","“Sister Qiao is only obedient at this time. Master Wang, when do you think you can get the same treatment as your Old Master? It seems every time you call Sister Qiao, she doesn’t have the same patience.”","Pulling a 20-inch suitcase, Ye Wangchuan stopped in his tracks and glanced at him from the corner of his eye. “Are you very free?”","It was clearly just a casual question, but Qin Si touched the back of his neck and immediately dodged. “I’ll go buy water in front.”","Bo Jingxing walked over with a smile. “Why are you scaring him?”","“Well, I’ve been hit where it hurts,” Ye Wangchuan replied rather directly.","Bo Jingxing glanced at him.","Ye Wangchuan had on a long autumn windbreaker, a pair of jeans, and riding boots. The zipper was pulled up to the top, revealing his good-looking neck.","At 1.85 meters tall, with his figure and appearance, he looked good even in a sack, let alone a trench coat and riding boots.","In the past, he rarely tried this style, but today, not only did he look more restrained, but he also looked much younger.","At least it looked like a couple’s outfit with Qiao Nian’s black hoodie.","A sly old fox, Bo Jingxing did not hide the teasing in his eyes and patted his shoulder. “Master Wang, you’re not willing to age, huh.”","“Hehe.” Ye Wangchuan pinched his hand off his shoulder and gave a fake smile. “You want to go to Continent F to mine with Mo Xi too?”","As expected, Bo Jingxing was scalded. He did the same thing as Qin Si—touched the back of his cold neck and quickly slipped away. “I’ll go see why Qin Si isn’t here yet.”","* * *","Qiao Nian happened to finish her call and saw Bo Jingxing leaving in a hurry.","She slowed down and walked alongside the man. “Where did they go?”","Ye Wangchuan smiled. “They have a stomachache.”","“Mm?”","Two people having a stomachache at the same time?","Before Qiao Nian could wrap her head around it, the man asked her, “What did Old Master say?”","Qiao Nian returned to her senses and pulled down the zipper on her collar before casually saying, “It’s nothing. He just wants me to take care of myself and tell him if anything happens.”","Ye Wangchuan said, “Ignore him. He likes to nag.”","Qiao Nian looked at him and paused before saying good-naturedly, “I think it’s quite nice.”","Ye Wangchuan looked at the slightly raised corner of her. The warm smile in her dark eyes was genuine, completely different from her usual surly, arrogant, and unconvinced smile.","He couldn’t help but pause.","The smile only flashed across Qiao Nian’s face. She wasn’t used to being stared at like this.","She pulled up her collar and rubbed her face before striding forward. “Let’s go. We’re in a hurry.”"]},{"number":3427,"title":"Chapter 3427: Alright, I’ll Help You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3427: Alright, I’ll Help You","Editor: Atlas Studios","40 minutes later.","Their plane set off and headed to the independent continent.","The plane slowly disappeared into the clouds, leaving only the traces of birds flying across the sky...","**","At the Ji residence.","After a night of confrontation, most of those in the Righteousness Hall couldn’t hold on any longer. They hadn’t slept the entire night, causing bruises to appear under their eyelids. They were visibly exhausted.","However, the people and weapons blocking them from leaving were still there. They could only stay, whether they were willing or not.","Yet, neither the elders nor the hall masters who controlled the Ji family’s main hall were willing to sign the document that Ji Lingfeng had given them.","The two sides were in a deadlock.","They did not sleep.","Ji Lingfeng did not sleep the entire night either and stayed with them.","Seconds ticked by.","There was no trace of fatigue on Ji Lingfeng’s mature and steady face. It was as if he was the only person here who would not get tired.","“How is it? Have you thought about it?”","A few hall masters loyal to Ji Lingfeng and the Ji family’s direct descendants had already signed their names and stamped their fingerprints on the documents.","He Lin settled them down next door.","Although they still couldn’t leave, they could at least get a room to rest. They didn’t have to continue staring at each other in the Righteousness Hall.","The others were not so lucky. Moreover, Ji Lingfeng didn’t let them eat or drink anything.","Everyone just sat there.","The older elders were already famished. Their eyes were blurry, but they were still unwilling to lower their heads.","Fifth Elder was one of them.","He had a strong personality and would rather break than bend. He was very dissatisfied with Ji Lingfeng’s forceful methods.","Hence, after Ji Lingfeng spoke, he snorted coldly. “Since the Patriarch is already aiming at us, why don’t you just give the order to shoot? This way, we don’t need to agree. You can make the decision alone!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Second Elder, sitting not far away from him, cursed in his heart.","Sure enough.","Ji Lingfeng’s face was emotionless as he turned to look at him. “Is that what you think?”","Fifth Elder had yet to realize the danger. His expression was cold as he faced him rudely. “Am I wrong to say that?”","“No, you’re right.” Ji Lingfeng nodded as if he had understood him. He raised his hand and called He Lin over. “I’ll fulfill Fifth Elder’s wish.”","He said it so casually.","Everyone’s expressions changed.","Fifth Elder’s eyes widened in disbelief as he exhaled through his nose. He slammed the table and stood up, his face ashen.","“You!”","The others quickly put out the fire.","“Alright, alright. Fifth Elder, stop fooling around with the Patriarch.”","“That’s right. Don’t say so much.”","“Fifth Elder, the Patriarch is joking with you. Sit down quickly.”","The people in the Righteousness Hall tried to persuade him.","They knew that they were not only trying to persuade Fifth Elder not to court death but also afraid that Fifth Elder’s actions would completely anger Ji Lingfeng and intensify the conflict.","“Who told you I was joking?” Ji Lingfeng had been the Patriarch of the Ji family for decades, after all. He wouldn’t be led by the nose.","His cold words were like a slap to everyone’s face as they advised Fifth Elder not to cause trouble.","Second Elder, Fourth Elder, and the others’ expressions were bad."]},{"number":3428,"title":"Chapter 3428: Uncle Is Too Crazy","paragraphs":["Chapter 3428: Uncle Is Too Crazy","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ji Lingfeng didn’t look at them. He lowered his eyes and said in a low voice, “He Lin, do you want me to repeat myself?!”","He Lin closed his eyes. He knew that the Patriarch had made up his mind. Without hesitation, he gestured towards the people outside.","“Hmph!” Fifth Elder thought Ji Lingfeng was trying to scare him and didn’t think much of it. He didn’t move and allowed the red laser beam to aim at his head.","He even pointed at his temple and challenged Ji Lingfeng angrily, “If the Patriarch wants to fight, let them come down here. Don’t attack my hands and feet! I’m an old man. From the Old Patriarch’s time till now, the only thing I’ve never been afraid of is death!”","Ji Lingfeng uttered, “Okay.”","Then, the dull sound of a silenced gun was heard.","A small red flower bloomed on Fifth Elder’s temple, and he fell back in disbelief.","All of this happened too quickly.","There were no signs at all.","Most people still thought that Ji Lingfeng was trying to intimidate them. At most, he would shoot Fifth Elder as a warning and not really kill him.","Warm blood splattered on the faces and bodies of the people around Fifth Elder. They suddenly looked at the man sitting at the head of the table in shock.","Ji Lingfeng was still sitting in the same posture as yesterday. His expression did not change as he told them coldly, “My time is limited.”","Second Elder watched helplessly as the person he had worked with for decades fell before him. He was unable to regain his senses for a long time. He trembled as he looked at Ji Lingfeng in disbelief. “Patriarch, are you crazy?! The Ji family’s vitality will be greatly damaged. When the time comes, it won’t be...”","The Ji family had grown from Ji Wusun’s hands. For so long, they had been a unique existence in the independent continent, surpassing every other faction.","Therefore, every Patriarch of the Ji family was named Emperor Ji.","What was an Emperor?","It meant being the Emperor of the independent continent.","Ji Lingfeng did not hesitate to weaken the Ji family’s strength for Qiao Nian to inherit the family. He was really crazy! Completely crazy!","“If I can’t give her a complete Ji family, I can at least give her a clean Ji family.”","Silence.","Second Elder inhaled a breath of cold air, chilling his throat, heart, and lungs. His fingertips were still trembling. Other than the initial inconceivable shock, he calmed down a little and recalled what Ji Lingfeng had said. “The Ji family is crazy to begin with.”","He suddenly thought of the old patriarch.","The old patriarch was also such a person. He only cared about following his wishes and never cared about rules and ethics.","The direct descendants of the Ji family... were indeed lunatics.","The blood of the Ji family’s direct descendants flowed in their veins.","Ji Lingfeng did not give them too much time to think. His eagle eyes scanned everyone’s faces and his tone was very calm.","“Who’s next?”","Silence.","Previously, these hall masters and elders still wanted to waste time with him. Now, no one dared to have such thoughts anymore. It was as if an invisible saber was hanging above everyone’s heads. They didn’t know when the saber would descend and make them lie on the ground like Fifth Elder.","“Patriarch...” A hall master couldn’t stand this atmosphere. He raised a trembling hand and swallowed his saliva under everyone’s gaze. “I’ll sign.”","Ji Lingfeng gave him a look.","He Lin immediately sent the brush and ink pad over and placed them in front of him.","The hall master quickly signed and stamped his fingerprint. Then, He Lin led him to the next room to rest.","Ji Lingfeng ignored them and looked at the rest of the people in the Righteousness Hall.","“What about you? Do you want me to take attendance one by one?”"]},{"number":3429,"title":"Chapter 3429: Xie Yun: I Don’t Object","paragraphs":["Chapter 3429: Xie Yun: I Don’t Object","Editor: Atlas Studios","The Righteousness Hall was dead silent.","No one dared to make a sound.","Who the hell dared to go against Ji Lingfeng!","Second Elder, Fourth Elder, and the remaining hall masters who had not signed their names looked at the two men in black who entered the hall and dragged Fifth Elder’s body out, leaving a wide and long trail of blood on the ground.","Just looking at it caused their hearts to skip a beat.","At this moment, Ji Lingfeng repeated, “My patience is limited.”","It was a simple sentence, but the eyes of everyone in the Righteousness Hall twitched in fear.","Fortunately, Second Elder had seen the world and calmed down shortly. He stood up and met Ji Lingfeng’s murderous gaze. “Patriarch, can you give us some time to discuss?”","Ji Lingfeng narrowed his eyes. He neither agreed nor disagreed.","Second Elder remained calm under his substantive gaze and said reasonably, “We didn’t plan to agree to Qiao Nian taking over the Ji family previously. Now that we have to consider it, you should at least give us time to discuss it.”","Ji Lingfeng was still unmoved. “Time is limited, Second Elder.”","Second Elder knew it wouldn’t be so easy to convince him. He threw out his trump card and looked at him sincerely. “Patriarch, you don’t want to give Qiao Nian an incomplete Ji family, right? We just need some time to discuss...”","Ji Lingfeng’s eagle-like eyes scrutinized his face.","Second Elder did not move, afraid that if he made a small mistake, he would end up like Fifth Elder.","Fortunately, his last sentence did move Ji Lingfeng.","When he was about to collapse, Ji Lingfeng retracted his gaze and stood up. “I’ll give you an hour.”","One hour...","The saber hanging above everyone’s heads did not fall for the time being. Everyone secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","Ji Lingfeng stayed with them for the entire night and the entire morning. His complexion was bad, and his face and lips were pale.","But he was unyielding and did not show any discomfort.","However, when it was time to take his medicine, he said to the people in the Righteousness Hall, “I’ll come over in an hour. I hope you’ve thought it through by then.”","Everyone was glad that Ji Lingfeng was willing to give them an hour to catch their breath.","Only Xie Yun looked in his direction differently. Seeing his painful frown, she silently looked away.","...","Ji Lingfeng went out.","The strong compulsion that had been hanging above the Righteousness Hall finally disappeared.","Second Elder seized the time and immediately looked at the only person who could change the situation. “Madam, what do you think about the Patriarch handing the Ji family over to Qiao Nian?”","He was a smart person.","After all, according to the rules, the Ji family should be handed over to Ji Lingfeng’s only son, Ji Nan, to inherit in the future. Ji Lingfeng’s sudden decision to give the entire Ji family to Qiao Nian undoubtedly ate into Ji Nan’s share of the pie.","With Xie Yun’s character, she couldn’t agree so easily.","As long as Xie Yun was willing to help them stall for time, based on Xie Yun and Ji Lingfeng’s decades of relationship as husband and wife, the Patriarch would definitely not deal with them as he did with Fifth Elder.","His goal was to stall.","They could drag it out until their people on the outside couldn’t wait any longer and broke in. That way, the situation could be reversed! They could also have more control.","Second Elder’s expression and tone were anxious.","Xie Yun calmly drank a cup of tea. She lowered her eyes and did not show any emotions.","Her reply was unexpected. “I don’t object.”","Second Elder was stunned.","If Xie Yun didn’t object, did that not mean she agreed?"]},{"number":3430,"title":"Chapter 3430: The Situation Is Not Optimistic","paragraphs":["Chapter 3430: The Situation Is Not Optimistic","Editor: Atlas Studios","She agreed to let Ji Lingfeng leave everything in the Ji family to Qiao Nian?","Second Elder looked at the graceful and noble lady, unable to make a sound for a long time. This was too ridiculous!","Xie Yun only had one son, Ji Nan. Was she not going to fight for her son?","However, no matter how he tried to persuade her, Xie Yun remained unmoved. It was as if she knew what Ji Lingfeng wanted to do from the beginning and was on his side.","In the end, Second Elder was powerless to persuade her. He simply gave up on trying and could only discuss it with the other elders.","Xie Yun’s identity was special.","Besides a few elders, the hall masters did not dare to approach her. Everyone was discussing a solution, but they ostracized her.","Xie Yun did not care about being isolated. She looked in the direction where Ji Lingfeng had just left, rubbed her fingers against the edge of the cup, and sighed.","She had consulted Elder Zhong about the medicine. Calculating the time, he should have gone to take it.","That medicine...","Xie Yun gritted her teeth and forced herself not to think about it.","* * *","An hour passed in the blink of an eye.","The people from the Righteousness Hall thought that Ji Lingfeng would return on time and make them sign the document.","They still had not made up their minds to sign, so they were uneasy, afraid that the murderous man would come again.","However, half an hour passed, and there was still no sign of Ji Lingfeng.","The Righteousness Hall became noisy.","“Didn’t he say an hour? Why isn’t the Patriarch here yet?”","“I don’t know. Could something have happened to him?”","“Outside...”","Someone lowered his voice and mentioned the outside.","Xie Yun couldn’t even be bothered to look, but her heart was in a mess. She suppressed her worry and did not ask He Lin to bring her to her husband.","She had been with this man for decades and knew how dangerous it was this time.","Ji Lingfeng used the excuse of a meeting to call these people to the old residence. If he didn’t succeed in convincing these people according to the plan this time...","There was a good chance they would bite back when they were set free.","The direct line of descent was not the only one in the Ji family who could make decisions. How many stories of displaced power had they heard of since the start of time?","If these people discovered that Ji Lingfeng’s body had reached its limit, they would definitely drag it out at all costs until Ji Lingfeng was exhausted.","At that time... no one knew what the Ji family would be like!","Xie Yun completely ignored the discussions in the Righteousness Hall. Her face turned pale and she clenched her fists tightly. The veins on the back of her hand bulged.","Originally, no one noticed it.","However, Second Elder was a meticulous person.","He felt that something was wrong since Ji Lingfeng didn’t appear after such a long time. Thinking of Xie Yun, he subconsciously looked over and saw her subconsciously clenching her fists.","His eyebrows twitched as if he had guessed something. He immediately looked away and pursed his lips. He had a vague guess in his heart.","**","There was also a commotion outside the old residence.","The people from various halls did not see their hall master come out after such a long time, and they couldn’t hold it in anymore.","The person from the third hall in the south was the first to step forward. He glanced at the people from the other halls and said with a straight face, “Our hall master hasn’t come out after a day and a night. Who wants to follow me in to take a look?”","“That’s not good, right?” The others were still afraid of the main family and did not dare to barge into the old residence.","The stubbled man who was the first to speak was not so conscious, and he said coldly, “Hmph! You might not dare, but we can’t care so much.”"]},{"number":3431,"title":"Chapter 3431: Come, Someone Shoot Me","paragraphs":["Chapter 3431: Come, Someone Shoot Me","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Our hall is filled with brothers who have gone through life and death together. The hall master has helped me many times. I don’t care who the Patriarch of the Ji family is. I only recognize our hall master! The hall master has been in there for so long and hasn’t come out. Anyone with a brain would know that something is wrong. Today, I have to go in and confirm the hall master’s safety even if I have to risk my life.”","The main branch of the Ji family was located in the north. It was more traditional and had more rules.","The southern halls were not so particular. Everyone relied on their abilities to survive. Whoever was better would climb up.","This also led to the southern halls’ ability and efficiency. However, these people were not so loyal and were even a bit arrogant.","If nothing had happened to Ji Lingfeng in the past, these people would never have dared to be impudent.","However, Ji Lingfeng had disappeared for half a year after his accident. A few elders had been unjustly helping to deal with the family’s matters and had their own plans. As a result, the southern halls were no longer as obedient and gradually showed signs of breaking away from the Ji family’s control.","This was also the first person from the southern gate to stand up and say they wanted to barge into the old residence.","Just as the others were silently and secretly thinking about something...","A royal blue sports car screeched through the crowd and stopped outside the old residence. The window rolled down, revealing a handsome young face.","Who else could it be but Ji Nan?","He took his car keys and got out of the car.","He came alone with a strong aura. He glanced at everyone at the hall’s entrance and pursed his lips. His gaze was quite cold. “What are you guys trying to do?”","The entire place was silent.","The man who shouted he wanted to barge in to make sure his boss was safe was also stunned. He didn’t expect Ji Nan to come at this juncture and even block the door with his car.","“Young Master Nan.”","Ji Nan wrapped his fingers around the keychain and did not waste his breath on them. He leaned on the car. “You can go in if you want.”","Then, he made a shooting gesture at his head. “Come on, anyone who shoots me can go in.”","The few people in charge looked at each other in shock.","Who the f*ck would dare!","Ji Nan was Ji Lingfeng’s only son.","Whoever did that would have to face Ji Lingfeng and Xie Yun’s crazy revenge in the future.","They wanted to barge in to investigate the situation.","However, that did not mean they wanted to report to the King of Hell.","As expected, that person stiffened. His face twitched as he squeezed out a smile that was uglier than crying. “Young Master Nan, are you making things difficult for us?”","“You don’t dare?” Ji Nan looked straight at him.","The man’s expression changed. He was angry, but he did not dare to do anything. The corners of his mouth curled up, and he could not smile anymore.","Ji Nan looked like Qiao Nian when he flew into a rage. Not wanting to argue with the other party, he calmly looked away. “Then wait here with me!”","The wind was quite strong at the end of September, so the weather was not very good.","At the very least, it was cloudless yesterday, but today, it was so gloomy that it looked like it was going to rain. In this kind of weather where the clouds hung low, people would always feel inexplicably frustrated, especially now.","Those at the hall’s entrance looked at Ji Nan blocking the way. They felt suffocated, angry, and frustrated, but no one could think of a solution at the moment.","Ji Nan pretended not to see their vicious gazes.","He knew very well that even if he blocked them here, he wouldn’t be able to stall for long.","These people wouldn’t give up just because of him.","The more time passed, the more suspicious they became, and the more they wanted to barge in.","But he could only take a gamble!","He was gambling with his life!","He was betting he could drag it out until the dust settled inside."]},{"number":3432,"title":"Chapter 3432: Close Call","paragraphs":["Chapter 3432: Close Call","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Patriarch.” After hearing his subordinate’s hurried report, He Lin supported the middle-aged man who had yet to recover from the medicine’s effects and hesitantly said, “Young Master Nan is here.”","Ji Lingfeng’s forehead was drenched in sweat. His eyes were filled with pain, and his lips had turned a blackish-purple.","His emotions fluctuated at He Lin’s report, causing his lungs to itch.","Ji Lingfeng opened his eyes and pounced forward. With a muffled cough, he grabbed the towel and caught what came out of his throat.","Black blood ran through the wet towel between his fingers.","He Lin was shocked and quickly supported him. “Patriarch, don’t get agitated. There’s water on the table. Please moisten your throat.”","How could Ji Lingfeng calm down? After the pain in his lungs barely subsided, he looked at He Lin with eagle eyes. “Why is he here?!”","“Young Master Nan might have heard something from Madam.” He Lin didn’t know why Ji Nan was here either.","Based on his understanding of Madam, she wouldn’t let Young Master Nan get involved in danger. In other words, it was more likely that Ji Nan had guessed the situation and came here himself.","He Lin didn’t want Ji Lingfeng to continue feeling terrible, but he still had to report the situation outside to the Patriarch. “Young Master Nan came alone and blocked the hall’s entrance outside. He even said... said...”","Ji Lingfeng felt like a huge wooden hammer was ruthlessly hitting his head. His head buzzed, and he could only clench his fists and barely maintain his composure. He stared at He Lin with his eagle-like eyes. “What did he say?”","He Lin subconsciously lowered his head. “Young Master Nan said that anyone who wants to enter has to step over his corpse.”","“Heh!” It was unclear whether Ji Lingfeng was happy or angry. “He’s not afraid of death.”","He Lin didn’t dare to look at his current expression. The current situation was indeed too hostile to them. He stared at his toes hesitantly. “Patriarch, why don’t... we slow down first?”","Those people at the entrance weren’t the elders, especially those from the Southern Hall. They were all people who had survived through bloodshed.","They weren’t the same kind of people as what Young Master Nan knew.","There was nothing these people couldn’t do.","What if...","He Lin didn’t dare to think further.","Ji Lingfeng shut his eyes tightly to calm down and think about how to deal with this mess. Ignoring the pain, he forced himself to stand up. “Let’s go to the Righteousness Hall.”","He knew the current situation better than He Lin.","There was no turning back.","There was no way back for him from the moment he made this decision. The only way to save Ji Nan now wasn’t to let go, but to make those people quickly lower their heads!","**","Such a huge commotion happened at the entrance of the Ji family’s old residence.","It was impossible for the other factions of the independent continent not to know.","The various factions grew restless upon seeing Ji Nan blocking the door. When Ji Lingfeng still did not appear, they guessed his situation wasn’t good.","The internal strife within the Ji family was obvious.","Everyone wanted to take this opportunity to take their share of the loot.","Then, how could they do that? Of course, they had to make the situation as chaotic as possible.","For example, if Ji Nan had an ‘accident’ in front of everyone, wouldn’t the Ji family be in chaos?","If someone wanted to do something, they would do it.","Of course, the core members of the Ji family’s various halls wouldn’t easily touch Ji Nan. However, they weren’t the only ones around, some inconspicuous characters were also at the hall.","As the stalemate outside the old residence grew longer and longer, the halls’ assistants couldn’t hold back their tempers.","Their attitude towards Ji Nan became more and more unyielding.","Some people even started to threaten him.","“Young Master Nan, if you continue to cause trouble like this, our brothers won’t be able to spoil you anymore.”"]},{"number":3433,"title":"Chapter 3433: Sister Nian Arrived in Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 3433: Sister Nian Arrived in Time","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ji Nan leaned against the car and played with his cell phone with his head lowered. He was indifferent and had the same attitude as before. “If you have the guts, run over me.”","This attitude couldn’t be said to be arrogant.","Veins bulged on the deputies’ foreheads. They were furious with him.","“What do we do?”","A tattooed man from the third hall in the south gritted his teeth and turned to speak to the assistants from the other halls. “The hall master and the others are still inside. We can’t be stopped here by him.”","Those from the northern halls were all from the Ji family branch. They were more or less related to the main branch by blood. They looked at Ji Nan hesitantly. “But Young Master Nan is blocking the way. We can’t attack him.”","“So we just stand here and watch?!” The tattooed man was dissatisfied with this answer and questioned coldly and stiffly.","Just as he was at his wits’ end—","Suddenly, someone stepped forward.","“Vice Hall Master, I’ll go!”","Everyone’s gazes landed on him.","The man in his 30s was dressed in the clothes of the southern halls. Thin and not tall, there were dark circles under his eyes.","“Who is this?” The deputy of the northern halls was stunned. He didn’t know who this was.","The tattooed man was also stunned. He looked at the thin monkey who walked out of the crowd and frowned. “Why did you stand out?”","The thin monkey’s eyes flickered with a light that no one could understand as he spoke in a low voice, “Vice Hall Master, I know it won’t be easy for you to deal with Young Master Ji. I’m indebted to the Hall Master. I’ll do it if it’s inconvenient for you!”","He spoke righteously and continued to walk forward.","The tattooed man’s eyebrows twitched and he grabbed his arm. “What are you trying to do!”","The recklessness of the people in the southern halls did not mean they were brainless.","He knew better than anyone that whoever made a move now would have to bear the consequences.","He wanted Ji Nan to move aside, but he did not want his hall—the third southern hall—to be the one risking themselves.","However, the usually taciturn skinny monkey seemed possessed this time. He pulled away from him, impulsively pulled out his gun, and rushed forward.","“Vice Hall Master, let me solve your problem!”","“Stop it!”","The tattooed man cursed and quickly tried to stop him.","However, everything happened too suddenly.","No one expected that an insignificant character from a hall in the south would come out to kill Ji Nan. None of the hundred or so people present could react.","Ji Nan raised his head upon hearing them arguing. Only then did he realize that the muzzle’s dark hole was facing his heart.","He wouldn’t be able to dodge in time at such a close distance.","* * *","At the same time.","“Sister Qiao, look.”","In a black SUV, Qin Si’s sharp eyes captured the dangerous situation not far away. He was so frightened that he paled. He pointed in that direction and alerted the girl.","Qiao Nian tilted her head and looked over.","Almost instinctively, she pulled out her gun and instructed the driver in a low and hoarse voice, “Do you know how to brake and swing the tail?”","“Sure.”","Who else could it be but Ye Wangchuan?","He placed his left hand on the steering wheel, still calm even in such an emergency.","“Drive through!”","Qiao Nian calculated the distance and pursed her lips, completely trusting him with her safety. “Block Ji Nan from the front.”","Ye Wangchuan didn’t even bother to answer this time. He stepped on the accelerator, and the SUV’s back wheels kicked up dust as it rushed towards the crowd.","“Gosh, there’s—”","“Car! Dodge!”","“Where did this crazy person come from?”","The SUV carrying Qiao Nian and the rest rushed from the back."]},{"number":3434,"title":"Chapter 3434: Sister Nian: Who Does He Work For?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3434: Sister Nian: Who Does He Work For?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan stepped on the accelerator and dispersed the people blocking the old residence’s entrance.","He stared at Ji Nan at the door without blinking. His slender fingers operated the steering wheel, not looking at the people dodging to all sides.","The moment that person fired, the black SUV completed a beautiful 180° turn and braked. Using the tires’ friction, it swung its tail and perfectly blocked in front of Ji Nan.","Almost at the same time, the car door near Qin Si’s seat shook. He looked down and saw the vortex created by the bullets at the door. He was so shocked that he broke out in a cold sweat.","F*ck, Master Wang was risking his life!","Most importantly, he was playing with his life. He was scared to death.","Qiao Nian wasn’t idle. As the car swerved and the people inside swayed unsteadily, she lowered the brim of her cap and aimed at the wrist of the person holding the gun. White smoke came out of her mini pistol’s muzzle as a bullet shot out.","“Ah!” The man cried out in pain.","His hand holding the gun was hit, and it fell to the ground with a thud, leaving him no chance to fire a second shot.","Qiao Nian unbuckled her seatbelt and got out of the car with a gun in hand, looking insufferably arrogant in her hoodie.","Even though she was standing there alone, she still exuded the aura of an army.","“Who else wants to try?”","The entire place fell silent.","Qin Si had just recovered from the scare when he saw the girl shoot and get out of the car in one go.","He couldn’t help but smack his lips, his eyes shining. “Damn, Sister Qiao is so suave!”","It wasn’t just him.","Even Bo Jingxing’s gaze lingered on Qiao Nian as he politely said, “Oh, no wonder Master Wang likes her.”","Good love was never about accommodating, but about compatibility.","Qiao Nian didn’t care about them. She scanned the crowd, her cold eyes exuding an aggressive aura.","Her red lips curled up, cold and dry. “I say, who else wants to cause trouble? I’m here now. If anyone is unhappy, you can come and talk to me.","“I’ll play with you to the end!”","Someone in the crowd recognized her.","“Q-Qiao Nian?”","An uproar ensued!","“It’s her? That Qiao Nian from the First Research Institute? Feng Yu’s heir.”","“Didn’t she refuse to return to the Ji family? Why is she here?”","“Why is she here...”","The girl ignored the commotion and leaned against the car as she lowered her head and took a silver lighter from her pocket.","Seeing that no one came forward, the corners of her eyes were slightly raised. They were quite beautiful, but they were too ostentatious and surly. “No one’s coming forward, right?”","Everyone fell silent again.","Most of the people present had heard the rumors about her.","A year ago, no one took this outsider seriously. But, after Ji Ziyin’s tragic failure, many people knew she wasn’t to be trifled with.","The forces behind her were very complicated.","It could be related to the illegal area, Continent F, and other places.","This was terrifying.","After all, Qiao Nian was only 20 years old. At this age, her background was already unfathomable. Plus, she was ruthless and domineering. Who would dare to provoke her?","Seeing no one was saying anything, Qiao Nian pointed at the man wailing on the ground.","“Who does he work for?”","Everyone’s gaze fell on the tattooed man.","The tattooed man felt a chill down his spine. He had no choice but to step forward. “He’s from our third hall, but there’s a misunderstanding... I don’t know why he suddenly attacked Young Master Nan. It’s definitely not our intention.”"]},{"number":3435,"title":"Chapter 3435: I’ll Leave the Outside to You. I’ll Go In and Take a Look","paragraphs":["Chapter 3435: I’ll Leave the Outside to You. I’ll Go In and Take a Look","Editor: Atlas Studios","In this matter, the tattooed man felt that he had been wronged. His tone was filled with depression and grievance.","Who knew what went wrong with Skinny Monkey?","He suddenly rushed out to attack Ji Nan.","No matter how arrogant and impulsive he was, he knew Ji Nan couldn’t be touched. At the very least, they could not be the ones to make a move!","This was awkward.","Fortunately, Young Master Nan was fine. Otherwise, his hall wouldn’t be able to explain themselves today.","Qiao Nian played with her lighter and looked thoughtfully at the person wailing on the ground, then at the tattooed man explaining gloomily.","As the tattooed man anxiously tried to explain, she simply said, “Then it’s a mole.”","A mole?","The tattooed man’s eyebrows jumped. His fierce gaze landed on the skinny man rolling on the ground with shock.","Qiao Nian didn’t waste her breath on him. She put away her lighter and turned around to say, “Investigate your hall’s matter yourself.”","The third hall was the strongest among the southern halls. Otherwise, as a deputy, he wouldn’t dare to threaten Ji Nan openly.","At this moment, his face alternated between green and red, and he couldn’t help but ask the girl, “May I ask, in what capacity are you here?”","This was also what everyone present wanted to ask.","Everyone was looking at Qiao Nian.","Ji Nan had just recovered from his shock and stepped forward to check on Qiao Nian and see if she was injured.","Coincidentally, he heard the tattooed man’s question.","With her hands in her pockets, the girl turned her head and said coldly, “Don’t you know that the Ji family Patriarch’s Seal is in my hands?”","Instant kill with just one sentence!","She didn’t need any status. She could interfere in all matters as long as the seal was in her hands!","The Patriarch Seal represented the Patriarch’s authority.","Even Ji Lingfeng had never obtained this seal.","Qiao Nian’s eyelashes fell, and her eyes were cold. Not wanting to waste more time with them, she turned around and said to the man who had always been standing beside her, “I’ll leave the outside to you. I’ll go inside and take a look.”","She was anxious to confirm Ji Lingfeng’s physical condition.","Ye Wangchuan nodded in understanding. He had already finished the call. “Don’t worry, I’ve called for reinforcements.”","Mo Dong’s people would soon arrive and take over for He Lin’s men. With the Bright Gate’s people around, no one could force their way in today.","Qiao Nian looked at him deeply but did not say anything. She called Ji Nan and strode into the old residence.","He Lin’s men were still watching the entrance. Someone suddenly attacked Ji Nan, and they couldn’t react in time.","Seeing that Qiao Nian was about to enter, someone instinctively stopped her.","“Miss Qiao, you can’t go in. The Patriarch said—”","“Get out of the way!”","Qiao Nian looked at him with dark and cold eyes, with not one bit of patience left.","The men cowered and took a step back when she stared at them. Their foreheads glistened with sweat. “Miss Qiao, you really can’t go in—”","Although they said that, no one dared to block her anymore.","Qiao Nian looked at the path they opened for her and said to Ji Nan, “Follow me in.”","Ji Nan knew that if she had not arrived in time just now, he would have been shot dead.","He pursed his lips and followed her in.","**","“What? Bright Gate’s people are here?”","“Why is Bright Gate involving themselves? Haven’t they always been loners, not participating in the division of the various factions in the independent continent? Could they also want a share of the loot this time?”","“Check again!”","“I must find out Bright Gate’s intentions!”"]},{"number":3436,"title":"Chapter 3436: Why Did Qiao Nian Intervene in the Ji family’s Muddy Waters?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3436: Why Did Qiao Nian Intervene in the Ji family’s Muddy Waters?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Simon turned off the phone. His well-maintained, handsome face revealed a rare look of frustration. He walked back to the guest sofa in the office and looked down at the young man who came looking for him. His eyes were as sharp as a poisonous snake, as if he could bite the man’s neck in the next second.","“What did you tell me previously? It was you who told me that this was a good opportunity to divide up the Ji family. That’s why I listened to you and took the risk to use my mole to kill Ji Nan... Now, Ji Nan is not dead and the mole has been captured. If he confesses, you know the consequences the Chamber of Commerce Alliance will have to bear!”","Simon gripped the cell phone tightly, the bulging blood vessels on the back of his hand revealing his irritable mood.","He was in a bad mood.","The Chamber of Commerce Alliance had offended too many people in the past two years.","Previously, they were dragged down once by taking Ji Ziyin’s side, causing them to suffer severe losses. If he failed again this time... he was afraid the dissatisfaction within the alliance would exacerbate!","“Are you toying with me?”","At this thought, Simon’s blue eyes were no longer as gentle and easy-going as usual, revealing the sharpness of a superior.","The young man was much calmer than Simon imagined faced with anger. He swirled the wine glass in his hand and was even in the mood to laugh. “President Simon, relax.”","Simon looked at him coldly.","The young man took a sip of wine and looked at Simon’s furious face. He shrugged his shoulders and put down the wine glass before casually saying, “You aren’t a fool. You used a fake identity when you interacted with that person back then. You only used the debt he owed from gambling to force him to work for you.","“Look, even if he’s caught, the Ji family won’t be able to get any useful information from him, much less find out about you. You’re just losing a pawn. What are you worrying about?”","Simon frowned and said coldly, “You don’t know anything!”","That Qiao Nian was evil.","Of course, he knew that his way of handling things was foolproof, but if Qiao Nian interfered, he couldn’t guarantee he wouldn’t be caught, and he might even end up dragging the entire Chamber of Commerce Alliance into it.","The young man looked at him quietly and smiled before saying, “Since you’re worried, I’ll help you get rid of this problem.”","Simon narrowed his eyes at him. “What do you want to do?”","“Only the living can tell secrets. The dead won’t speak.” The young man grabbed a cigarette from the table and lit it as if he was talking about an item. “I have to show you some sincerity, right? Otherwise, how can our cooperation continue?”","“You can...?” Simon clearly did not believe he could still make a move at this juncture.","However, the young man seemed to know the situation on the independent continent very well. His slender fingers brushed away the ashes of his cigarette and he smiled. “If that person falls into her or Bright Gate’s hands, I really won’t be able to do anything.","“However, you’re lucky. Qiao Nian doesn’t have time to care about such a small matter. It’ll be easy to hand that person over to the people at the hall’s entrance for questioning.”","Simon relaxed. He clearly believed him.","The young man stared at the scarlet cigarette butt, but there was no smile in his eyes. He clicked his tongue and stood up to extinguish the fire in the ashtray, then said to Simon, “Wait for my good news.”","Simon could only place his hopes on him. He didn’t send him off and just watched him leave his office, still thinking about why Qiao Nian had returned and why she had interfered in the Ji family’s mess..."]},{"number":3437,"title":"Chapter 3437: Both Sides Have Fallen Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 3437: Both Sides Have Fallen Out","Editor: Atlas Studios","The gunshots outside alarmed the people in the old residence.","Everyone in the Righteousness Hall had their own thoughts.","Ji Lingfeng sat in his seat and looked around. “Elders, have you figured it out?”","Silence.","Second Elder and Fourth Elder exchanged glances but didn’t say anything.","Ji Lingfeng’s lips were pale. It was as if he knew that they wouldn’t compromise so easily. His gaze landed on the people at the entrance.","“What about you guys?”","Silence.","Everyone lowered their heads to avoid his gaze.","Silence was the answer.","The entire Righteousness Hall was so quiet that one could hear a pin drop.","“Heh.” Ji Lingfeng’s complexion was visibly terrible and his lips were pale. Anyone could tell he was seriously ill. This was also the first time he had revealed an obvious illness in the past two days.","Everyone knew that.","Previously, Ji Lingfeng had forced himself not to give himself away because he was afraid they would notice. Since he wasn’t in hiding now, he couldn’t keep it under wraps anymore.","“Do you think I won’t do it?”","The surroundings were quiet. Anyone could tell he wanted to kill.","Xie Yun frowned and looked straight at him. “Lingfeng, don’t be rash.”","She knew very well what Ji Lingfeng would do if he reached the last step.","However, if he did that, he would be nailed to the pillar of shame after his death and be seen as a lunatic and a laughingstock in everyone’s eyes.","They had lived together for decades as husband and wife.","Xie Yun couldn’t bear to see him lose his reputation.","Ji Lingfeng glanced at her and pursed his pale lips into a straight line. He was extremely forbearing.","Xie Yun took a deep breath and spoke to the elders on his behalf, “Second Elder, Fourth Elder. You should know what will happen next. Do you really want to bet with him?”","The elders led by Second Elder and Fourth Elder did not speak. They only looked at each other and relaxed.","Xie Yun grabbed onto the loose thread. “I can tell everyone in advance that you will definitely lose. He’s not joking with you! Everyone is doing this for the good of the Ji family. There’s no need to make it to the point where both sides suffer. Everyone, please sign!”","Second Elder saw her sincerity and said hesitantly, “But Madam, this is not a small matter. We will never agree to hand the family to someone who hasn’t even entered the family tree.","“She has to, at least, pass our assessments before we do it.”","The so-called assessments were just agreements with the new Patriarch on how to distribute the benefits and seek a balanced point of interest.","The Ji family seemed filled with flowers, but in reality, they were already boiling oil.","After Ji Wusun’s death, Ji Lingfeng was pushed to take over as Patriarch, but he wasn’t the legitimate direct descendant.","To manage the family, Ji Lingfeng agreed on a division of interests with the elders and the main hall. In other words, he had weakened his power as Patriarch and allowed those below to have a certain say.","Now that Ji Lingfeng was at the end of his rope, if they wanted to replace him, from their standpoint, they naturally had to overturn the previous agreement and redistribute the benefits.","They had to take the lion’s share of the redistributed benefits.","The Patriarch was going to be made into a mascot.","This was also something they had discussed in private before.","That was why they refused to sign the document.","“So, Patriarch, we can’t sign it.”"]},{"number":3438,"title":"Chapter 3438: Sister Nian: Let Them Go","paragraphs":["Chapter 3438: Sister Nian: Let Them Go","Editor: Atlas Studios","Both sides had already shed all pretense of cordiality.","Ji Lingfeng closed his eyes, about to wave his hand to order He Lin to carry out his final decision. Even if both sides suffered losses and the Ji family declined, he had to hand Qiao Nian a clean Ji family!","At this moment.","Someone came in from outside.","“Oh, looks like I came at the wrong time. It’s so lively.” The girl leaned against the door. Against the light, no one could see her face clearly.","However, from the way she dressed and her wild and surly aura, one did not need to look at her face to know who it was.","Ji Nan followed behind her.","Xie Yun saw Ji Nan first and was extremely surprised. “Aren’t you outside...?”","She was still calm even when she heard the gunshot outside. She quickly sized up Ji Nan and was relieved to see no blood on him.","Only then did she look at the girl. Her expression softened, knowing the reason Ji Nan wasn’t injured was most likely related to Qiao Nian.","She greeted the girl. “Nian Nian.”","Standing at the door, Qiao Nian restrained herself a little on Xie Yun’s account. She nodded slightly and called out politely, “Auntie Xie.”","Xie Yun’s expression became even gentler as she nodded.","She knew this wasn’t the time to reminisce with the girl and suppressed the urge to pull her over and ask when she had arrived.","The elders revealed shocked expressions upon seeing the girl but weren’t too surprised.","This wasn’t the first time Qiao Nian had interfered in the Ji family’s matters. Moreover, Ji Lingfeng insisted on handing the Ji family to her this time. It was hard to say whether she knew in advance.","“Is this... a meeting?”","After Qiao Nian entered, she placed her hands on the table and looked at everyone.","She didn’t bring anything with her. With one hand on the table, her half-closed eyes were cold and dry, and her aura was no weaker than Ji Lingfeng’s.","“What were you talking about? Is it convenient for me to hear it?”","Her eyes curled into a half-smile, but the smile was not deep.","The elders and hall masters whispered to each other. For a moment, they couldn’t figure out what was going on.","...Didn’t the Patriarch tell her? Or were they playing the good cop and the bad cop?","No one knew what was going on.","No one dared to stand out at this time.","Seeing they weren’t saying anything, Qiao Nian exuded an oppressive aura.","“Many people were gathered outside when I arrived. Those who didn’t know better would think you were planning to rebel. I’ve already called for reinforcements. After half an hour, if anyone continues to stay outside, I’ll take it that they want to change the Patriarch and help Auntie Xie clean up these people.”","She didn’t mention Ji Lingfeng’s name.","However, He Lin, standing behind Ji Lingfeng, was tearing up as indescribable emotions surged in his heart.","Miss Qiao... was standing up for the Patriarch!","He tried to suppress his excitement but still couldn’t help but clench his fists, unable to hide his fanatical joy.","At this moment, Qiao Nian turned to the man sitting silently at the head of the table and said, “Let them go first.”","From her tone, this was not a negotiation.","It was a forceful request.","It was rare for Ji Lingfeng to be treated this way. He did not immediately agree.","Qiao Nian didn’t know the situation, but he knew very well.","These people would go on guard once they left. It would be difficult to have such a good opportunity again.","Ji Lingfeng hesitated."]},{"number":3439,"title":"Chapter 3439: I Never Said I Wanted the Ji Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 3439: I Never Said I Wanted the Ji Family","Editor: Atlas Studios","Behind him, He Lin persuaded in a low voice, “Patriarch, listen to Miss Qiao... Since you want to hand the Ji family to her, wouldn’t it be slapping Miss Qiao’s face if you refuse her now?”","His last sentence was the key to convincing Ji Lingfeng.","Ji Lingfeng rubbed his glabella and closed his eyes before opening them again. He looked at the girl with his deep eyes. “Think about it carefully.”","What?","Qiao Nian felt there was a hidden meaning in his words.","However, the best way to resolve the matter now was to quell the internal strife in the family first. Otherwise, someone would attack Ji Nan again in the future.","Countless eyes stared at them from all over the independent continent, waiting to fish in troubled waters.","“Mm.”","She responded.","Seeing this, Ji Lingfeng waved his hand. “Tell them to leave.”","“Yes, Patriarch.” He Lin quickly went to do it.","...","Everyone in the Righteousness Hall looked at each other. They wanted to leave, but they didn’t dare to be the first to stand up.","Qiao Nian didn’t waste her breath on them. Not looking at them, she took a lighter from her pocket, smiled, and impatiently said, “I said I’d give you half an hour.","“Those who are still here in half an hour won’t be able to leave ever again!”","The elders paled. They knew her style well.","Ji Lingfeng might still be wary of them, but Qiao Nian... She had blown up their ancestral hall.","What could she not do?","Second Elder had interacted with Qiao Nian previously because of Ji Ziyin. Before leaving, he composed himself and said, “It’s not that we don’t want to agree, but this matter involves too much. It concerns the family’s future. We don’t want the Ji family to be involved in murky waters because of you...”","After saying that, he did not dare to stay any longer and left without looking back.","After everyone had left, Qiao Nian dragged out a chair and sat down to face Ji Lingfeng. Feeling a headache, she asked, “There were a few people outside when I arrived. What happened?”","Before Ji Lingfeng could speak, coming back from outside, He Lin happened to hear this and quickly answered, “The Patriarch wants to hand the family to you.”","Finding it ridiculous, Qiao Nian looked at the sickly middle-aged man.","Ji Lingfeng avoided her gaze but did not retort. He only said tiredly, “I don’t have much time left.”","Qiao Nian’s chest tightened. She did not feel anything. It was just a little uncomfortable, but it was not the kind of discomfort that made her feel like she was about to die.","She pursed her lips and stared at him with her dark eyes. “I never said I wanted the Ji family.”","Ji Lingfeng did not look at her. “It’s not just for you.”","He avoided the girl’s eyes and suppressed the pain in his lungs as he said in a dignified and cold voice, “My body can’t last long...”","“Then go see a doctor!” Qiao Nian disliked the meaningless conversation and interrupted him. She met Ji Lingfeng’s surprised gaze and said coldly, “Since you’re not feeling well, go to the hospital. Treat your illness however you want. Rest when you need to.","“Will you be able to live longer if you give me the Ji family?","“I’m not a god. Even if you give me the Ji family, I can’t make you live for a few more years. Besides, I don’t want the Ji family! I grew up in Rao City. What does the Ji family have to do with me?”","Ji Lingfeng was silent for a moment. “I know my body well.”","Furious, Qiao Nian stood up and pushed her chair away. “Alright!”","She couldn’t care less if he didn’t want to live anymore!","Could she save someone who didn’t want to live?"]},{"number":3440,"title":"Chapter 3440: Sister Nian Has a Sharp Tongue but a Soft Heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 3440: Sister Nian Has a Sharp Tongue but a Soft Heart","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian pulled a long face and turned to leave.","Xie Yun, He Lin, and Ji Nan did not expect them to end up like this with just a few words.","For a moment, they did not know how to ease the tense atmosphere.","Qiao Nian walked to the door before suddenly stopping. She didn’t turn around. Her back was straight, and her tone was still cold and hard.","“You knew you would be in danger if you went to Continent M. Why did you still go?”","Ji Lingfeng thought she would leave without looking back, just like many times before. He didn’t expect her question.","He was silent for a while. In the end, he refused to put the grudges of the previous generation on her and make her bear something that she shouldn’t bear at her age.","“It’s nothing to do with you.”","“Okay.”","The girl still did not look back. This time, she took big strides, and her back quickly disappeared from their sight.","Seeing Qiao Nian leave, He Lin couldn’t help but say to the man, “Patriarch, why did you lie to Miss Qiao? You clearly...”","“Alright!” Ji Lingfeng interrupted tiredly. “I’m tired. Help me back.”","Qiao Nian made the elders and hall masters leave. He had to think of another way to make them compromise and agree. He just didn’t know if his body could last until then.","Ji Nan beat He Lin to it and silently helped him up. Holding his arm, he calmly said, “Dad, I’ll send you back to your room.”","Ji Lingfeng looked at his son’s mature side profile and recalled what He Lin had said about him blocking everyone outside...","In the end, he did not say anything and let him help himself out of this place.","Xie Yun watched as the father and son walked away. A little touched, she tilted her head and said to He Lin, “You said he would rather give his only lifeboat to his son in the Black Sea. Why did he make a strong decision without asking Ji Nan’s opinion this time?”","Xie Yun knew that Ji Nan did not want the Ji family. It’d only take a few words from Ji Lingfeng.","However, the father and son were stubborn, each more apprehensive than the other. Neither of them was willing to say what was on their minds.","He Lin looked at Ji Lingfeng’s disappearing back and did not know how to answer her. He only whispered, “Madam, aren’t you angry?”","Xie Yun smiled and did not say anything.","Was she angry?","Of course, she was angry!","She was so angry that Ji Lingfeng did not put Ji Nan first. Everything else was fine. After all, Qiao Nian had saved her biological sister back then. She really liked her.","Besides, what did it have to do with Qiao Nian this time? It was all her own family’s fault. They had not asked for her opinion beforehand.","**","Outside.","Qiao Nian left the old residence and looked at her cell phone. Reaching the door, she followed her heart and called someone.","The call was picked up after a few rings.","“Hey, how was it? Did you ask who that person was?”","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and asked, “Elder Zhong, can you do me a favor?”","Zhong Yiliu was stunned before confidently saying, “With our relationship, just tell me if you’d like anything. If I can help, how could I possibly refuse?”","Qiao Nian did not stand on ceremony with him anymore. “I want to trouble you to come to the independent continent. Also, please bring the medicine you mentioned.”","Zhong Yiliu wasn’t stupid and immediately understood what she meant. “So that person is indeed... Emperor Ji?”","Qiao Nian looked up and saw Ye Wangchuan, Qin Si, and the others waiting for her outside. Mo Dong was also there, directing the “cleaning” of the entrance.","She slowed down. “Yes, it’s him.”"]},{"number":3441,"title":"Chapter 3441: Miss Qiao, Do You Need My Help?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3441: Miss Qiao, Do You Need My Help?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhong Yiliu’s tone became serious over the phone. “Alright, I understand. I’ll get them to arrange it immediately and fly over.”","“Apologies for the trouble.” Qiao Nian stood there, looking bleak. She didn’t thank him, but she was full of gratitude inside.","Zhong Yiliu had known her for a long time and was accustomed to her personality.","He said hurriedly, “I happen to be going to the independent continent too. I’m not especially helping you. Let’s not talk right now. I’m going to prepare the medicine.”","Qiao Nian wouldn’t believe his comforting words. She only told herself to remember this favor and did not say many polite words. “I’ll get someone to pick you up when you arrive.”","“Okay.”","She heard Zhong Yiliu’s vague answer amid his energetic voice asking someone to accompany him to the storeroom to count the medicine.","Qiao Nian hung up the call and slowly put the phone down. She looked up and saw Ye Wangchuan looking in her direction; she didn’t know how long he had been looking at her.","She pulled down the brim of her cap with her cold white hand and walked towards him.","Realizing she had come out, Qin Si greeted her warmly, “Hey, Sister Qiao, why are you alone? Where’s brother-in-law?”","He was talking about Ji Nan.","He wasn’t sure if Qiao Nian heard him clearly or just did not care. In any case, she did not refute him. She put her hands in her pockets and said, “He’s taking care of the patient inside.”","Mo Dong directed the people from Bright Gate to keep an eye on the spies cleaning up the various factions. He happened to hear something and touched his earlobe; the scar on his face looked fierce and natural. “Eh, Emperor Ji is sick? The rumors circulating outside are true.”","Having just arrived in the independent continent and not yet heard about the rumors, Qin Si asked him curiously, “What rumors?”","“The people outside are saying that Emperor Ji’s injuries are very serious and his life is in danger. He won’t live for more than a few days... That’s why those people are stirring up trouble behind his back this time. Otherwise, with Emperor Ji’s deterrence, these people wouldn’t dare to be so arrogant as to set up spies at the old residence’s entrance.”","Silence.","Qin Si knew Qiao Nian had hurriedly returned for Ji Lingfeng, so he fell silent when he heard what Mo Dong said. He didn’t argue and frowned.","“That bad?”","Mo Dong had always been straightforward. “It’s quite serious! Anyway, it’s been very hostile for the Ji family recently. There are internal strife in several of their halls. Many of their docks have also been taken away by the Chamber of Commerce Alliance...”","The independent continent was a place that relied on strength to make a living. It wasn’t that particular.","Without Ji Lingfeng, the Ji family was visibly weakening. If the other factions in the independent continent did not take this opportunity to divide their territory, what were they waiting for?","Mo Dong didn’t think there was anything wrong with them. The independent continent was a place where the strong preyed on the weak. But, this time it involved the people Qiao Nian cared about.","He scratched his head and looked at the girl seriously but with warm eyes. “Miss Qiao, if you need help, just say the word and I’ll...”","“Let’s not worry about it for now.” Qiao Nian rubbed her swollen eyebrows, feeling a pressure on her chest. She was so annoyed that she didn’t want to think too much about it.","Rejecting his good intentions and getting into the car, she told Ye Wangchuan, “I want to go back and rest.”","“Sister Qiao is...” What’s wrong?","Qin Si did not finish.","He exchanged glances with Bo Jingxing and saw worry in his eyes.","Qiao Nian rarely revealed her emotions. They could tell she was in a bad mood this time. It was obvious she had not had a good time in the old residence.","However, Sister Qiao came this time for the Ji family. How did it end up like this?"]},{"number":3442,"title":"Chapter 3442: Master Wang Doing It Personally","paragraphs":["Chapter 3442: Master Wang Doing It Personally","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan ignored their worried expressions and went to the driver’s seat. He opened the car door and said, “I’ll accompany her back. Come over when you’re done packing.”","“Alright, Master Wang.” Mo Dong nodded.","He still needed some time to clear the surveillance cameras near the Ji family’s old residence and the intrusion program at the intersection.","He still needed Young Master Bo’s help in this process.","As for Young Master Qin—","Mo Dong was very perceptive. He didn’t ask why Master Wang did not bring Young Master Qin with him. He even specially held onto Qin Si’s shoulder and before Qin Si could react, Mo Dong pulled him and followed the people at the entrance of the various halls and evacuated.","**","Ye Wangchuan had a villa on the independent continent.","Qiao Nian had lived there before.","They stopped upon reaching their destination.","She left the car with ease and paused for the iris system’s check. Then, she threw her black backpack at the entrance and went straight to the second floor.","“I’ll go take a shower first.”","“Mm.”","Ye Wangchuan looked at the bag she had left at the entrance and took it into the living room for her. Then, he went into the kitchen to check the coffee machine.","The cleaners had done the daily cleaning in the few months since they left the independent continent.","Ye Wangchuan was a clean freak.","The cleaners would only do simple cleaning before leaving. They wouldn’t stay in the villa for too long and wouldn’t touch anything in the villa.","Therefore, if he wanted to use the coffee machine, he had to wash it himself.","Under the cold water, the man’s slender fingers were well-defined and very beautiful. The muscles on his forearms were smooth, and the sleeves of his black shirt were neatly buttoned. Every move of his was impeccably arrogant and elegant, with nobility evident in his slow movements.","If the people in the second-generation circle in Beijing saw this scene, their eyes would definitely fall out.","Young Master Ye personally washed the coffee machine and brewed the coffee. Most importantly, from his every move, it was clear this was not his first time doing this.","He was skilled in every aspect.","Who was Ye Wangchuan?","He was destined to be a genius from the moment he was born.","He was the top heir in Beijing and the only descendant of the Ye family. Anyone would think that such a person was above such mundane tasks.","However, that was not the case.","There was more.","Ye Wangchuan took out another type of coffee beans from the cabinet. He lowered his eyes and added a spoonful. After thinking for a while, he remembered that Qiao Nian did not like bitter beverages.","Rubbing his gentle eyes, he went to the fridge and took out a milk bottle, preparing to add cream and sugar to the coffee.","***","Upstairs.","Qiao Nian closed the door and went to the bathroom to take a cold shower.","The weather at the end of September wasn’t too cold, but it wasn’t hot either.","Cold water rushed down and touched her skin. However, this coldness stimulated her nerves and dispelled the bipolarity in her body.","She did not shower for long. After a quick shower, she put on a bathrobe and wiped her wet hair with a towel.","The mirror was blurred with steam, and her face could not be seen clearly.","Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to look in the mirror and dried her hair as she went to the room.","Upon coming out, she saw someone already there.","It was Ye Wangchuan.","Not treating him as an outsider, she relaxed and went straight to the sofa by the window, casually placing the towel on the coffee table. “Why are you here?”","“I knocked on the door. I thought you heard me, so I came in.” Ye Wangchuan raised what he brought and walked toward her."]},{"number":3443,"title":"Chapter 3443: Always Know What She’s Thinking","paragraphs":["Chapter 3443: Always Know What She’s Thinking","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian looked at the coffee and paused before reaching out for it.","The moment her fingertips touched the cup, the heat passed through her fingers to her body, dispelling the coldness. Only now did she realize that Ye Wangchuan had brought her a cup of hot coffee.","“You...”","Stunned, Qiao Nian looked up and almost asked how he knew she was taking a cold shower.","However, she realized this question would be too ambiguous on this occasion. It’d be as if she was hinting at something else. So, she silently shut up and lowered her head to sip the coffee.","The coffee and milk’s aroma permeated the air.","Instead of normal black coffee, the taste was more like coffee milk.","She recalled how a certain someone had insisted on giving her milk and was instantly speechless. She sat on the sofa and placed the coffee on the coffee table.","Only then did she look up, not bothering to hide her emotions. “I’m fine.”","She knew Ye Wangchuan could tell that she was in a bad mood.","She was indeed in a bad mood.","However, it was not particularly bad. She could still digest those feelings herself.","Ye Wangchuan opened his hand. The light from outside shone in and enveloped him. Qiao Nian saw a beautiful candy in his palm.","“Chen Chen prepared it for you.”","What?","Qiao Nian subconsciously frowned and looked up at him in disbelief.","Ye Wangchuan did not say he was the one who brought the little guy to buy it. He only naturally said, “He bought lots of candy for you. All kinds of flavors. I specially brought some. Aren’t you often annoyed? When you’re annoyed, don’t play with the lighter. Eating candy will ease it.”","Qiao Nian looked at him in a daze for a few seconds before retracting her gaze. She slowly took the candy and nonchalantly asked, “Did you buy it or did Chen Chen buy it?”","She didn’t think the little guy bought them, but the little guy did like to buy her these trinkets.","But she believed Ye Qichen couldn’t tell she was easily annoyed recently.","Recently, she couldn’t control her emotions and was easily agitated. Hence, she found the lighter she had not used in a long time and played with it when she was annoyed.","Even Qin Si didn’t notice this small detail.","He noticed she was carrying a silver lighter but did not realize she was using it to process her emotions.","Ye Wangchuan was the only one who noticed it.","Qiao Nian couldn’t tell what she was feeling. She just felt that he was quite vicious. He was silent, but he could even see through her little moves.","There seemed to be someone who understood her in this lonely universe.","He would understand her even if she didn’t say anything.","Qiao Nian peeled off the wrapper and tossed the orange-flavored candy into her mouth. Blinking, she extended a hand to him. “Then I want a few more.”","Ye Wangchuan took a few more candies from his gray knitted shirt pocket and handed them over. He placed them in her hand and did not forget to remind her, “Eat less. Be careful of a toothache.”","Qiao Nian stared at him seriously for a few seconds. “Tsk, have you heard of dad-type boyfriends?”","Shen Qingqing told her about this type of boyfriend.","Ye Wangchuan quite fit this type.","Lost in her thoughts, her face was pinched, and the man’s low and hoarse smiling voice came from above. “Are you saying I’m old?”","Qiao Nian wanted to pull down the brim of her cap but remembered she had just come out of the shower and gave up. “Not really. I mean you’re meticulous.”","“Oh.” He was still smiling."]},{"number":3444,"title":"Chapter 3444: Sister Nian Said She Didn’t Care","paragraphs":["Chapter 3444: Sister Nian Said She Didn’t Care","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian didn’t have to look into his eyes to know they were bright and beautiful.","“...I thought Goddess Qiao wanted to call me Daddy.”","“...” Haha!","Qiao Nian instantly put all the candy into her bag, not wanting to talk to him anymore. However, after being interrupted by him, she wasn’t that upset anymore.","She played with the fruit candy in her pocket and leaned back slightly on the sofa before speaking.","“It’s just as I thought.","“Ji Lingfeng has been poisoned.","“Wasp.”","Ye Wangchuan was wearing a gray knitted sweater and casual pants. The homely clothes gave him a noble and casual aura.","His eyebrows relaxed since the girl took the initiative to tell him why she was in a bad mood. He sat down so that he could talk to her face-to-face. “You saw him. What did he say? Do you want to treat him?”","He knew a few experts who specialized in poison research. If Ji Lingfeng wanted to get treated, he could immediately transfer them over.","Qiao Nian was silent for a few seconds before slowly shaking her head. “He doesn’t want to live anymore.”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows in surprise. Then, he understood why Qiao Nian was in such a bad mood.","“You...”","“It has nothing to do with me. He doesn’t want to live anymore.”","She frowned and said coldly, “How many people struggle to survive? Why should I waste my time on someone who wants to die?”","Continent F, and even poorer places.","Those places were filled with war and disease.","How many people had to struggle just to survive?","Those people had yet to be saved, so why should she care about someone like Ji Lingfeng who still had a chance but was willing to give up?","Just because they were related by blood?","Ye Wangchuan detected the frustration in her tone. He lowered his eyes and said, “He wants to leave the Ji family to you?”","Sure enough.","The girl’s brows were tightly knitted. She immediately turned her head away, got up, and walked to the window before coldly saying, “I never said I wanted the Ji family.”","The grudges of the previous generation had nothing to do with her.","Ji Lingfeng did not even ask for her opinion before making this decision.","Ye Wangchuan could tell she was in a bad mood again. He walked over and placed his hand on her shoulder. He patted it comfortingly. “We can talk about Emperor Ji’s matter in the future. How do you plan to deal with it now? Do you care about these people from the Ji family? If you don’t, Ji Nan won’t be able to suppress them alone... Not to mention the other forces from the independent continent behind the various halls and elders.”","Qiao Nian had to admit this was the last thing she wanted to think about.","After today, the news that Ji Lingfeng was seriously ill could no longer be hidden.","The Ji family’s internal affairs would only become more chaotic, and the fighting more intense.","Just Ji Nan and Xie Yun alone would definitely not be able to suppress those arrogant elders and hall masters... In addition, from the actions of some people today, it could be seen that there were complicated forces behind them. They were not as simple as they looked.","Everyone, including Second Elder and Fourth Elder, had their own plans.","It’d already be good enough if Ji Nan wasn’t eaten up by them.","Qiao Nian’s head hurt. She pressed her temples, and her tone turned stiff. “It has nothing to do with me.”","**","Qiao Nian said she didn’t care.","In fact, she wasn’t that heartless.","Zhong Yiliu sent her a message saying he was setting off in the afternoon. She then got someone to pick him up and ensure his safety."]},{"number":3445,"title":"Chapter 3445: He’s Not Dead Yet, But They’re Already Lining Up For The Inheritance","paragraphs":["Chapter 3445: He’s Not Dead Yet, But They’re Already Lining Up For The Inheritance","Editor: Atlas Studios","At the same time.","Qiao Nian hadn’t been idle for the past two days. She had gone over the Ji family’s situation.","Mo Dong handed her a stack of documents. Qiao Nian took some time to read them before realizing that the Ji family’s situation was worse than she thought.","The Ji family was without a master for the half-year Ji Lingfeng was absent.","The elders with real power and the powerful hall masters went through internal strife in private, all fighting for more authority.","During this period, they treated Xie Yun and Ji Nan as their masters on the surface, but they each did their own thing in private.","The Ji family was on the verge of collapse, with chaos abounding!","Bam—!","Qiao Nian threw the document on the table. Her lips curled up as she licked her lower lip. Her smile did not reach her eyes as she said coldly, “This is the family they’re willing to sacrifice their lives to protect? Look at these people. Which one of them takes them seriously! He’s not dead yet. Everyone is queuing up to split the inheritance.”","Ye Wangchuan walked over and pressed her shoulder. “Don’t be angry. These people aren’t worth it.”","“I just think... it’s not worth it.” Qiao Nian’s anger froze as she rubbed the space between her eyebrows.","She reached for the lighter in her pocket. When her fingertips touched the hard shell of the lighter, she thought of something and took out a candy. She peeled off the wrapper and threw it into her mouth.","The sweetness washed away her bitterness and slightly suppressed her frantic heartbeat and violent emotions.","Qin Si noticed it and was surprised. “Sister Qiao, when did you like eating candy? What brand is it?”","“I bought it casually.” Qiao Nian had no intention of sharing it with him. Her answer was quite perfunctory.","At this moment, Mo Dong interrupted, “Miss Qiao, although I shouldn’t mention it, I think I have to tell you.”","Qiao Nian twirled the candy with her tongue and pressed it inside her mouth, not in a good mood. “Tell me.”","“Mm.”","Mo Dong did not delay and went straight to the point.","“Apart from what I’ve found out, I received another piece of news before I came in. The Ji family’s third hall in the south has somehow hooked up with the Tongji Society. They want the batch of goods the Ji family sent from Continent F.”","“Goods?”","“Mm.”","Mo Dong continued, “That batch of goods was from a collaboration between the Ji family and a mine in Continent F half a year before Emperor Ji’s accident. According to the previously agreed time, today is the handover. That batch of goods contains the Ji family’s core technology. It’s also the black gunpowder technology that only the direct descendants can learn...”","He observed Qiao Nian’s reaction.","“The third southern hall and the Tongji Society should be challenging Emperor Ji’s authority by intercepting this batch of goods. Moreover, they can study the core technology through these intercepted goods...”","The girl’s beautiful eyes looked straight at him. “What about Ji Lingfeng? What’s his reaction?”","As expected of Bright Gate’s intelligence expert, Mo Dong immediately said, “Emperor Ji was tied up by the people from the Elder Hall and hasn’t discovered their abnormal movements yet.”","Qiao Nian pursed her lips into a straight line. A storm brewed in her eyes, and flames threatened to spew out. Then, she remembered she didn’t care and pulled down her baseball cap.","Mo Dong touched the bridge of his nose and spoke up for Ji Lingfeng. “To be honest, it’s been quite difficult for Emperor Ji ever since the news of his serious illness spread. Besides the factions loyal to him, the neutral and opposing factions are planning for the future and only pay him lip service.”"]},{"number":3446,"title":"Chapter 3446: Sister Nian: Just This Once!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3446: Sister Nian: Just This Once!","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian understood what he meant. Ji Lingfeng only had He Lin now. He could use the others, but he wouldn’t feel safe.","Mo Dong and Qin Si were both looking at her.","Bo Jingxing had gone to work and wasn’t around.","Ye Wangchuan’s fringe covered his eyes, giving him a different aura as he handed her a water bottle. “... Do you still not care?”","Qiao Nian looked at the water bottle with throbbing temples. She wanted to say she didn’t care, but her throat was stuck. Every time she wanted to say something, she would think of what Ji Nan had said to her.","“My dad gave me the only lifeboat.","“Before sending me away, he only asked me to protect you and not repeat his tragedy.","“He knew that the trip to Continent M was dangerous. Uncle He and I advised him not to go. We don’t know why he insisted on going.”","Qiao Nian gulped as she lowered the brim of her cap. “Just this once!”","**","The Ji family’s old residence hadn’t been peaceful the past two days.","Ji Lingfeng’s plan failed, and the elders and hall masters now knew what he wanted to do.","Although they tacitly did not mention what happened that day, they were now careful and refused to surrender their weapons before entering.","Of course, Ji Lingfeng’s remaining power was still there.","They didn’t dare to bring their weapons to meet Ji Lingfeng. If both sides took a step back, the elders and hall masters would have to hand their weapons to the accompanying members before meeting Ji Lingfeng.","But they could bring two to three people to the old residence.","In the afternoon.","He Lin hurriedly went to look for Ji Lingfeng in the study, stopping outside by Second Elder’s men.","“Assistant He, the elder is discussing something important with the Patriarch. It’s better if you don’t disturb him.”","He Lin frowned and waved the person away. “I have something important to report to the Patriarch.”","The person’s eyes flashed. He actually stopped him again.","“Assistant He, the Patriarch and the others are discussing Miss Qiao. It’s not appropriate for us to barge in. I hope you can cooperate!”","Discussing Miss Qiao?","He Lin stopped in his tracks and looked at him. “How much longer is it going to take?”","The man looked down. “Soon, I think.”","He Lin could only wait outside.","He waited for nearly an hour, but there was no sign the meeting was ending.","He couldn’t wait any longer and tried to enter the study.","That person beat him to it again. “The Patriarch and the others will finish in half an hour at most. If Assistant He is in a hurry, you can wait in the courtyard. You can see the Patriarch in half an hour.”","Half an hour was indeed not a long time compared to the one hour he had already waited. He Lin was suppressed again.","He frowned, feeling that something was wrong.","However, the other party looked like he was just doing his job and not letting him disturb an important conversation. He could only size up the other party. He was apprehensive since they had been in an awkward situation with the elders and hall masters recently. He pursed his lips and said, “I’m going to take a walk.”","***","He didn’t go far. He only walked around the study.","He Lin could hear Ji Lingfeng’s voice coming from inside. But it was not clear due to the soundproofing.","At the very least, he could tell Ji Lingfeng was safe.","He Lin was relieved."]},{"number":3447,"title":"Chapter 3447: I’ve Already Diverted Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 3447: I’ve Already Diverted Him","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, he couldn’t explain the wrongness he felt. He kept feeling that Second Elder’s timing was too ingenious.","He came just in time for the commotion at the docks.","Just as he entered, He Lin received a report that something was wrong at the docks. The batch of goods they were expecting was about to reach the port.","He Lin wanted to ask Ji Lingfeng to personally keep an eye on them.","After all, this was a critical period. If something happened to that batch of goods, the Patriarch’s situation would probably become even more difficult...","He Lin was hesitating whether to wait when someone ran over.","“Assistant He, you’re here.”","This person was an old man who had worked under him for seven to eight years. Upon seeing him, He Lin’s first reaction was to frown and coldly ask, “Why are you here?”","The man didn’t look into his eyes. He lowered his head and said anxiously, “It’s the warehouse. There’s a fire at the warehouse.”","“The warehouse is on fire?” He Lin questioned, but his actions were faster than his brain. He urged him, “Lead the way!”","There were many things in the warehouse of the old residence. In addition to the gifts sent by various factions every year, there were also some valuable collectibles.","No matter what, he had to take a look at this sudden fire.","He Lin didn’t notice the man’s relieved expression as he grabbed his cell phone and pressed the Send button on an already prepared message.","The message was: [I’ve diverted him.]","* * *","There was indeed a big fire when He Lin rushed to the warehouse. The fire swept up half a meter high as if it wanted to devour the entire warehouse.","He had no choice but to organize people to put out the fire.","It was probably because of his bad luck, but several fire extinguishers outside the warehouse were broken, so there was no way to control the fire immediately.","He ordered the others to fetch water and get fire extinguishers elsewhere.","Three hours later, the fire was finally put out. Then, He Lin had to count the losses.","He was so occupied that he forgot about the commotion at the docks and reporting to Ji Lingfeng.","It was getting dark outside.","An average September day in the territorial waters of the independent continent in a typical rainy season saw a drizzle that started this morning and finally stopped at dusk.","It had been raining for two days. After the rain stopped, orange evening clouds appeared on the horizon. It was like the setting sun, as beautiful as a painting.","Qin Si sighed with emotion. This cloud was quite beautiful.","A certain big boss beside him said in a low voice, “It’s not bad. The red color is suitable.”","Qin Si turned around and met Ye Wangchuan’s slightly cold eyes. He understood what kind of red he meant.","He held his forehead and said in a low voice, “Master Wang, you’re so confident. Those two parties have been planning for today for a long time. We might not be able to—”","He meant that they might not be able to kill everyone here.","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows slightly and interrupted him. “She’s already cut off the communication equipment in this area. It’ll be over when those people come in.”","“Uh, those people are carrying walkie-talkies custom-made by the Hacker Alliance. That should be usable, right?” The reason why Qin Si knew so much was because he had heard Mo Dong’s report. “Walkie-talkies don’t have high requirements for a signal.”"]},{"number":3448,"title":"Chapter 3448: The Predator Is Also Prey","paragraphs":["Chapter 3448: The Predator Is Also Prey","Editor: Atlas Studios","Moreover, it was produced by the independent continent’s Hacker Alliance. If quality assurance wasn’t excellent, it wouldn’t be good if word got out!","Ye Wangchuan’s slender hand commanded the steering wheel as they stationed at an intersection three kilometers from the pier. They could see the situation there from the corner.","“Is this your first time seeing Qiao Nian?”","Qin Si patted his face. It was so numb that he couldn’t make faces. “I’m sorry, I’m stupid.”","He had almost forgotten that Sister Qiao was the head of the hacker world.","As soon as Sun moved, the Hacker Alliance could only wait!","Qiao Nian wanted Guan Yan to come this time, but she was still overseas. It was unrealistic for her to return immediately, so she brought some people with her.","She left it to Ye Wangchuan and Mo Dong to make up the numbers.","The independent continent wasn’t Qiao Nian’s venue, but it was Bright Gate’s territory!","This time, Mo Dong had pulled out all the elites of Bright Gate. Coupled with the fact that Qiao Nian would cut off the signal at the docks later, today was not the dream opportunity for the third southern hall and the Tongji Society to make a name for themselves, but a trap that Qiao Nian had prepared long ago.","Seven o’clock in the evening.","The spy sent news that a convoy was driving toward the docks.","At the front was a black jeep, followed by eight large off-road vehicles. It seemed many people were coming.","Despite Ji Lingfeng not noticing the abnormality, the people at the docks were still collecting the goods according to the Ji family’s previous manpower.","The Ji family had dominated the independent continent for many years. Besides a few forces with damaged brains, no one would dare to go after the Ji family.","The many years of peace caused the Ji family to become perfunctory in this aspect. Only seven people were present receiving the goods.","At this moment, Qiao Nian received a message from Mo Dong telling the number of people from the other party. Her lips curled up as she pressed her Bluetooth earpiece. “There are so many people. They want to do it in one go!”","“What about the Ji family? No reaction yet?” she asked.","Mo Dong kept his eyes on the Ji family’s people and calmly said, “Second Elder went to look for Emperor Ji in the afternoon with a few elders. Emperor Ji hasn’t come out of the study yet.”","“Where’s He Lin? Did he not receive any news either?” Qiao Nian looked steadily at the sea. A large ship was approaching, preparing to dock.","Mo Dong’s voice became deeper. “He Lin went to the study to look for Emperor Ji. Not long after, the warehouse caught on fire. The fire was big, and he was stuck managing the situation.”","The main reason was that He Lin had only received anonymous news that the docks were not peaceful. He didn’t know what the third southern hall, the Tongji Society, and the elders were behind it.","If He Lin knew what these people wanted to do, he probably wouldn’t care about a small warehouse catching fire.","Ji Lingfeng was still kept in the dark. Firstly, it meant that his control over the Ji family was getting weaker and weaker. Secondly, it could be seen that his physical condition was indeed not optimistic.","So much so that he couldn’t even spare the energy to take note of the important cargo at the docks.","Qiao Nian rubbed the silver lighter in her pocket. She suddenly wanted to smoke, but she suppressed the urge.","At the same time, she saw the big black jeep Mo Dong told her about gradually approaching the range of their ambush.","“It’s useless to reason with them at this point. The Ji family needs a ‘rainstorm’ to temporarily intimidate these people!”","Qiao Nian’s dark eyes looked at the sunset in the distance, then at the people arrogantly preparing to steal the goods at the docks.","She crushed the fruit candy in her mouth, narrowed her eyes, and calmly said to Mo Dong through the Bluetooth earpiece, “It’s going to rain.”"]},{"number":3449,"title":"Chapter 3449: I’m Only Sorry to the Woman I’ve Loved All My Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 3449: I’m Only Sorry to the Woman I’ve Loved All My Life","Editor: Atlas Studios","There was a bloodbath at the pier of the independent continent.","The Ji family’s old residence had yet to receive the news.","Several elders trapped Ji Lingfeng in the study room, stalling for time.","Ji Lingfeng had been in charge of the Ji family for more than 20 years and was not someone to be trifled with.","“Second Elder, why are you looking for me today? You’re not here to talk about Qiao Nian, are you?” At first, he believed that these people wanted to talk about Qiao Nian.","But after such a long time, he had more or less noticed something amiss.","Second Elder and the other elders exchanged glances. They couldn’t hold it in anymore. Why wasn’t the other party done yet?!","“Patriarch, you’re overthinking.”","“Then what are you doing here?”","Ji Lingfeng’s short hair was sharp, and his eyes were ruthless. Holding a fountain pen, his tall figure leaned back, clearly impatient.","Second Elder’s breathing gradually became heavier under such pressure. “Patriarch, Qiao Nian is uncontrollable. I sincerely advise you to reconsider.”","Seeing that he was finally telling the truth, Ji Lingfeng threw the fountain pen on the table and looked at them. “So as the Patriarch, I don’t even have the right to make decisions?”","Second Elder and the others knew they were being unreasonable and didn’t dare to look him in the eye. “Patriarch, that’s not what we meant. We know all the hard work you’ve put in for the Ji family, but Qiao Nian’s personality is too unreasonable and unruly. If she takes over, it’s hard to guarantee that she won’t cause trouble for the family.","“Also, you know... your mother from the reclusive families...”","It was no secret that Qiao Nian and Nie Qingru were at loggerheads.","This was also why the stick-in-the-muds of the Ji family did not want Qiao Nian to take over!","On the one hand, they wanted to use Qiao Nian’s blood. On the other hand, they were unwilling to risk offending the reclusive families and Nie Qingru for Qiao Nian.","Therefore, they always asked Qiao Nian for help whenever something happened. However, when Qiao Nian encountered trouble, they pretended not to know.","For example, they had heard about the Nie Qixing incident in Continent M, but no one in the Ji family contacted Qiao Nian or asked if she needed help.","Only Ji Nan, Xie Yun, and Nan Tianyi had called Qiao Nian.","Neither the Second and Fourth Elders, who had received Qiao Nian’s help in Ji Ziyin’s matter, contacted her.","Second Elder took a deep breath and said, “Patriarch, I hope you can consider the big picture and not be blinded by your personal feelings. How can you face the family and the old patriarch with your current actions?”","Ji Lingfeng’s hands on the table turned pale as he sneered. For the first time, a mocking smile appeared on his mature and handsome face. “It’s because I’ve been too good to you guys that I’ve let down the most important person to me.”","Back then, for the family’s sake, he missed the chance to save Ji Qing!","Now, he was so sick that he didn’t have many days to live. These people stood before him and flaunted their might, questioning whether he was worthy of the family.","“I’ve been fair to the Ji family, but I’ve let down my conscience... I’ve let down the woman I’ve loved all my life! I’ve let down my sister who cut open the darkness and pulled me out of the abyss.”","What happened back then was not a secret to these elders.","They fell silent.","It wasn’t that they agreed with him, but they could tell that Ji Lingfeng wouldn’t change his mind easily.","He had already made up his mind to return the Ji family to Qiao Nian.","It was the kind of determination that disregarded everyone’s objections and risked everything."]},{"number":3450,"title":"Chapter 3450: Emperor Ji Responds","paragraphs":["Chapter 3450: Emperor Ji Responds","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Patriarch...” Second Elder frowned and wanted to say something else.","Ji Lingfeng did not give them a chance to stall for time. He picked up the office line beside his hand and called He Lin. “Where are you?”","“Patriarch, are you done?” He Lin looked at the people entering and exiting the warehouse to count the goods and replied. “The warehouse is on fire. I’m here dealing with it.”","Ji Lingfeng’s eyes turned cold as he glanced at Second Elder and the rest. “The warehouse is on fire?”","He Lin didn’t know that Ji Lingfeng had not left the study yet. “Ah, the exact reason is still being investigated. Someone must have deliberately set fire to it.","“I’m taking stock of the losses. It shouldn’t be big.”","Ji Lingfeng’s tone was as cold as ice. “Heh, looks like I’m half dead in the eyes of some people.”","Second Elder and the others were so shocked that they stiffened and a layer of cold sweat broke out on their backs.","The breathing in the study became lighter.","Second Elder even had a faint thought of regret. He felt that he had been too impulsive and should have used a wait-and-see approach.","He shouldn’t have agreed to help the Third Southern Hall and the Tongji Society so impulsively.","Ji Lingfeng asked He Lin to come over and hung up.","Second Elder watched as he put down the receiver and opened his mouth. “Patriarch, I...”","“We’ll talk about it when He Lin arrives.” Ji Lingfeng suppressed his anger and did not let him talk.","...","He Lin received urgent news as he was rushing over.","“Patriarch, bad news. Over at the docks...”","He rushed into the study and realized that Second Elder and the others were still there. All of them were fidgeting uneasily.","He Lin was stunned for a moment, as if he had not realized why these people hadn’t left yet.","Ji Lingfeng’s face darkened. “What’s wrong at the docks?”","He remembered.","A batch of goods was arriving from Continent F today. The people in charge of the docks would collect the goods and store them in the warehouse.","From the looks of it, something had happened there.","Ji Lingfeng was a member of the Ji family. Even if he was not Nie Qingru’s son, he had inherited Ji Wusun’s genes and his intelligence was not low.","He immediately connected the cause and effect. Looking at Second Elder and the others, his eyes were already filled with killing intent.","Second Elder had complained endlessly.","However, he could no longer stop them now that things had come to this point. He only hoped that the people from the Tongji Society would work hard and steal the goods.","This way, if someone stood out, it would definitely weaken the Patriarch’s control over the family. He could still fight the Patriarch.","Otherwise, since he had already been implicated today, he probably wouldn’t be able to settle things peacefully.","“There was an explosion at the pier. My men found that the Third Southern Hall and the Tongji Society have been in contact recently. It’s possible that they... want to intercept the goods.”","“Very good!” Ji Lingfeng pressed his temples, his eyes suddenly burning with anger as a fake smile graced his face. “Looks like I’m already a dead person in your eyes.”","He Lin knew his physical condition. “Patriarch, don’t be angry.”","Ji Lingfeng took a deep breath and stood up. “Didn’t you say that someone set the fire?”","“...Uh, yes.” He Lin didn’t know why he mentioned this. Wasn’t the situation at the docks more serious now?","Ji Lingfeng made a prompt decision. “Lock down the old residence. No one is allowed to leave without my orders!”","Second Elder and the others trembled. “Patriarch...”","They had brought a few people with them this time, but this was Ji Lingfeng’s territory, after all. They wouldn’t be enough if both sides shed all pretense of cordiality."]},{"number":3451,"title":"Chapter 3451: We’ll Know Once Sister Nian Makes a Move!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3451: We’ll Know Once Sister Nian Makes a Move!","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, under normal circumstances, smart people wouldn’t fall out with each other.","Ji Lingfeng looked at him with a fake smile and said, “Second Elder, aren’t you most worried that the family will suffer losses? You won’t be at ease even if I let you leave now. Why don’t you stay here in peace and wait for me to investigate the situation at the pier?”","Second Elder’s face alternated between green and white. He knew that Ji Lingfeng was trying to provoke him, but every word Ji Lingfeng said was indeed what he had said before. There was no room for retort.","Ji Lingfeng was already prepared for the worst.","After He Lin sealed off the outside and controlled all the entourage brought by Second Elder and the others...","Ji Lingfeng rubbed his eyebrows and sat on the swivel chair with a tired expression. “How is it? Have you investigated the situation at the docks?”","At first, He Lin didn’t understand what was going on. Now, he understood what Second Elder and the others were trying to do.","His heart ached for Ji Lingfeng, but he had no choice but to tell the truth. “The dock is under control. All communication equipment has failed. Our people are still rushing there, so we don’t know the exact situation for now...”","All communication equipment failed.","Did this mean that the Hacker Alliance was involved?","Ji Lingfeng closed his eyes.","He knew the situation was bad, but he didn’t expect it to be worse than he had imagined.","“Contact Nan Tianyi.”","**","The explosion at the pier caused quite a commotion.","Not only was Ji Lingfeng investigating, but the other factions in the independent continent were also trying to find out what had happened at the pier...","Like Ji Lingfeng, they quickly realized that the communication equipment at the bay pier had been cut off. They couldn’t use high-tech technology to investigate the situation at the pier.","Some people were smarter and immediately contacted the Hacker Alliance.","“Bay Pier...”","“We didn’t do it.”","“Impossible... Didn’t you say that there’s no signal over there? If it’s not you, who else has this ability?”","“Believe it or not, it really wasn’t us.”","The Hacker Alliance had received seven or eight similar calls within the hour, each asking the same thing. Unfortunately, not many people believed that the signal blockage at the pier had nothing to do with them.","However, the truth was that everyone in the Hacker Alliance had returned. They sat upright in front of their computers, and green bar codes quickly flashed on their screens.","After hanging up the last call, the leader walked over and saw that they were still focused on the computers. Unable to suppress his anger, he asked, “How is it? Did you find anything? Who did it!”","A disheveled man with bird’s nest hair forced himself to look away from his computer and muttered, “We can’t hack in. The other party already expected us to hack into the program.”","The leader of the Hacker Alliance was stunned and did not believe it. “There are so many of you, but none of you got in?”","“Who the f*ck knows what’s going on...” Bird’s Nest was still mumbling something, but his voice was too soft for the leader to hear clearly.","At this moment.","A computer suddenly emitted a beeping alarm.","Typically, their computer would only trigger a warning if there was a problem with the host.","“Oh my god! No way!” The guy with the bird’s nest hair scratched his head. His expression changed slightly as he quickly typed away on the keyboard.","It was just as he had imagined.","The computer began to go out of control, and his authority over it decreased."]},{"number":3452,"title":"Chapter 3452: Might as Well Give Them a Quick Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 3452: Might as Well Give Them a Quick Death","Editor: Atlas Studios","He sensed the computer slapped him under its claws like a cat catching a mouse. It could end his life at any time.","Three minutes later.","The Hacker’s Alliance computers collectively made a short, loud noise.","Ding!","All the computers’ screens turned black.","An extremely arrogant warning slowly appeared on the screens—Scram!","“Bang!” The leader of the Hacker Alliance placed his hands on the table. His eyes were about to pop out as he shouted with a livid expression, “Who is it?! This person simply doesn’t take us seriously.”","A weak voice reminded him at this moment, “Boss, the motherboard has been burned. We won’t be able to use the computer until we change it.”","The leader of the Hacker Alliance looked even worse. He looked like he wanted to kill someone.","They were different from the other factions in the independent continent. Their main members were all hackers. They mainly focused on intelligence gathering, viruses, and defense.","A computer was equivalent to a hacker’s life.","The other party had burned the main computer’s motherboard, which was equivalent to taking half of the Hacker Alliance’s life.","Just repairing this motherboard would take a lot of time and effort. In the end, who knew how much information could be saved?","This...","What could be more humiliating than giving them a heavy blow in their professional field?","His chest heaved up and down, and his mind was in a mess. He could only squeeze out, “Who exactly is it!”","He couldn’t guess.","But someone slowly raised his hand after some thought.","“You know who it is?” The leader stared at his bird’s nest hair.","“I have a guess.”","The bird’s nest-haired man grabbed his hair again, making his already messy hair even more messy. It was hilarious.","“Boss, have you ever thought Sun is the one behind it?”","Hearing the name ‘Sun’, the leader of the Hacker Alliance’s mind exploded in fireworks. His eyes suddenly lit up as if everything made sense.","This insufferably arrogant style.","There was also technology that could trample over the Hacker Alliance.","Only one person in the world could do it—SUN!","His expression changed from shock to clarity to confusion. “Didn’t she fall out with the Ji family? Why is she meddling in the Ji family’s matters now...”","**","As the people outside couldn’t figure out the situation at the pier immediately, they all thought the Third Southern Hall and the Tongji Society had succeeded.","Only the people in the eye of the storm knew that the situation was not what the outside world was thinking. They were like ants tied to a flame, anxious and restless.","Someone quickly ran in.","The tattooed man couldn’t help but stand up. “How is it? Are our people back?”","Facing his murderous gaze, the minion who ran in trembled and whispered, “Vice Hall Master, those brothers... we have lost contact with them.”","The tattooed man fell back into his seat in a daze, unable to recover.","It was the third batch of people!","This was already the third batch of people they had sent.","Just like the previous two batches, they lost contact as soon as they stepped into the range of the docks. Even though they did not rely on walkie-talkies and used signal flares, there was no movement. It was as if they had been swallowed by the heavy rain at the bay dock and lost contact.","This was clearly abnormal.","However, they had already lost contact with the Tongji Society. Now that the arrow was on the bow, they had no choice but to shoot. Even though they knew it was a trap, they had no choice but to send people there.","This feeling was f*cking painful. It was like a blunt knife cutting through flesh. Whoever it was might as well give them a quick death!"]},{"number":3453,"title":"Chapter 3453: Only Now Do You Know There’s No Way Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 3453: Only Now Do You Know There’s No Way Out","Editor: Atlas Studios","His subordinate felt the restlessness in the air and carefully asked, “Vice Hall Master, should we send more people?”","The tattooed man, who was also the man who had blocked the old residence and almost fought with Ji Nan, gritted his teeth. “Go!”","Someone from the Third Southern Hall persuaded uneasily.","“Vice Hall Master, the other party came prepared. Won’t we be sending our people to death if we continue?”","“Yes.”","“I think we should take it slow.”","Silence.","Many people echoed that person’s words.","The tattooed man looked at him coldly. “Can you think of a better solution?”","Who would have a solution?","The man who said he would take another look shut his mouth.","The tattooed man looked at everyone with his temples’ veins bulging. It was obvious that he was violent and uneasy. “I also know there’s a trap at the pier, but we have no way out!”","His words hit everyone’s hearts.","The originally uneasy atmosphere became heavier...","These people thought the Ji family was extremely weak and their hall was the strongest. Although it was rash to take the lead, they could still obtain the greatest benefits.","Unexpectedly, in the blink of an eye, they had become fish waiting to be slaughtered.","Seconds ticked by.","The fourth batch of people had been sent out two hours ago.","Under normal circumstances, those people should have fired signal flares to report to them about the situation.","However, it was drizzling outside. The sky was still dark and gloomy.","In the distance, other than the initial explosion, the harbor seemed shrouded in a drizzle and could not be seen clearly.","No movement.","There was still no movement.","The last elites of the third hall led by the tattooed man lay dormant on the edge of a bend 20 kilometers away from the bay dock. They used binoculars, trying their best to see the situation there.","The cold rain poured on their faces, extinguishing their last hope.","“Vice Hall Master, Zheng An and the others probably won’t be coming back.”","Zheng An was the team leader of the fourth batch of people they had sent. He was also an elite among the elites of the hall and had been seriously trained.","However, the moment he stepped into the dock, such a person was like a stone sinking into the sea, unable to send any signal back...","The tattooed man felt a chill run down his spine... His expression was ugly as he constantly tried to guess who was lying in ambush at the dock.","“Vice Hall Master, what should we do next?”","The others looked at him.","“Why don’t we go back first?”","The tattooed man was drenched.","Under everyone’s gaze, he slowly put down the binoculars and shook his head. Then, he gritted his teeth and said, “Let’s go. I’ll take a look myself! I want to see who’s playing tricks!”","The remaining people had long been frightened. Their faces revealed timid expressions as they looked at each other, not wanting to go.","The tattooed man was in a mess and did not have the patience to motivate them. He only said, “If we don’t succeed this time, we’ll die. Don’t tell me you think the Patriarch still doesn’t know!","“We... have no way out!”","This time, his tone was even more solemn than last time.","The others were still hoping for a fluke, but upon hearing this, they understood that there was no way out. They could only be as stubborn as a mule.","At this moment, someone in the crowd whispered, “If we knew this would happen, why would we cooperate with the Tongji Society and betray the Ji family?”"]},{"number":3454,"title":"Chapter 3454: The Hacker Alliance’s Reason Was Too Lame","paragraphs":["Chapter 3454: The Hacker Alliance’s Reason Was Too Lame","Editor: Atlas Studios","These words touched everyone’s hearts.","However, the current situation did not allow them any room for regret.","The tattooed man could only pretend not to hear anything. How could he not regret being too impulsive? He only saw the benefits before him and did not realize that the Patriarch was still the Patriarch. How could he provoke the Ji family’s direct line of descent...","**","The bay pier was out of signal.","The people sent out by the various factions were the same as those from the Third Southern Hall. They didn’t return after being sent out. They didn’t send any information at all.","That place had become a restricted area.","No faction could investigate the situation there.","The outside world didn’t know what was happening at the harbor, and rumors abounded.","The Third Southern Hall’s idea of independence was not something that could be achieved in a day or two. In addition, Ji Lingfeng’s life and death had been unknown for the past six months.","The Third Southern Hall’s style of doing things became more arrogant, not giving Ji Nan any face.","In that case...","The various factions of the independent continent didn’t even need spies to know that the incident at the pier was related to the Third Southern Hall.","The news they received was that Ji Lingfeng was held back by a few elders and didn’t realize the abnormality at the pier, hence he did not send anyone over.","Therefore, all the major factions felt that the people controlling the pier were from the Third Southern Hall.","The Xie family.","Upon receiving the news, Old Madam Xie’s eyes relaxed, and her already chubby face became even sharper.","She sneered at Father Xie and his wife and passed the information she had received to them as if she were watching a show. “Look, the Ji family is finished.”","Father Xie took the secret report from the old lady and frowned. In the end, he put it down uneasily and said to the old lady, “After all, Ji Lingfeng is your son-in-law and my brother-in-law. If anything happens to him, our family will be implicated.”","He had a point.","The Xie family prospered in the independent continent because of this relationship.","However, ever since Old Madam Xie fell out with Xie Yun last time, she hated the Ji family and even her daughter and son-in-law.","“Hmph! What’s the use of having a traitorous daughter! Even if we’re still related by blood, do you think she cares about her mother? Since that’s the case, we might as well let her suffer a little before she realizes the importance of her family!”","Old Madam Xie’s face was stern, not allowing Father Xie to say anything she did not like to hear. She said coldly, “I’ll wait for her to beg me.”","At that time, she would suggest supporting Ji Nan in the name of the Xie family to inherit part of the Ji family’s assets. This way, their family would not suffer a loss.","At the very least, it was better than being unable to get it even though they were relatives.","As for her son-in-law...","Old Madam Xie had never taken this bit of kinship seriously.","The interests of the independent continent were people’s eternal pursuit!","...","Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","Simon had also received the news.","Now, he was the only one left in his office. After receiving the news from his spies, he frowned and was not as happy as he had imagined.","“Are you saying that Second Elder and the others haven’t come out of the old residence yet?”","“Yes.”","“The signal at the pier hasn’t been restored? The Hacker’s Alliance still refuses to admit it?”","“The Hacker Alliance won’t answer the phone. They said that the main computer’s motherboard at HQ has been burned.”","The person couldn’t help but say, “Hehe, they’re obviously using that as an excuse, but it’s just too lame and unbelievable.”","The Hacker Alliance’s main computer was more important than their lives. How could its motherboard burn just like that?"]},{"number":3455,"title":"Chapter 3455: Sister Nian Sneaked In","paragraphs":["Chapter 3455: Sister Nian Sneaked In","Editor: Atlas Studios","And it was for such a ridiculous reason that the motherboard was burned.","Only a fool would believe it!","Simon’s eyelids twitched, and he suddenly looked at him. “You’re saying that the Hacker Alliance told the outside world that their main computer’s motherboard was burned?”","“Yes.”","The person looked at him carefully, not knowing why he had such a big reaction.","“President, is there something wrong?”","Silence.","Simon frowned and placed his hand on his forehead. He did not speak for a while.","Outsiders might think that the Hacker Alliance was lying—a ridiculous lie, but he did not think so...","The people from the Hacker Alliance were not fools. Even if they wanted to use an excuse, they would use a more trustworthy one. Since the Hacker Alliance did not do so, it could only mean that... it was true!","Moreover, he remembered someone in the independent continent who could do this.","That person was currently here too.","Simon’s expression turned ugly. He couldn’t stand it anymore and hurriedly said, “Prepare the car. I’m going to the First Research Institute to see Elder Feng.”","Feng Yu might know...","* * *","The wind was howling outside.","It was the same for the Ji family’s old residence.","At the very least, Second Elder and the rest, who had been forced to stay by Ji Lingfeng’s side, had lived in fear for the past few hours. They watched as the sky outside gradually darkened.","They felt more and more uncertain.","“Why isn’t there any news from the Third Southern Hall? Have they not settled it yet?”","“That shouldn’t be the case.”","“There aren’t many people at the bay dock. With their strength, they should be able to control the people there quickly. They should have sent us a message.”","That person tilted his head uneasily and asked, “Second Elder, what do you think?”","Second Elder looked calm as he drank tea. In fact, only he knew how fast his heart was beating.","Realizing the others were looking at him, he forced himself to calm down. “Let’s wait a little longer. The Patriarch definitely doesn’t know about the abnormality at the docks. It depends on whether he encountered any other accidents.”","He was not particularly worried about this.","With the Third Southern Hall and the Tongji Society’s strength, it would only take a little more time to resolve such a small accident. At most, it wouldn’t be a big problem.","He comforted everyone. The others more or less believed him and were not that nervous, but they could not relax.","The Patriarch had not appeared since keeping them here. They didn’t know how this matter would end up.","It was still raining outside.","Suddenly, lightning tore through the sky, as if it wanted to change the independent continent. Powerful thunder rumbled.","Second Elder raised his head and looked at the sky. At this moment, he saw He Lin enter from outside and walk toward them.","Second Elder’s heart turned cold.","There was no other reason.","It was because He Lin looked too calm. It didn’t look like anything happened to the batch of goods at the pier. Instead... it looked like he was here to laugh at them.","His heart skipped a beat. He was sure the Patriarch had been held back by them this time and would definitely not be able to call for reinforcements in time.","So what went wrong?","He thought the worst-case scenario would be that the goods were not discarded in time. He believed the Third Southern Hall’s people would at least successfully escape without leaving any evidence behind.","Unexpectedly, after He Lin stood in front of them and clapped his hands, black-clad bodyguards dragged in a few people and threw them in front of them.","“Elders, do you know these people?”","Second Elder looked at the tattooed man and the others before him. The blood drained from his face in an instant. His lips trembled, and he couldn’t calm down."]},{"number":3456,"title":"Chapter 3456: Master Wang Will Only Listen to One Person","paragraphs":["Chapter 3456: Master Wang Will Only Listen to One Person","Editor: Atlas Studios","H-How could this be?","Why were the Third Southern Hall’s people arrested?","Who did it?","Seeing his reaction, He Lin knew that this opening gambit was ruthless enough to let these old things know how powerful he was. He smiled and pretended to be relaxed. “It seems that Second Elder knows this person. The Patriarch asked me to hand him over to Second Elder so you can ask him what he wants to do.”","Second Elder’s old face turned from green to red. How could he not know that Ji Lingfeng was not asking the person tied up on the ground, but asking him instead—what did he want to do?","However, the current situation was completely beyond his imagination. His mind was in a mess and he could not figure it out. “I... will ask.”","“Thank you, Second Elder.” He Lin turned around to leave.","Second Elder stopped him. “Wait, I still have something to say.”","He Lin stopped and looked back at him. However, he was not as respectful and polite as before. His attitude was very cold. “What does Second Elder want to ask?”","The Second Elder knew that he had lost the bet this time. He gritted his teeth and stared at him. “Who did it?”","He could be considered to have shed all pretense of cordiality and admitted his participation in this matter.","He Lin’s face was wooden. After a few seconds, under everyone’s gazes, he slowly said, “10 minutes ago, someone sent these people to the old residence’s entrance, left a message, and left. That person didn’t show his face... but I know you’re smart. Who do you think it could be?”","Who else could it be other than Qiao Nian!","Second Elder sat back down and closed his eyes. He knew that he had lost completely this time!","He thought that Qiao Nian wouldn’t care.","He thought that Ji Lingfeng and Qiao Nian had already fallen out.","He thought that he could override the Patriarch’s authority this time and become one of the Ji family’s absolute leaders.","...","All his previous plans had turned into bubbles the moment that person intervened!","Qiao Nian... actually cared about the Ji family’s matters.","It was rumored that she was cold-hearted and heartless. Besides the Jiang Family in Beijing, she was cold and heartless to everyone.","Even someone like Nie Qixing, who was related to her by blood, could be killed without her batting an eyelid... The Patriarch argued with her back then, but she actually helped him this time.","Second Elder couldn’t understand what that person was thinking, but he also felt that he had never understood her...","Qiao Nian...","His chest was bloated, and he felt stifled and breathless. After a long time, he let out a shaky breath and forced himself to calm down. He had to deal with the “message” in front of him first.","**","He Lin arrogantly brought the people from the Third Southern Hall to Second Elder and the others.","Returning to the study, he restrained his joy, took a deep breath, and stepped inside.","“Patriarch, I’ve already brought him to Second Elder and the others according to your instructions. I also passed on your words to him.”","Ji Lingfeng had just finished taking his medicine. Exhausted, he leaned against the back of the chair. It was by sitting there that he did not look so weak and disheveled.","“She just handed him over to you and left?”","He Lin looked up and immediately realized who he was talking about. He hesitated and said truthfully, “Miss Qiao didn’t show up. A scar-faced man handed these traitors from the Third Southern Hall to me. He only said that he was entrusted by someone.”","“Mo Dong from Bright Gate.”","Ji Lingfeng accurately identified Mo Dong after He Lin described him. It could be seen how much he knew about the various large factions of the independent continent.","“He’s Ye Wangchuan’s man.”","Young Master Ye would only listen to one person.","—Qiao Nian.","It was indeed her."]},{"number":3457,"title":"Chapter 3457: That Tone Was Like Asking If He Wanted Candy","paragraphs":["Chapter 3457: That Tone Was Like Asking If He Wanted Candy","Editor: Atlas Studios","Seeing that he also knew it was all thanks to Qiao Nian’s help this time, He Lin hesitantly said, “Patriarch, you should have a good talk with Miss Qiao.”","Ji Lingfeng did not say anything. He neither agreed nor objected.","He Lin mustered his courage and continued, “Back then, you did it to protect her... You didn’t want to fall out with her or disown her.”","The previous generation of the Ji family was a mess.","The people outside didn’t know about the feud in the previous generation, so they thought that the Patriarch treated Miss Qiao badly.","In fact, after being by the Patriarch’s side for so many years, he knew that the truth was not as the rumors said.","Moreover, seeing that Miss Qiao was willing to help this time, he could most likely tell that the Patriarch was not as indifferent to her as he appeared.","Otherwise, just the fact that the Patriarch wanted to hand the Ji family to Miss Qiao was not enough to move that person.","“Patriarch, you can take this opportunity to make things clear to Miss Qiao...”","“That’s enough.”","Ji Lingfeng waved his hand. He was exhausted and did not want to continue the discussion.","“Keep an eye on the Righteousness Hall and call the remaining elders over as soon as possible.”","“...Yes.” He Lin secretly observed him. “Patriarch, you want to...?”","Ji Lingfeng’s eyes did not look much like Qiao Nian’s. They were more gentle, probably more like his mother’s. They were not in Qiao Nian’s shape.","However, half of Ji Wusun’s blood flowed in Ji Lingfeng’s body. The look in his eyes, on the other hand, was very similar to Qiao Nian’s. They were both calm and decisive.","“She’s already sent people over. If I don’t use this opportunity to teach those people a lesson, wouldn’t it be a waste of her kindness?”","He Lin opened his mouth and thought, Since you know Miss Qiao’s intentions, why can’t you sit down and talk to her properly? Why do you have to be so stubborn?","However, he silently left upon seeing Ji Lingfeng picking up the documents on the table with a serious expression.","Forget it. The Patriarch and Miss Qiao would talk to each other one day.","**","Outside.","After handing the people to He Lin according to Qiao Nian’s instructions, Mo Dong returned to the intersection where a green jeep was parked.","He walked to the passenger seat’s window and looked at the girl sitting inside before softly saying, “...Miss Qiao, I’ve already handed them over.”","The girl played with a silver lighter in her hand.","Mo Dong could see it from where he was standing. It was a rather old lighter. Besides the silver material, there were already traces of wear and tear at the edge.","However, Qiao Nian seemed to like this lighter very much. She would play with it from time to time.","Mo Dong’s gaze paused on the lighter for a second before he looked away. He thought before continuing, “Why didn’t you tell Emperor Ji that you were the one who helped him this time?”","It had been a long time since he had gone on a mission with Qiao Nian.","He wasn’t bragging, but he had really broadened his horizons this time.","Qiao Nian didn’t bring many people with her. Previously, a few ignorant shrimps from Bright Gate had even privately complained that they had been made to work extra hard.","And what happened?","Miss Qiao silently cut off the signal at the bay pier for a few hours. The high-tech weapons were also thrown out as if they were free.","Mo Dong thought back to the girl sitting in front of the computer, her hair blown by the wind, while her extremely dark eyes looked out at the sea.","Her legs were crossed as she asked him if he wanted a machine gun, in a tone that sounded as if she was asking if he wanted candy."]},{"number":3458,"title":"Chapter 3458: Sister Nian: Probably Doing Good Things Without Leaving a Name?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3458: Sister Nian: Probably Doing Good Things Without Leaving a Name?","Editor: Atlas Studios","He knew they weren’t sold on the market. Occasionally, one or two of them would be circulated on the black market. Every time they were available, the price would be jaw-dropping.","And this was the version that had been blacklisted.","No one would sell the slightly newer models because they were afraid someone would dismantle them and develop their own.","This time, he saw that all the weapons Qiao Nian had brought were of this configuration. Moreover, he had taken a look at that thing. It should be a high-end model.","With a little data online, one could roughly figure out what it was, but if they wanted to buy it—there was no such thing!","Perhaps the reclusive families would have some stock.","However, it was also a precious thing. They wouldn’t be taken out easily.","Qiao Nian really had them.","From the looks of it, she had many of such things.","At this thought, Mo Dong couldn’t help but smack his lips in envy of David, who was far away in Continent F. He remembered that Miss Qiao seemed to call this weapons merchant ‘Daji’.","He was so damn rich!","Mo Dong returned to his senses and looked at the girl again.","The girl put away the lighter and leaned against the back of the chair. With a rather lazy attitude, she slowly pulled up the collar of her top and said lazily, “... Probably because the school taught us... to do good deeds without leaving a name?”","Mo Dong was speechless.","He was confused.","His first reaction was to think that Qiao Nian was joking with him. Then, he looked at the girl’s serious expression, with her chin resting on her hand. It seemed like she really thought so.","He understood. It seemed even the big bosses in Country Z had to study hard and listen to their teachers.","Then, the corners of his mouth twitched in silence. “I’ll sit in the back.”","He quickly slipped away, not waiting for Qiao Nian to ask him to stay. In the blink of an eye, he ran to the back of the jeep to look for Qin Si and the others.","Qiao Nian watched him leave while rubbing her face. Then, she turned her head and looked at another man innocently. “Was what I said very scary?”","She didn’t seem to have said anything wrong.","Why was Mo Dong’s reaction so big?","Ye Wangchuan was her chauffeur. He placed one hand on the steering wheel and the other on the edge of the window, looking careless and arrogant.","Hearing this, he looked in the rearview mirror at the situation behind him.","Mo Dong had already gotten into the car.","He controlled the steering wheel with one hand and prepared to go back.","“Ignore him.”","**","It was already past 10 pm when they returned to the villa.","Mo Dong called for someone to pick him up halfway and had already returned to Bright Gate to deal with the aftermath.","Only Qin Si and Bo Jingxing had nowhere to go. Thus, they followed Ye Wangchuan and the others back.","Bo Jingxing was smart. As soon as he entered, he said, “I’m gonna shower and change my clothes before going to sleep.”","“Hey, so early?” Qin Si muttered when he saw him return to his room.","He turned around and saw Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan coming in. He finally came to his senses and coughed. “I remembered I haven’t called my family yet. I’ll go to my room and call them.”","As he walked, he reached for his cell phone and looked like he was about to make a call.","Click.","Qiao Nian heard the door close.","She casually took off her baseball cap and placed it on the shelf at the entrance. Then, she rubbed her eyebrows and walked towards the stairs; she planned to shower and then sleep.","“I’ll look for you later.” Ye Wangchuan walked behind her. He did not have to talk to her at this time.","Qiao Nian was too tired. She nodded and went up.","Ye Wangchuan turned around and went into the kitchen.","She didn’t know what he was doing.","An hour later.","After showering, Qiao Nian dried her hair and changed into clean clothes. Coming out of the bathroom, the smell of blood on her body had faded, leaving only the smell of shower gel.","It was very faint."]},{"number":3459,"title":"Chapter 3459: Do Whatever You Want","paragraphs":["Chapter 3459: Do Whatever You Want","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian walked to the bed and picked up her phone. Just as she was about to walk to the desk and turn on the computer, someone knocked on the door.","She remembered Ye Wangchuan telling her he was coming up later.","She looked at the door and said, “It’s unlocked. Come in.”","Then, she walked to the desk, turned on her laptop, and pulled out a chair.","At this moment, she saw a certain someone coming in with a steaming bowl. The porcelain white bowl was placed in front of her. Qiao Nian looked down at the fragrant porridge. Stunned, she looked up at him. “You cooked it?”","“If not me, then who?” In addition to the porridge, Ye Wangchuan also prepared a plate of side dishes for her. The overall dish was very light. “The auntie isn’t around right now. I did it myself.”","He put down the chopsticks and pulled a chair, then said to the girl, looking at her with his handsome eyes, “Your stomach isn’t good. Eat something to cushion it first.”","Qiao Nian silently picked up her chopsticks and tasted the porridge.","It was a homely and light flavor. In the past, she did not like eating this kind of light southern flavor, feeling it was boring.","She preferred hotpot, spicy chicken, and other flavors that stimulated her taste buds.","However, on this night, she took small spoonfuls of the porridge and side dishes Ye Wangchuan had personally cooked. She suddenly felt that this light taste was not that difficult to accept.","At least she finished all of it.","Qiao Nian wasn’t a quick eater but wasn’t shy about such things.","After finishing the porridge and side dishes, Qiao Nian felt a warmth in her stomach. She relaxed her brows and looked at a certain someone. “You want to say something?”","“Drink some water first.”","Ye Wangchuan carefully unscrewed the cap before handing her the water bottle.","Qiao Nian looked at it and felt she was being taken care of like Chen Chen. However, she still took it.","“Do you want to ask why I didn’t tell Ji Lingfeng I helped him?”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows when she obediently drank the water. His long eyelashes were lowered, and his eyes were beautiful. “Will you tell me if I ask?”","Qiao Nian nodded honestly. “If you ask me, I’ll tell you.”","These words were even more lethal than words of love.","Ye Wangchuan took the bottle from her and twisted the lid before placing it on the table. Then, he said unhurriedly, “I won’t ask. You can do whatever you want.”","Qiao Nian was a little sleepy and distracted after showering and eating. Hearing his low and hoarse voice, her mind cleared up for some reason.","A pair of clear eyes stared at him.","Ye Wangchuan was a little stunned by her stare. He subconsciously touched the bridge of his nose and was about to ask her what was wrong.","He thought there was something dirty on his face.","The girl blinked and shook her head impatiently. “Nothing.”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and looked at her again.","Qiao Nian seemed to be looking away, but she felt that there was no need for her to not dare to look at him. In an instant, she turned around and met his gaze.","In the blink of an eye, her gaze slid down and her throat bobbed up and down. However, she still followed her heart and got up to lean against him.","After their soft lips touched, they separated again.","It was rare for Qiao Nian not to avoid him. She pressed her fist to her lips and coughed dryly. “I think I have to thank you, but it’s too distant to just say ‘thank you’.”"]},{"number":3460,"title":"Chapter 3460: We’ll Know Tomorrow!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3460: We’ll Know Tomorrow!","Editor: Atlas Studios","Saying “thank you” to Ye Wangchuan would be too tacky.","She didn’t want to thank him verbally.","However, she didn’t know how to let him know how she felt.","At that moment, she wanted to kiss his thin lips.","It was a spur-of-the-moment thought.","Qiao Nian had never had such thoughts in the past. After those thoughts entered her mind, her mind seemed filled with them.","If she didn’t do it, she felt like she couldn’t sleep at night... It wasn’t that she couldn’t sleep. She might not be able to sleep, or she might think about it in her dreams.","So, she chose to follow her heart.","After doing it, she felt that she was quite a hooligan. Anyway, she didn’t know what Qiao Chen, Jiang Xianrou, and the others looked like in a relationship.","This was the first time she had taken the initiative.","“Ahem.” Qiao Nian didn’t know what she was thinking either. She spoke faster than her mind. “You said it yourself. I can do whatever I want.”","Ye Wangchuan finally reacted. He rubbed his fingertips against his lips and realized he had been forcefully kissed.","In the past, when he went out to play with Zhang Yang and the others, he would occasionally see more intense scenes of men and women in the private room.","However, he had never cared and did not think much of it. In fact, he did not even feel anything. If he found it annoying, he would kick the people out so they wouldn’t be an eyesore.","He really did not think much of anything else.","However, he was sure his heart had skipped a beat just now. He had been distracted for a moment like Wen Ziyu, who had just entered society.","“Let me see if my cell phone is charged.”","When the girl stood up, he grabbed her left hand and pulled her towards him. Facing each other, they could kiss if they leaned forward a little more.","Ye Wangchuan looked at her enlarged face.","He liked every inch of it.","He sighed and said, “Nian Nian, I told you that kissing is like this.”","Running away after a kiss was underage dating.","It didn’t count for people like them.","**","The Xie family.","Old Madam Xie was still waiting for Xie Yun to contact her.","It was almost midnight, but no call was forthcoming. She urged anxiously, “Has your sister not called yet?”","She was asking Father Xie.","Father Xie was already sleepy. He forced himself to stay awake and wait with the old lady. Hearing this, he slapped his face, causing his muddled mind to sober up a little.","“No.”","“How could that be?” Old Madam Xie was unwilling to believe it.","She picked up her phone and looked at the time.","It’d be the next day in 10 minutes.","Not only did Xie Yun not call, but she didn’t even send a message. It was completely different from what she had imagined.","“Is she that patient?”","Old Madam Xie stood up and paced the room. Then, she approached Father Xie and hesitantly asked, “Why don’t you call and ask her?”","“Now?” Father Xie saw that it was pretty late.","As her older brother, what should he say? He should just tell Xie Yun that they heard something had happened to the Ji family and that Ji Lingfeng was doomed? That they were willing to help, but the prerequisite was that Xie Yun had to help her family obtain part of her husband’s assets?","This...","Even if he was thick-skinned, he could not say this.","After all, the three of them had a good relationship when they were young. It was just that when they grew up, they had their own families and gradually distanced themselves for benefits.","“Mom, why don’t you go to bed? We’ll talk tomorrow.”","Father Xie was unwilling to make this call, so he could only persuade the old lady to stop fussing and persuade her to sleep.","“Go to sleep. You’ll know what happened at the docks tomorrow!”"]},{"number":3461,"title":"Chapter 3461: What’s Going On?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3461: What’s Going On?","Editor: Atlas Studios","The old lady was still unwilling and urged him to call Xie Yun.","Fortunately, Father Xie managed to calm her down and finally pushed her into her room to sleep.","Seeing the old lady turn off the bedroom light, Father Xie heaved a sigh of relief and walked back tiredly.","Seeing his wife waiting at the stairs, his expression softened a little. “Why aren’t you asleep?”","Mother Xie craned her neck and looked toward the living room. “Is Mom asleep?”","“Yes, she just fell asleep.”","Father Xie nodded and walked towards the bedroom.","Mother Xie followed him, saying indignantly, “Do you think that this time, Eldest Sister-in-law—”","Before she could finish speaking, her husband glared at her and scolded her. “It’s fine if the outsiders talk about it. But you’re her sister-in-law, after all. Why are you acting like an outsider?!”","Mother Xie was aggrieved and indignantly lowered her eyes, but she did not talk back to him. “I was just saying.”","“Don’t mention it again!”","Father Xie kept a straight face and walked away without looking back.","Mother Xie gritted her teeth as she looked at his back view. She didn’t feel good. He told her not to mention it, but why didn’t he tell the old lady the same?","**","The next day.","Dawn.","The first rays of the morning sun cut through the darkness.","The air in the independent continent was fresh.","Last night, many people were worried about the happenings at the pier. They couldn’t sleep the entire night.","Early in the morning, news came that the communication signal at the pier had been restored.","The various factions, who had waited at home for the entire night, were extremely happy. They tried their best to get first-hand news.","The Hacker Alliance naturally had an advantage over others in this aspect.","They were the most miserable last night.","Other forces, like the Chamber of Commerce Alliance and the Arbitration Alliance, waited for news for a night at most.","But the Hacker Alliance was different.","Their mainframe had burned down. They had no choice but to work overtime for the entire night to barely save most of the files.","Still, a small portion couldn’t be saved.","The leader of the Hacker Alliance was so angry that his face hurt, but there was nothing he could do.","It wasn’t easy for him to wait until morning to learn that the signal at the pier had been restored. He braced himself and called their most powerful hacker, the guy with the bird’s nest hair, to see if he could hack into the surveillance cameras and see what was happening at the pier.","He didn’t think it would work at first.","He thought the cameras had long been sabotaged.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian was used to not playing by the rules and did not destroy the surveillance cameras.","They easily hacked into the surveillance system at the bay pier and saw the current situation there.","He did not see the tragic scene he was expecting.","He saw no one from the Ji family floating in the sea or sprawled on the ground.","He only saw a dozen workers diligently moving goods at the docks.","A cruise ship was docked, with ‘J’ engraved at the side—the Ji family’s cargo ship.","Ji Lingfeng’s flag fluttered in the wind.","“What’s going on?” If they had not received accurate insider news yesterday that the Ji family’s Third Southern Hall had betrayed them...","They might think the news he received yesterday was fake.","However, their main computer had been forcefully destroyed by the other party. Furthermore, all the alliance computers had been hacked, with an arrogant “Scram” appearing on all screens.","Everything had really happened.","So yesterday’s news could not be fake."]},{"number":3462,"title":"Chapter 3462: Sister Nian Won’t Act Logically","paragraphs":["Chapter 3462: Sister Nian Won’t Act Logically","Editor: Atlas Studios","The leader of the Hacker Alliance did not understand. He stared at the screen, seeing the workers struggling to move the goods as if nothing had happened. He suspected he was schizophrenic.","What was going on right now?","The Ji family’s goods had not been stolen, and everything at the harbor was normal... Then what was the storm last night?","Darkness before dawn?","“Ha!” Even he was amused by the way his brain worked.","When did the independent continent have the f*cking darkness before dawn?","This was a place where the strong preyed on the weak!","Everything depended on strength.","Emperor Ji was seriously ill.","There was no reason for the Third Southern Hall to lose.","Bird’s Nest Head stared at the screen and grabbed a handful of messy hair. His facial skin had not seen the sun for years. He was younger and more flexible than the leader.","“Boss, have you thought of another possibility?”","“You mean?”","Bird’s Nest Head stared into his eyes. With a numb expression, he said calmly, “Emperor Ji won.”","The leader of the Hacker Alliance waved his hand and opened his mouth. Just as he was about to ask how that was even possible, he received news that even the Second Elder of the Ji family was involved.","However, just as his words were stuck in his throat, he saw He Lin appear on the screen from the corner of his eye.","He Lin was Ji Lingfeng’s right-hand man.","His appearance on the pier was enough to tell them who the final winner was.","This time, the expression of the leader of the Hacker Alliance changed slightly and he fell silent.","... It was really a reversal?","**","The news that He Lin had taken over the harbor and brought people over to count the goods quickly spread to every corner of the independent continent.","At the same time.","The leader of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance smashed several decorative vases in his office.","The Xie family was similar.","Old Madam Xie was wiping her mouth after breakfast when she heard this grievous news. Her vision darkened and she swayed, almost falling from the chair.","Father Xie quickly grabbed her arm and called out worriedly, “Mom, are you alright? You don’t look too good. Do you want me to call the family doctor?”","Old Madam Xie’s expression was really bad. Not only did she look pale, but the corners of her mouth, which were already drooping, also looked even more bitter.","She wasn’t in good spirits, and she wasn’t fully conscious either. Her skinny hand grabbed her son’s arm tightly, using so much strength that her bones protruded. It was terrifying.","“Did they make a mistake?","“Last night, they said that the Ji family was finished. Why did Ji Lingfeng’s men suddenly take over the docks? The goods are still there...”","What the hell!","Father Xie comforted her. “So what if he’s still around? We’re family, after all. It’s good for us to have a capable in-law.”","Old Madam Xie looked at him in a daze and stammered, “But when I woke up this morning, I sent a message to your sister, telling her... to quickly think it through. There’s still a chance to return to her parents’ home.”","“Mom!” Father Xie almost pushed her away, his eyes filled with shock and disappointment.","Old Madam Xie also knew she had messed up, so she kept quiet.","In fact, the message she sent to Xie Yun was much more vicious than that. Of course, it still meant the same thing, but it was as unpleasant as it could be.","She was just short of saying that Ji Lingfeng was dead for sure this time. If Xie Yun still wanted to rely on them in the future, she had to hurry back home to plead for mercy. Otherwise, the Xie family might not protect them, an orphan and a widow.","Although Father Xie was angry, he could only suppress the urge to vomit blood when he saw the old lady’s pale face and regretful expression. He said reluctantly, “You’re her biological mother, after all. No matter how angry Big Sister is, she won’t hold it against you.”"]},{"number":3463,"title":"Chapter 3463: Sister Nian: I Know Some Small Skills","paragraphs":["Chapter 3463: Sister Nian: I Know Some Small Skills","Editor: Atlas Studios","“I think so too.” Old Madam Xie took it seriously. She let out a shaky breath and raised her chin. “I’m her mother!”","Father Xie wasn’t in the mood to deal with her this time.","Xie Yun was even more stubborn than Xie Tingyun.","Whatever the old lady had done a few months ago caused Xie Yun to not contact her family until now. The old lady sent such a gloating message... It would have been fine if the Third Southern Hall had won, but things had developed in the opposite direction. His brother-in-law had resolved the crisis at the pier.","Well...","Father Xie felt a headache coming on. He could already imagine how things would unfold.","He could almost see the Xie family slowly sinking on the ship of the independent continent. He was anxious but helpless...","“There’s something else going on here.”","“I’ll check it out.”","* * *","Qiao Nian only woke up at nine in the morning.","Not in a hurry to go downstairs, she walked to the computer and made a video call to Daji, who was far away in Continent F.","With the time difference between Continent F and the independent continent, it was evening over there, and the sky was especially beautiful.","Daji should be on his way back from the mines. Qiao Nian heard the wind blowing as soon as he picked up the video call.","The wilderness was free.","“I remember you had a black raw stone.”","“Uh... Why did you suddenly ask about this?”","Daji sat in the front passenger seat with one arm dangling outside. He threw the scarlet cigarette butt outside, not daring to smoke in front of Qiao Nian.","The girl looked at him and calmly asked, “Is there or isn’t there?”","Daji tilted his head and pondered for a moment. “I think so. It’s black, right? I wanted to make it into a necklace pendant.”","He had never liked men wearing feminine jewelry.","Therefore, upon accidentally obtaining a precious black raw stone, he wanted to make it into a necklace pendant.","Firstly, it was very cool. Secondly, it could be considered an accessory.","However, he had never found a chance to realize this idea. The designer he wanted to meet never replied. It seemed he had not produced a new design for a long time.","Thus, he threw the precious raw stone aside and forgot about it.","“Sun, why are you asking about it?”","After confirmation, Qiao Nian sat down and sloppily asked, “How much?”","“Mm?”","“I want that stone.”","Daji dug his ears and told the driver to slow down. “Wait! What do you want it for? Black isn’t suitable for a girl, right?”","A girl wearing black... simply did not look good.","Qiao Nian touched her eyelashes—they were long, and when she brushed them, it was itchy and soft. It felt quite unfamiliar, but it was not annoying. “I’m giving it to someone.”","Silence.","Daji wasn’t stupid. He understood immediately. “To Young Master Ye?”","Qiao Nian admitted frankly, “Yes.”","“Hehe! I don’t have it, then.” Although Daji said that, he was still giving it to her. “What are you going to do with it? I wanted to turn it into a necklace pendant previously.”","Qiao Nian remembered when Daji showed her that raw stone. It was too wasteful to turn it into a necklace pendant. There was nothing eye-catching about it.","Ye Wangchuan’s figure appeared in her mind. She closed her eyes and thought for a moment. “Bangle.”","Daji was still worried. “You’re using a raw stone to make a bangle? That’s not easy. You’ll break it if you’re not careful. Who’s going to make it?”","“Me.”","Qiao Nian thought before saying, “I know some small skills. It’s just grinding it into a bangle. It shouldn’t be a problem.”"]},{"number":3464,"title":"Chapter 3464: I Have to Prepare a Surprise Gift for Master Wang","paragraphs":["Chapter 3464: I Have to Prepare a Surprise Gift for Master Wang","Editor: Atlas Studios","In her impression, Ye Wangchuan’s hands were very beautiful, but the prayer beads on his wrist did not match his style.","A black bangle, however, with his fair skin, even if not engraved with complicated patterns, would look good on him.","Daji knew Sun’s style, so he asked casually, “Have you actually gotten a jewelry designer certificate? What’s your name?”","“S.”","Sun’s abbreviation.","At that time, she was too lazy to come up with a name and just wrote a letter.","After that, under Yuan Yongqin’s management, it became SEVEN’s independent designer.","However, she wasn’t the kind of designer who produced long-term works under the company. Instead, she occasionally produced works depending on her mood.","Other than brands, she rarely accepted orders.","Therefore, not many of her works circulated the market.","Qiao Nian spoke casually. She even felt that Daji might not have heard of her.","Unexpectedly, Daji’s expression became colorful. After a long time, he said, “Big boss, don’t you usually read private messages?”","Back when he coincidentally obtained this raw stone, he looked for this designer. He originally liked the simple and treacherous style.","Who knew that she was right beside him?","But he hadn’t managed to set up an appointment with her in three years!","Now that he knew, good lord, the raw stone and the designer had been stolen.","The dogs of Dark Fort were indeed down for life!","**","Qiao Nian hung up after telling him where to deliver it.","She thought for a moment before transferring a sum of money to Daji from her private account. Then, she called Yuan Yongqin and asked if Cheng Feng Corporation had acquired any good raw stones recently.","Yuan Yongqin had always liked to collect raw stones. Quite a number were stored at home.","Coincidentally, she was at home, so she took a photo and sent it to Qiao Nian for her to choose.","Qiao Nian thought about Daji’s usual style and chose a dark green raw stone for him. She asked Yuan Yongqin if she could find a designer to carve a necklace pendant according to her blueprint.","Cheng Feng Corporation’s designer was a big shot in the industry. He was especially good at hand-crafted haute couture. It was too easy for him to carve a small object.","Qiao Nian drew a blueprint and sent it to Yuan Yongqin, asking her to send the finished product to Daji in Continent F.","“Is this a gift?” Yuan Yongqin asked with a smile.","Qiao Nian held her cell phone in one hand and turned off the computer with the other, still thinking about how to make the bangle after obtaining the black raw stone.","Hearing this, she casually said, “No, it’s compensation.”","She didn’t like snatching other people’s things.","However, she wanted to give Ye Wangchuan something. This thought drove her to ask for the raw stone.","Daji was very generous to give it up. The money she sent him was enough for two of those raw stones.","It was just that she didn’t like owing others.","She didn’t even want to owe anyone a favor.","Therefore, besides buying the raw stone, when she heard Daji wanted a necklace pendant, she designed it and sent it to Yuan Yongqin.","“I’m old. I don’t understand you young people.” Yuan Yongqin spoke with a smile, obviously very happy that Qiao Nian called her.","She reminded Qiao Nian to be careful and not be rash. She had to prioritize her own safety and take good care of herself.","Qiao Nian was patient and agreed to everything she said.","Yuan Yongqin chatted with her for a while more before hanging up.","Qiao Nian put down her cell phone and glanced at the time. She had wasted half an hour on this surprise gift.","Now that everything was settled, she turned off her computer, picked up her baseball cap at the entrance, and went downstairs..."]},{"number":3465,"title":"Chapter 3465: We Can Work Together","paragraphs":["Chapter 3465: We Can Work Together","Editor: Atlas Studios","Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","Simon stood before the large floor-to-ceiling window, his shadow blending into the light outside.","“I’ve checked. Did Qiao Nian interfere?”","“President, it’s her.”","“I understand.”","Simon’s eyes darkened and he pursed his lips.","“You can leave now.”","His subordinates hesitated for a moment before quietly leaving, closing the door on their way out.","The office fell completely silent.","Simon stood in front of the floor-to-ceiling window of the tall building.","It was 10 AM, and the sun had already risen. Sunlight shone through the glass window and bathed him. Logically speaking, it should be warm, but he was chilled to the bones.","He stood there, wondering if he had made the right choice.","However, he remembered choosing to stand on the side of the reclusive families in Ji Ziyin’s matter. He had long offended that person.","Even if he wanted to turn back, that person would, at best, not find trouble with him. She wouldn’t help the Chamber of Commerce Alliance advance further in the independent continent.","Therefore, riches and honor came from danger.","Simon walked back, picked up the office line, and made a call, to which he had previously removed the IP address.","Beep.","The call was picked up on the first ring.","Simon’s handsome face was covered in dark clouds, and his eyes were gloomy.","“I’ve thought it through.","“We can work together.","“According to the terms discussed before, after success, the Chamber of Commerce Alliance will take over all the halls south of the Ji family! We’ll cooperate if you have no problem with that. If you do, pretend I didn’t call.”","He asked for a little too much. It was even more than the bargaining chip the other party had proposed to him previously. However, the alliance had taken such a huge risk to provoke Qiao Nian this time. It was impossible for them to only ask for three members of the Ji family.","If they didn’t agree, he would rather give up this opportunity.","He heard a static sound from the receiver.","The person on the other end did not think for long before clicking his tongue. “Deal.”","Simon’s nervous heart relaxed. He gritted his teeth and said fiercely, “Happy cooperation.”","“Happy cooperation.”","The voice was exactly the same as the young man’s voice in his office. It was the same person!","**","“Is it done?”","The wind was strong at the bay pier.","A young man in a long trench coat covered his face with a hood and a mask as he leisurely strolled on the busy dock.","He looked unremarkable.","In fact, it was strange to appear at a place like the pier at this unusual time.","The man walked around the dock for a while before moving toward the alley made of goods.","These alleys extended in all directions. Each one was so narrow that only one person could pass through. Usually, only the dock workers would pass through here.","Unlike the scorching sun outside, these narrow alleys did not see light all year round. It was pitch-black, and only when the sun rose could these roads be seen. On a cloudy day, one might not even be able to see them.","However, he appeared familiar with the path as he turned left and right.","Then, he suddenly bumped into someone.","The person was not unfamiliar.","He had inconspicuous facial features and was dressed in black, like a shadow.","Who else could it be but Shadow, Nie Qingru’s right-hand man?","Shadow seemed very familiar with the young man, and he immediately asked him, “The Empress is still waiting for your news.”","Covered with a hood, the young man’s eyes could not be seen and his emotions could not be ascertained. Looking as if he had just seen him, he slowly said, “Most of the traces on the dock have been erased, but I was lucky enough to find a few bullet holes and a burn mark left by a small thing.”"]},{"number":3466,"title":"Chapter 3466: Sister Nian Created a Small Group Chat","paragraphs":["Chapter 3466: Sister Nian Created a Small Group Chat","Editor: Atlas Studios","It should be from a new weapon.","“Is Qiao Nian good at weapons research?”","Shadow frowned and looked at him patiently. “Why are you asking about her?”","The young man wiped the corner of his lips carelessly and clicked his tongue. “I’m just asking.”","Shadow didn’t want to speak about Qiao Nian, but he had to. His tone was not light. “She has a certain talent in weapons research. Xie Tingyun and Feng Yu both acknowledge her. But she didn’t major in this field, nor specialize in it.”","“Oh, what’s her major?”","“Medicine and music.”","After saying that, Shadow sized up and reminded him, “Aren’t you paying too much attention to her? Don’t forget the Empress’ mission.”","The young man wasn’t frightened by his stern tone. He pulled down the hood already covering his eyes, revealing only his red lips.","“Know yourself and the enemy. I’m just asking.”","“That better be the case.” Shadow didn’t want to continue on this topic. He asked, “Is it done? The Empress is still waiting for your explanation.”","“The Chamber of Commerce Alliance has agreed to cooperate.”","The young man looked at least a little more serious, just a little.","Not wanting to argue with him, Shadow relaxed his expression and led the way. “Let’s go. Follow me back to report the situation to the Empress.”","“Okay.”","The young man waited for him to take a few steps before slowly following.","There was no sunlight here.","He followed behind slowly. He seemed more influential than Shadow himself, but he was the one who listened to Shadow’s orders during the conversation...","**","Qiao Nian went to the research institute after breakfast.","Not having gone to the First Research Institute for a few months, she looked for Feng Yu first.","However, Feng Yu was not in his office. Not finding him, Qiao Nian went to the archives room to look for something.","She stayed in the archives room for three hours.","When she looked up, she realized it was already 12:30 PM.","Qiao Nian put the book she was reading back into the bookshelf. Then, she stretched her stiff neck before taking her cell phone from her bag.","The screen lit up, showing seven or eight unread messages.","Qiao Nian was most afraid of these messages. She rubbed her eyebrows and opened WeChat patiently.","Sure enough, many people were looking for her.","Qin Si’s profile picture was at the top. His message was from 10 minutes ago.","[Sister Qiao, are you coming back for lunch?]","Then were Xu Yi and Zhou Zhou’s messages.","Zhou Zhou was very direct. [Sun, I heard you’re back. Shall we have lunch together?]","Xu Yi was much colder, in comparison.","[Xue Zhu and the others asked if you were free.]","Qiao Nian read all the messages. It basically said: we heard you’re back and let’s eat.","She simply created a group chat and added everyone before sending a message.","[QN: Let’s go together.]","[QN: My treat.]","After the messages were sent, no one in the small group chat spoke at first.","Xue Zhu was the first to send a few emojis.","Right on the heels of that, probably done with her work, Zhou Zhou casually sent two emojis thanking the big boss.","Taking their cue, the others became lively.","Zhou Zhou sent her a private message asking where they were eating.","Qiao Nian searched for a cafeteria nearby.","There were many cafeterias near the First Research Institute.","As for the taste..."]},{"number":3467,"title":"Chapter 3467: Never Mind, There’s No Need to Think About It","paragraphs":["Chapter 3467: Never Mind, There’s No Need to Think About It","Editor: Atlas Studios","It was the mixed flavors of the independent continent.","She chose a more private cafeteria and shared the address in the group chat.","After leaning against the table and pondering for a moment, she found the blank profile picture on WeChat and sent a message.","—[QN: What are you guys having for lunch?]","She did not have the time to see if Ye Wangchuan replied to her.","Zhou Zhou called.","Qiao Nian accepted the call as she put the document bag into her backpack. “Speak.”","She was quite sloppy.","And also quite cool.","It was very Qiao Nian’s style.","Zhou Zhou smiled and asked, “Do you want me to call the Dean and Deputy Director if they want to come?”","Qiao Nian had only wanted to get the group together for a simple meal. Otherwise, she would probably waste more than half a month eating with each of them.","Unexpectedly, this small move was about to become an internal team-building for the First Research Institute.","She rubbed her eyebrows and lowered her eyes to count the number of people before saying, “Alright, I’ll ask them later.”","“You haven’t seen them?”","Zhou Zhou was a little surprised.","She thought Qiao Nian must have met Feng Yu and the Deputy Director first thing when she arrived at the research institute early in the morning.","Unexpectedly, it was almost noon, and the two parties had yet to meet.","“I went to the office to see him when I arrived, but he wasn’t there. It just so happened that I had something to do, so I came to the archives room.”","“Oh.” Zhou Zhou was surprised. Then, she thought of something and said, “Recently, someone came to us for a collaboration. The Dean and Deputy Director should have gone to see this person, that’s why they’re not in the office.”","For some reason, Qiao Nian’s eyelids twitched. “Who is it?”","Zhou Zhou was only in charge of a laboratory. She wasn’t at the level to receive a partner, so she didn’t know much about this matter. She gave a vague explanation and said that the man was not from the independent continent.","She had never seen him before either.","Qiao Nian was stuffing the last document bag into her backpack when she paused before continuing. She slung the bag over her shoulder and narrowed her eyes. “It’s fine if you haven’t seen him before. There’s no need to think about it.”","Anyway, no matter who it was, she would deal with whatever came her way.","As long as they didn’t provoke her, she couldn’t be bothered and did not want to interfere in the affairs of the independent continent.","Qiao Nian hung up and saw a new WeChat message.","It was Ye Wangchuan’s reply from three minutes ago.","[Y: If Goddess Qiao doesn’t return, I’m prepared to eat noodles.]","Qiao Nian unconsciously smiled. It was as if she could see a certain lazy man nesting on the sofa and typing a message on his cell phone.","She called someone.","Ye Wangchuan picked it up instantly.","With her eyes covered by her long, curly eyelashes, Qiao Nian gave him an address. Her hoarse voice was quite pleasant and a little arrogant. “... I’ll treat you to lunch.”","**","In the end, Feng Yu and Shi Fu did not return.","Qiao Nian went to Feng Yu’s office again, but he still had not returned.","After sending him a text message, she turned around and went to the cafeteria to meet with the rest of the team.","This time, Qiao Nian had booked a large private room. There was food, drinks, and fun. She was generous and did not lack money.","After they finished eating, the person led by Zhou Zhou suggested playing Card Nine.","Qin Si was a playboy, to begin with. He immediately agreed and even invited the others to play with them.","Bo Jingxing was forcefully ‘invited’ by Qin Si, and so was Shen Qingfeng.","Shen Qingfeng was the gentle and polite kind of person, but he was exceptionally good at playing cards. In just an hour, Qin Si had become a big loser at the card table."]},{"number":3468,"title":"Chapter 3468: Emperor Ji Vomited Blood!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3468: Emperor Ji Vomited Blood!","Editor: Atlas Studios","The four of them played Card Nine, while the rest of the young ones gathered together to sing and play billiards. The private room was quite lively.","Even Ye Wangchuan and Qiao Nian were dragged by Xue Zhu to make up the numbers and start a round of Werewolf Kill.","The result was self-evident.","The man and woman were very stable and overpowered the rest. In the end, they fought in the Imperial City. It was unknown if Ye Wangchuan had given in to Qiao Nian, but in any case, Qiao Nian won.","Xue Zhu was quite depressed and could not recover for a long time.","At this moment, the waiter arrived with a plate of wine and fruits.","Qiao Nian took the opportunity to go out and take a breather, picking up her cell phone on the way out. As she lowered her head, she realized she had missed a call.","The caller ID caller happened to be He Lin.","He Lin was calling her at this time?","Qiao Nian frowned but did not overthink. She thought he was looking for her because of the pier. She told the people playing on the sofa, “I’ll go out to make a call.”","Xue Zhu waved her hand. “Go.”","Xu Yi had never been a talkative person. He just nodded.","Ye Wangchuan grabbed his jacket and stood up. “I’ll accompany you.”","Qiao Nian glanced at him and opened her mouth to say something.","Ye Wangchuan looked at her with bright eyes that reflected her shadow and proudly said, “I also... want to take a breather.”","Qiao Nian had no objections.","The two of them went out together.","Qin Si and the others were still playing inside. Compared to Bo Jingxing, Shen Qingfeng, and the others’ calmness, Qin Si’s whining could be heard outside the closed room.","She found a quiet corner and returned He Lin’s call.","She didn’t get through the first time.","A little surprised, Qiao Nian confirmed He Lin had not picked up before patiently calling again.","Ye Wangchuan said he was out for a breather, but, in fact, he went to the vending machine outside and bought a bottle of Evian ice water. He took it back to look for Qiao Nian.","At this moment.","Qiao Nian’s second call went through.","She said coldly, “It was a little noisy just now, so I didn’t hear the call. Is there something you need from me?”","This attitude was much better than her previous attitude toward the Ji family.","Ye Wangchuan did not disturb her. He unscrewed the bottle cap and handed her the bottle for her to moisten her throat after she finished the call.","Unexpectedly, in the next second, the girl’s eyes suddenly turned cold and her aura changed.","“What did you say?","“When? Where are you?”","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes and vaguely guessed something.","Qiao Nian nodded and said emotionlessly, “I’ll be right there.”","Ye Wangchuan waited for her to end the call before asking, “What happened to Emperor Ji?”","Qiao Nian looked at him in surprise. She didn’t understand how he knew who she was talking to.","A walking bug!","However, she wasn’t in a good mood and did not want to overthink. She took a deep breath and replied, “Ji Lingfeng vomited blood.”","Silence.","Ye Wangchuan had not expected that.","Qiao Nian didn’t expect Ji Lingfeng’s health to be so bad. He vomited blood after less than two days. From He Lin’s anxious tone, Ji Lingfeng’s condition might be worse than she had imagined!","“I’m going to the hospital.”","Ye Wangchuan grabbed her wrist. “I’ll go with you.”","Qiao Nian felt the heat on her wrist and looked at him with her dark eyes before nodding. “I’ll go tell the others first.”","It was indeed not good for her to leave without informing the others.","But she had to go to the hospital."]},{"number":3469,"title":"Chapter 3469: I’m RH-type, I’ll Do It","paragraphs":["Chapter 3469: I’m RH-type, I’ll Do It","Editor: Atlas Studios","Two in the afternoon.","Qiao Nian rushed to the hospital.","She saw Xie Yun, Nan Tianyi, and the others in the corridor, but she did not see Ji Nan or He Lin.","Xie Yun heard the commotion and turned around to see the girl walking towards her. She felt an indescribable feeling in her heart and forced a smile.","“You’re here.”","“Mm.”","Qiao Nian felt the heavy atmosphere and rubbed her eyebrows before explaining softly to Xie Yun, “I was having lunch with a few friends. I rushed over after receiving the news.”","Xie Yun was wearing a new season dress from the C label. The chiffon bow hanging from the collar was exquisite and noble. Her bag was even of a platinum color.","She didn’t look good, but after the girl’s soft explanation, she couldn’t hide her surprise. She was stunned before saying, “I didn’t expect you to come. Your uncle...”","Xie Yun immediately shut her mouth and rubbed her face, then apologetically said, “I’m sorry, it was a slip of the tongue.”","She was speaking the truth.","However, everyone knew that Qiao Nian did not acknowledge this blood relationship.","The girl’s eyes were quite dry, but she didn’t say anything. She did not seem angry.","Xie Yun wasn’t in a good mood. Her heart and mind were in a mess.","She was rarely like this.","But she was just an ordinary person in the face of death.","“The doctor just came out. He said... he’s not in good condition.","“He suddenly vomited blood at one in the afternoon and fainted.","“He Lin and I brought him to the hospital. He Lin went back to settle the family matters while I stayed here... The current situation is like this. He’s still in emergency treatment... I don’t know if he can be saved.”","Xie Yun recalled the last time she saw Ji Lingfeng and the words they exchanged.","She was dissatisfied with his overbearing decision and argued with him before leaving after slamming the door.","In the blink of an eye, he was pushed into the operating room, and it was unknown if he’d come out dead or alive.","At this moment, the operating room’s door opened, and a medical staff hurriedly walked out.","In a dust-proof surgical gown, the doctor glanced anxiously at the people in the corridor and asked, “The patient’s blood plasma is low. Which one of you has the RH blood type?”","Xie Yun’s heart skipped a beat. She took a step forward and anxiously said, “Isn’t my son getting his blood drawn? He...”","“Not enough.”","The doctor knew what she was going to say and bluntly interrupted, “The RH blood type belongs to the panda blood type, to begin with. The hospital’s blood bank doesn’t have a lot of it. Not long ago, a car accident patient used a lot of this blood type. As a result, our blood bank doesn’t have enough of this blood type now. Mr. Ji Nan has already reached the limit of blood he can give. We can’t draw anymore.”","He could tell that Xie Yun and the others might not have this blood type.","“If there’s no one with this blood type among you, I can only try to transfer them from other hospitals. It’s just that... it might be too late.”","The amount of blood in their blood bank and the blood drawn from Ji Nan was originally enough to support them through the surgery.","Unexpectedly, Ji Lingfeng suffered a hemorrhage midway.","Thus, the planned amount of blood plasma wasn’t enough now.","Xie Yun gritted her teeth. “I’ll think of a way.”","At this moment, the girl took off her coat and draped it over her arm before stepping forward and saying to the doctor, “I have this blood type. Let me do it.”"]},{"number":3470,"title":"Chapter 3470: Sister Nian Is Soft-Hearted","paragraphs":["Chapter 3470: Sister Nian Is Soft-Hearted","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian was led to a small room and asked to sit down.","After a while, the young nurse rushed over with the apparatus to draw blood. She skillfully tied the pressure band on her wrist and took out the blood bag.","Then, she carefully asked, “I’ll draw 200cc first. Can you hold on?”","200cc is the general safety standard for blood donation.","Qiao Nian leaned against the seat, looking very relaxed as she replied, “Take 400cc.”","The young nurse was about to unwrap the needle when she heard this. She paused as her expression turned incredulous, not daring to move for some time.","The patient’s son donated 400cc as well.","This was the limit for the human body.","Ordinary people rarely donated so much at once. Firstly, their bodies could not take it, and secondly, they were afraid of the aftereffects.","Seeing that she had not moved, Qiao Nian finally looked up, revealing her exquisite face under the baseball cap—she was quite eye-catching and beautiful, but also very calm.","“I’m a doctor. I know what I’m talking about. Don’t worry and just draw it.”","“...Doctor?”","The nurse looked at Qiao Nian’s young face and thought she was a medical student.","However, considering the patient’s situation in the operating room, she could only bite the bullet and insert the needle into the blood vessel on the back of the girl’s hand. She reminded her in a low voice, “Tell me if you can’t take it anymore. I’ll immediately take out the needle.”","Upon losing too much blood, people’s body temperatures would gradually decrease, resulting in shivers, dizziness, and nausea as side effects.","400cc wasn’t a small amount.","Even a healthy man might not be able to take it.","The girl did not appear to be the type who had a particularly good physique. The nurse wasn’t sure if Qiao Nian could take it.","...","On the other side.","As Qiao Nian went in to draw blood, Ye Wangchuan called Mo Dong and ordered him to transfer the RH-type blood from around the area. If he couldn’t do it, he was to look for people with this blood type.","It didn’t matter if he had to pay or not. He had to get them here immediately.","There was no need to talk about Mo Dong’s efficiency. He immediately went to the surrounding hospitals to get the blood.","Ye Wangchuan didn’t stay idle either. He asked a nurse for a laptop and took a seat. Then, he began to check who had registered for this blood type in the independent continent, where they lived, and which ones could rush over to donate blood.","They did everything they could do.","Instead, Xie Yun was the one with nothing to do.","Ji Nan rushed over with the help of a nurse. His face was pale but he looked fine.","“Dad, he...?”","Silence.","Xie Yun shook her head.","“He’s not out yet.”","From the corner of his eye, Ji Nan saw the man making a call and using a computer in the corner. Before he could ask his mother why Ye Wangchuan was there, he saw Qiao Nian coming out of the lounge next door with a nurse’s help. Carrying a large blood bag, the nurse rushed to the operating room...","Ji Nan immediately understood what was going on. His mind exploded. He opened his mouth, wanting to say something, but no words came out.","He didn’t expect Qiao Nian to come, let alone donate blood to his father.","Ji Nan opened his mouth and looked at the girl who was stronger than him.","She walked over as if nothing had happened and asked Xie Yun, “Those old men still haven’t given in?”","Xie Yun returned to her senses and shook her head. “I know those people were sent by you. They were about to compromise, but who knew that Lingfeng would vomit blood and faint? Their attitudes suddenly changed. I’m afraid He Lin can’t suppress them anymore.”","In fact, besides Ji Lingfeng himself, no one could suppress those elders with seniority."]},{"number":3471,"title":"Chapter 3471: She Had Already Arranged Everything","paragraphs":["Chapter 3471: She Had Already Arranged Everything","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ji Lingfeng’s illness had acted up so suddenly that they didn’t have time to react. He was already unconscious. They quickly sent him to the hospital and did not have the energy to care about stopping the news from spreading...","After that, He Lin made up for it.","The current situation was that the outside world did not know about Ji Lingfeng’s health emergency, but the old residence couldn’t be kept in the dark anymore.","After all, the commotion they caused when they sent him to the hospital was quite big. The elders were all smart. How could they not guess who was sent to the hospital?","Qiao Nian roughly understood the ins and outs of the matter and nodded. “I’ll go over immediately.”","“You’re going?”","Xie Yun was stunned.","“Nian Nian, actually...”","She recalled quarreling with Ji Lingfeng over the inheritance of the Ji family. Looking at Qiao Nian now, she couldn’t help but feel guilty.","She wanted to say that Qiao Nian did not have to get involved.","But no words came out of her mouth.","Xie Yun was still speechless.","Because she knew very well that even she and Ji Nan together couldn’t suppress those old men right now. Only Qiao Nian could do it.","“I’ll go take a look.”","Qiao Nian pulled down her baseball cap. Besides her slightly pale lips, no one could tell she had just donated blood.","She did notice Ji Nan. After some thought, she asked him, “Do you want to come with me?”","Ji Lingfeng was still in danger and had not come out of the operating room.","As his son, Ji Nan should stay and wait for the doctor to come out. However, Ji Nan only pondered for a moment deciding to go with her. “Okay.”","He patted Xie Yun’s shoulder and comforted her. “Mom, I’ll go back with Nian Nian. Call me if you have any news.”","Xie Yun looked at him and then at Qiao Nian. Tears welled up in her eyes and she felt an indescribable feeling in her chest.","She knew what Qiao Nian meant by bringing Ji Nan with her. She wanted Ji Nan to learn and at the same time, she wanted to signal her support for him.","It was precisely because she knew Qiao Nian’s plan that her guilt expanded infinitely. It was as if an invisible hand was squeezing her heart.","Xie Yun recalled the message she had received early in the morning and looked at the silent girl in front of her who stood up for them.","She was dead serious. “Thank you, Nian Nian.”","Qiao Nian waved her hand, not dwelling on Xie Yun’s guilty tone. She only said, “I called Elder Zhong. He’ll be here any moment now.”","Xie Yun was shocked.","Elder Zhong?","Zhong Yiliu?","Nian Nian even called Zhong Yiliu?","Her first thought was that Zhong Yiliu was coming from Continent M.","Her heart sank.","It was already too late for a 10-hour-plus flight.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian saw through her disappointment and unhurriedly said, “He arrived in the independent continent two days ago. It’s just that he’s old and physically weaker. He rested in the hospital for a day and then dealt with some matters of the Pharmacy Association.","“His hotel is very close. He’ll be here in 20 minutes at most.","“I’ve already told him about Emperor Ji’s condition. He brought the medicine. It should be able to stabilize his vital signs.”","What else could Xie Yun say?","“Thank you.”","Qiao Nian zipped up her jacket and replied, “Mm.”","She turned to Ji Nan and said, “Let’s go.”","She wanted to see what those old things wanted to do!"]},{"number":3472,"title":"Chapter 3472: Sister Nian’s Aura Was Full","paragraphs":["Chapter 3472: Sister Nian’s Aura Was Full","Editor: Atlas Studios","The situation at the old residence was exactly as Xie Yun had imagined.","Second Elder and the others were about to compromise when they heard a commotion outside. Right on the heels of that, they knew that someone had been sent to the hospital.","The sly old foxes instantly changed their attitudes.","When He Lin finished dealing with the Third Southern Hall matters and went to look for them, Second Elder and the rest had ashen expressions and insisted that there was a misunderstanding. They wouldn’t deal with those people from the Third Southern Hall for the time being and requested to see Ji Lingfeng to explain to him in person.","However, Ji Lingfeng was still being operated on in the hospital.","Of course, He Lin couldn’t accept their request.","As a result, the situation fell into a deadlock.","Second Elder and the others weren’t in a hurry. They sat on the red sandalwood chairs in the Righteousness Hall and drank tea while urging He Lin to report to Ji Lingfeng.","He Lin knew these people were deliberately making things difficult for him. They likely had already discovered that the Patriarch was not feeling well and had gone to the hospital, but he couldn’t do anything about it.","After a short stalemate, He Lin was about to use the clan rules to force the elders to face their act of betrayal with the Third Southern Hall when someone jogged in from outside and whispered in his ear, saying that Qiao Nian and Ji Nan were coming.","“What?” He Lin was surprised and delighted. He looked at Second Elder and the others with newfound confidence. “I’ll go to the door immediately.”","Then, he left the room full of people behind and ran out.","Second Elder vaguely felt things might be developing in a bad direction.","Someone asked, “Who’s here? Could it be the Patriarch? Is the Patriarch back from the hospital?”","“Not the Patriarch.”","Second Elder had yet to figure it out, but he knew in his heart that Ji Lingfeng was seriously ill. It was unlikely to be him.","“Then...”","Everyone was looking at him.","Second Elder composed himself and frowned. Then, he said in an uncertain tone, “Maybe it’s Young Master Nan.”","“Oh.”","The elders calmed down. Going by the contempt they showed, it was clear these sly old foxes didn’t take Ji Nan seriously at all.","Indeed, Ji Nan had not officially followed Ji Lingfeng to interfere in the family’s affairs all these years. It was obvious it was a last-minute decision for him to take over the family.","Even if Xie Yun came along, they might not take her seriously.","From the beginning to the end, they were only afraid of one person—Ji Lingfeng.","He was also a direct descendant of the Ji family.","However, just as they convinced themselves it was Ji Nan, messy footsteps came from outside. It sounded like there was more than one person.","Second Elder and the others held their breaths and waited for Ji Nan to appear.","Among the people who came into view was Ji Nan, accompanied by He Lin, who had just run out.","However, that was not the main point.","Who could tell them why Qiao Nian was here?!","Second Elder instinctively stood up. His aura had already weakened before Qiao Nian could even speak.","“You...”","The girl brushed past him and walked straight to Ji Lingfeng’s seat. Her sloppy temperament did not change, but her sharp gaze landed on Second Elder like a knife.","“I heard that Second Elder wants to vouch for those people from the Third Southern Hall?”","Second Elder’s facial muscles tightened, and he subconsciously retorted, “We don’t have enough evidence to prove that they betrayed the family...”","Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to listen to his nonsense. She threw a lighter on the table and looked up at him. “What are you using to vouch for them? Your mouth?”","Second Elder was rendered speechless by her aggressiveness. He could only brace himself and reply, “How do you want me to vouch for that?”"]},{"number":3473,"title":"Chapter 3473: Sister Nian: Then Let’s Pay a Down Payment First","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian didn't waste her breath on him. \"He Lin, do you have a knife on you?\" \"Yes.\"","Qiao Nian's aura was too strong. He Lin subconsciously took a small knife from his waist, placed it on the table, and then consciously retreated to the side.","Qiao Nian leaned back and looked at Second Elder and the rest who were stubborn with her. She said concisely, \"Then I'll chop off a finger as a down payment.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"She wants us to chop our hands off?\"","\"Did I hear wrongly?\"","The Righteousness Hall was noisy. Second Elder only felt his ears buzzing, and his mind was boiling like boiling water.","He stood in front of the table and looked at the knife in disbelief.","He Lin's self-defense knife was incomparably sharp. Cutting off a little finger was as easy as exerting a little force.","But how could he cut off his finger?","Second Elder tried to calm down, but his tense expression revealed his uneasiness. \"Miss Qiao, are you joking?\"","Qiao Nian's dark and deep eyes met his. Silent and cold. \"Are you joking with me then?\"","Second Elder was slightly oppressed by her aura and did not dare to speak.","The other elders weren't as polite.","\"What right do you have to make Second Elder chop off his finger as a guarantee? You're not even a member of the Ji family. This is an internal matter of our family. It's not for outsiders to interfere!\"","\"That's right. You're just a barely grown Eastern girl, and you're trying to teach us how to do things?\"","\"We want to see the Patriarch!\"","Qiao Nian couldn't help but think of the red light in the hospital's emergency room.","Ji Lingfeng was still undergoing emergency treatment, but these people still had the energy to make a commotion here.","For some reason, Qiao Nian was overcome with anger.","She dug her ears, bothered by the noise, and glanced at the elder who made the most noise. She asked in a negotiable tone, \"Why don't you chop off Second Elder's hand?\"","The elder who had indignantly demanded to see Ji Lingfeng was instantly rendered speechless. He didn't know how the fire had engulfed him. He muttered, \"Why should I listen to you? Who do you think you are?\"","\"You're finally asking the right questions.\" Qiao Nian walked over and looked at him gloomily. \"Is the status of the Ji family's direct descendant enough?\"","Everyone in the room fell silent.","Ji Nan opened his mouth but hesitated to speak.","He Lin was a little excited. He clenched his fists and the corners of his eyes turned red, but he forcefully held it in.","Second Elder and the others looked at her in surprise, as if they did not expect the girl to admit her identity and the blood flowing in her veins.","After a short silence, they muttered, \"You do have the blood of the direct lineage on you, but you were unwilling to return back then. Your name isn't on the family either. What kind of family member are you?\"","Large families acknowledged the family tree and not the individual.","They were certain that Qiao Nian had not entered the family tree and could not interfere in the family's business.","However, if Qiao Nian played by the rules, she wouldn't be Qiao Nian.","She had no intention of getting entangled with them on identity at all. Her gaze was unrestrained as she looked around at everyone in the room. \"Didn't you want to vouch that the Third Southern Hall didn't join forces with outsiders to betray the family? I'll give you a","choice now. Either we deal with them or we deal with you.","\"I will do what I say!","\"Your choice.\"","She was mad.","Exceptionally so!","However, her aura was too strong.","No one thought she was joking right now."]},{"number":3474,"title":"Chapter 3474: You’re Old, Let It Be","paragraphs":["Second Elder could feel the suffocating pressure he had not felt for a long time.","That was the oppressive aura that only the overlord who had led them to expand their","territory in the independent continent possessed. It was an aura that belonged solely to the Ji family.","He suddenly went quiet. \"There's no other way?\"","Qiao Nian glanced at him. \"There is.\"","Second Elder subconsciously waited for her to continue.","As expected, the girl gestured with her chin at He Lin's knife on the table.","\"One finger.\"","Silence.","\"I want yours.\"","Second Elder's facial muscles tightened and trembled. There was anger and... timidity in his eyes that he had not experienced for a long time.","\"What if I don't want to? You can't do anything about it.\"","He still wanted to struggle even on the verge of death.","Qiao Nian seemed to have expected this. She lowered the brim of her cap to cover her eyes, then casually replied, \"You know that I've never been particular about rules. You just said that I didn't enter the family tree and can't be considered a member of the Ji family. Then, consider me a busybody today!","\"If I, a busybody, were to kill you elders here today, I don't think anyone would blame me. After all... I've already done everything at the pier. I'm not afraid of doing more. Don't you agree, Second Elder?\"","Second Elder was completely at a loss.","He was silent before saying, \"I'll listen to Miss Qiao. You can deal with those people from the Third Southern Hall however you want. I'll support you unconditionally.\"","He changed sides too quickly. Even the other elders couldn't react in time.","\"Second Elder?\"","Second Elder was famous for being a man of action. He was tough. They thought he would get angry when a girl threatened him like this.","However, they didn't expect the Second Elder's reaction to be completely unexpected.","This attitude...","He just couldn't afford to offend her.","Second Elder ignored them as if he did not hear them and tactfully asked the girl, \"What else do you need me to do?\"","Qiao Nian liked to talk with smart people. It was easy and convenient.","Today, she came intending to kill.","If they didn't cooperate, she didn't mind making an example of someone. She could just get He Lin to twist someone out and chop off their hands.","However, the other party was much more sensible than she had imagined.","She turned around and picked up the lighter thrown on the table. Her fingertips rubbed against the cold material. The corners of her lips curled up as she looked at Second Elder again.","\"You'll be the one to call the rest over. Then, you'll be the one to 'deal' with the people from the Third Southern Hall with my brother for the others to see.","\"As for the Third Southern Hall... I'll get someone to take over. You're old, so just let it be.\" She meant she wanted Second Elder to cooperate with Ji Nan to establish their might. At the same time, she also wanted to gather the Third Southern Hall's power and not allow Second Elder's faction to get involved.","This request was not unreasonable.","Second Elder gritted his teeth. \"I understand.\"","The other elders were indignant. They didn't understand why Second Elder agreed to such a humiliating condition.","Qiao Nian glanced at him. No one knew what she was thinking. She lowered her eyes and played with the lighter in her hand. The orchid flame darted out and extinguished. Seeming tired of it, she put the lighter in her pocket.","Then, she expressionlessly said to Second Elder and the others, \"My patience is limited. If you're smart enough, you won't play tricks on me.","\"I can't take down the Ji family in one go, but it isn't a problem to deal with a few people.\""]},{"number":3475,"title":"Chapter 3475: Can’t You Tell She’s For Real?","paragraphs":["Second Elder was bitter inside, but he still had to put on his own attitude. \"I know, so don't worry.\"","Qiao Nian had to return to the hospital. She took out her cell phone and saw no missing calls or messages. It was obvious that Ji Lingfeng was not out of danger yet.","She called He Lin out and told him what to do next.","The Righteousness Hall burst into an uproar the moment Qiao Nian left.","\"Second Elder, why did you...\" Someone couldn't hold back his temper.","Second Elder controlled his temper when facing Qiao Nian, but he wasn't as good-tempered with them. He waved his hand and turned around. \"Can't you tell she came intending to kill?\" The Ji family was nothing.","His status as an elder was nothing.","He knew very well that if he had not been so cooperative, Qiao Nian would have chopped a finger of his.","Ji Hongyuan was an example.","Qiao Nian might not take his life directly, but there were many ways to torture someone. Taking their life immediately was one of the stupidest ways.","He wanted to take advantage of the Patriarch's illness to rise in status, but on the premise that he could enjoy this glory.","Qiao Nian had gotten someone to bring the people from the Third Southern Hall.","However, he forgot that the people from the Tongji Society who had also been to the pier had yet to be found.","Besides Continent F, Qiao Nian also had the support of the First Research Institute.","Most importantly, she had the boss of Bright Gate, who could not be underestimated in the independent continent, behind her.","Second Elder's temples throbbed as he thought this through.","He had planned for a few days and even delayed the Patriarch from finding out about the pier. He had paid a considerable price, but in the end, he did not get anything and instead had to give in to others.","It would be a lie to say he was not upset.","His chest felt stuffy.","However, he was a smart person. He knew whom he could play tricks on and whom he had better be honest with.","Therefore, he briefly adjusted his mood and said to Ji Nan, \"Young Master Nan, you just have to cooperate with me when I call the remaining elders and people from the halls.\"","\"I understand.\" Ji Nan could tell Second Elder did not take him seriously at all. His attitude towards him was completely different from his attitude towards Qiao Nian.","He feared Qiao Nian, but he seemed to look down on him.","The kind of contempt, that he did not take him seriously.","Ji Nan knew he would face this treatment when he chose not to come into contact with the family's affairs back then. However, he had never expected that when he faced these things, it was when his father fell due to illness and these people stepped on his and his mother's heads... He suddenly regretted his decision back then.","Just like today.","If not for Qiao Nian, he might not have been able to suppress Second Elder and the others. These people might turn into a deadly knife and stab his father in the chest, but he as the son was watching from the side and could not do anything!","During this period, this deep sense of powerlessness was everywhere. Ji Nan seriously reflected on his previous choices...","***","\"Miss Qiao, why don't you stay here and wait for Young Master Nan to deal with matters before leaving?\" He Lin looked at her carefully.","The girl leaned against the wall and propped up her legs as she nonchalantly said, \"Why should I stay? Do you really want me to take over the Ji family?\"","\"But...\"","He Lin opened his mouth and looked at the girl, revealing too much information in his eyes.","Everyone hoped that Miss Qiao would take over the Ji family.","Qiao Nian was irritated by his gaze for no reason. She sized him up. \"I never said I wanted to take over the Ji family.\""]},{"number":3476,"title":"Chapter 3476: He’s Still in Danger","paragraphs":["\"If it wasn't for...\" She paused and did not dwell on this matter. \"I wouldn't care about these trivial matters at all. Whether the Ji family lives or dies has nothing to do with me. I've never wanted to inherit such a family. Besides being a pile of mud, what else does the Ji family have?\"","The dirty secrets of the previous generation.","And Ji Qing's death.","Everyone was talking about what kind of place the Ji family was. There was no familial love, no truth, only eternal benefits.","Ji Lingfeng had worked hard for the Ji family for decades. But what did he get in the end?","If not because these people did not know his exact physical condition, the hospital he was in would probably be overcrowded by now. Many people wanted him dead.","There were even people from the Ji family among them.","Continent F was also in chaos.","However, whether it was Continent F or the illegal district, everyone was in a mess on the surface but did not resort to underhanded means.","The strong could speak while the weak could only shut up.","She didn't have so many schemes and didn't like to talk about relationships.","Just like Tian Chen and the Red Alliance.","She had known Lu Zhi for so many years. Tian Chen was Tian Chen, and the Red Alliance was the Red Alliance. When there was a conflict of interest, they would rely on themselves.","No one said they would talk about their years of friendship.","However, the independent continent was different.","The Ji family was different from the reclusive families.","These people were full of kinship and blood ties... but were more ruthless than those desperadoes in the illegal district and Continent F.","She was used to being straightforward and would occasionally deal with these things.","But to deal with people like these every day? Forget it. She still wanted to live for a few more years.","Moreover, there was the matter of Ji Qing between them. Based on this point alone, she could not possibly want the Ji family.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and said calmly, \"I'll help you stabilize the situation during this period. If you have anything urgent, you can call me.\"","\"I understand.\" He Lin still felt a little regretful, but it was also within his expectations. Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows and said softly, \"If you want to nurture a successor, why don't you nurture Ji Nan? It's just that he doesn't know anything about black gunpowder technology, but he's smart. Black gunpowder isn't a big problem. You can cooperate with the First Research Institute or take goods from me. You haven't used these things in the first place. You're just using them to show your power. So what if the Patriarch doesn't know how it works?\"","He Lin looked at her in surprise. \"Miss Qiao...\"","Of course, he knew this, but he did not expect Qiao Nian to know the twists and turns of the Ji family.","\"Alright.\" Qiao Nian had told him enough. She didn't want to continue talking to him. She pulled up her collar to her chin. \"I'm leaving now. I'll leave this side to you.\"","He Lin opened his mouth to ask her to stay, but after some thought, he didn't do such a hypocritical thing. He only said, \"I'll get someone to drive you.\"","Qiao Nian waved her hand and played with her cell phone with the other hand. Without looking up, she said, \"My car is outside. I'll go straight.\"","He Lin looked at her thin back view. It wasn't a reliable presence in the traditional sense, but it was still inexplicably reassuring.","He Lin knew that Qiao Nian, Xie Yun, and the others were at the hospital, so he wasn't worried about them. He turned around and went in to help Ji Nan.","A black SUV was parked outside.","Qiao Nian walked over, opened the passenger door, entered the car, and fastened her seatbelt. Then, she tilted her head and asked the man familiarly, \"He's not out of danger yet?\"","\"In the middle of surgery.\" Ye Wangchuan looked at the weather and closed the window. Turning on the air conditioner, he looked at her. \"Elder Zhong is already there. With him around, Emperor Ji should be able to escape danger.\""]},{"number":3477,"title":"Chapter 3477: Everyone Knows Ji Lingfeng Was Poisoned","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian nestled in her seat, her emotions unreadable. She said in a muffled voice, \"You don't know his situation. It's poison.\"","Even if Ji Lingfeng could escape danger this time, he would not live for long.","Ye Wangchuan looked at her uninterested expression and rubbed her head before retracting his hand. He chuckled. \"I thought you didn't care about life and death?\"","Qiao Nian looked up lazily, still stubborn. \"I didn't say I cared about him.\"","If she didn't care about Ji Lingfeng's life and death, why did she have to involve herself in the Ji family's mess time and time again?","Ye Wangchuan did not expose her. His slender fingers turned the car key and he drove back to the hospital.","\"With Elder Zhong around, and with Mo Dong having found a few people with the RH blood type willing to donate blood, even if no one knows what will happen in the future, Emperor Ji will be fine for now.\"","Qiao Nian returned to the hospital.","Ji Lingfeng's surgery had ended and he had just been wheeled to the ICU.","Xie Yun's eyes were still red. Seeing Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan, she wiped her tears with the back of her hand and tried her best to look better.","\"Nian Nian, they said the surgery was successful. Thank you for this.\"","\"Mm.\"","Qiao Nian asked emotionlessly, \"Did Elder Zhong tell you?\"","Xie Yun suddenly raised her head in surprise. \"You know about it?\"","Qiao Nian nodded, admitting it. \"I heard from Elder Zhong at first. He called me and said you asked him about a medicine. Coincidentally, another person also asked him for this special medicine. So, I asked about his patient's condition. Elder Zhong told me the patient was poisoned... That's all I know.\"","Xie Yun was silent from the beginning to the end. When Qiao Nian finished speaking, she forced a dignified smile.","However, she had just heard from Zhong Yiliu that Ji Lingfeng had been poisoned.","This incident was a huge blow to her.","She originally thought that Ji Lingfeng's old injuries were caused by the maritime accident and that taking special medicine was only a temporary measure.","She knew Ji Lingfeng wasn't in good health, but she didn't expect his body to be in such a state!","Xie Yun gulped. \"It's Nie Qingru.\"","She shouldn't have mentioned this person in front of Qiao Nian.","However, Xie Yun couldn't control her anger and pain. After a short period of restraint, she raised her head and met the girl's gaze.","\"Lingfeng has been in charge of the Ji family all these years. No one has been able to tamper with his food and drink. There's only one possibility. He was poisoned when he was young. Only one person can do this-his nominal mother at that time.\"","Qiao Nian didn't need Xie Yun to tell her to know who had poisoned him. However, the shock of hearing from someone else was still there.","Ji Wusun brought Ji Lingfeng back to the family when he was nine years old.","Which meant that...","Nie Qingru was crazy enough to poison a nine-year-old child, wanting to slowly torture this child to death.","Later on, for some reason, she stopped giving him the poison.","Ji Lingfeng was lucky enough to survive.","It wasn't until he was seriously injured by a sneak attack on the high seas in Continent M that the remnant poison erupted, threatening Ji Lingfeng's life.","Qiao Nian didn't say she didn't care this time. \"I understand.\"","Xie Yun closed her eyes and suppressed the sharp pain in her nerve endings and the urge to settle scores with Nie Qingru. She squeezed her fingers and finally calmed down.","When she looked at the girl's beautiful eyes again, she realized she had been too agitated and pursed her lips. \"Don't take what I just said to heart.\""]},{"number":3478,"title":"Chapter 3478: Those Who Treat You Well and Want You Dead Are Family","paragraphs":["Xie Yun didn't want Qiao Nian to face Nie Qingru. It was just that after knowing the truth, her blood surged and she wanted to express her emotions to someone.","Qiao Nian replied, \"Mm.\"","Xie Yun really couldn't smile anymore. The corners of her mouth twitched, but she gave up trying to smile. She rummaged through her bag, found a document, and handed it to Qiao Nian.","\"This is for you.\"","\"What's this?\"","Qiao Nian took the document and looked down, stunned.","Xie Yun saw that she was in a rare daze and finally smiled. \"Your uncle left this for you.\"","At the mention of Ji Lingfeng, her smile faded a little. She tried to maintain her smile as Qiao Nian held the document properly. \"He suddenly vomited blood in the study. He Lin and I rushed in. He Lin was busy calling a car and a doctor when I saw this document on his desk.\"","Qiao Nian was holding a signed will.","Ji Lingfeng transferred 80% of his assets to Qiao Nian's name.","Of course, Xie Yun had already seen it and was open-minded. \"I took it away because I was afraid that if he crumbled, He Lin and I wouldn't be able to suppress those old fellows from the Righteousness Hall. If those people saw this will, they might not necessarily fall into your hands. This is his wish, so I'll put it away for him. Since you're here, I'll give it to you so I won't have to worry about carrying it.\"","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and wanted to return the document to her. \"I...\"","\"Don't.\" Xie Yun knew what she wanted to do. She pressed her hand against the document and refused to take it. Then, she said in a low voice, \"I know you don't lack money, and I don't want to use this as a favor with you. After all, we've been husband and wife for more than 20 years. He's about to die. I can't let him leave without being at peace.\"","Xie Yun stuffed the document into Qiao Nian's hands, not giving her a chance to refuse. Then, she smiled and said calmly, \"I'll go see him now.\"","She gathered the shawl around her shoulders and tidied her hair, making herself look noble and calm as she walked towards Ji Lingfeng's ward.","Ye Wangchuan waited for her to disappear before patting the girl's shoulder and asking, \"What are you thinking about?\"","Qiao Nian felt a hand on her shoulder and returned to her senses. Her beautiful face had a complicated expression. She held the thin but heavy piece of paper in her hand tightly and smiled. \"I'm thinking that some people just want you to die, and some people just want to treat you well.\"","And these two people happened to be the same kind of people-people related to her by blood!","Ye Wangchuan smiled, his eyes dark. \"You want to save Emperor Ji?\"","Qiao Nian turned around and expressionlessly stuffed the will into his arms, looking arrogant. \"I don't want to save him. It has nothing to do with me!\"","Then, she walked out without looking back.","Ye Wangchuan did not chase after her. He held the will and saw how much Ji Lingfeng wanted to compensate her.","80% of his private assets were in this will. It was even signed and notarized by a lawyer.","With this will, even if Ji Lingfeng Suddenly died and Qiao Nian did not have the time to take over the Ji family according to his wishes...","She could rely on these industries to rise and become a dazzling new noble in the independent continent. In less than 10 years, she might not be worse off than the Ji family.","Ji Lingfeng would empty the Ji family to give Qiao Nian a way out.","Ye Wangchuan folded the document and put it away, in case she couldn't find it when she wanted it later.","Nan Tianyi came to look for him at this moment.","Ye Wangchuan left with him."]},{"number":3479,"title":"Chapter 3479: Why? Is Ji Lingfeng Dead?","paragraphs":["Outside.","Qiao Nian didn't go far. She just left the hospital to take a breather.","She told Ye Wangchuan she didn't care about Ji Lingfeng and that his life and death had nothing to do with her... But when it turned quiet outside, Qiao Nian couldn't help but remember Xie Yun's expression when she mentioned Ji Lingfeng and that f*cking will.","The girl lowered her head and leaned lazily against the wall, playing with her lighter. From time to time, dark blue flames would shoot out, making her look a little lazy.","The news of Ji Lingfeng's hospitalization was not kept secret for long.","The main reason was that this time was different. He couldn't get up in a few days and pretend nothing had happened.","According to Zhong Yiliu, if he could regain consciousness in 48 hours, he would be considered to have a strong will to live.","This way, Xie Yun and Nan Tianyi discussed it for a while and decided not to hide the news of","Ji Lingfeng's hospitalization. Of course, there was a prerequisite they wouldn't reveal how bad Ji Lingfeng's condition was!","After discussing it, they quickly released the news.","The various large factions of the independent continent had to come and visit.","Less than half an hour after the news was released, many luxury cars arrived outside the hospital where Ji Lingfeng was hospitalized.","Qiao Nian was lurking in the shadows. The sunlight and the shadows from the corners of the walls blocked her figure. Very few people noticed her in the corner.","She could see that the Hacker Alliance, the First Research Institute, the Arbitration Alliance... All kinds of forces had sent people over.","The luxury cars parked outside the hospital were not just as expensive as they appeared.","Different from anywhere outside, the independent continent's factions were specially modified armored cars. They were very safe.","She was about to go back inside when a black Rolls-Royce stopped at the entrance.","Compared to those who rushed into the hospital as soon as they left the car, the blond middle-aged man exiting the black Rolls-Royce was much calmer.","Led by the person Xie Yun had sent out to lead the way, he was about to enter when he noticed a spec of light from the corner of his eye.","Simon stopped in his tracks and subconsciously looked over.","He immediately recognized the bored girl leaning against the wall, seemingly preparing to leave.","He stopped and called out, \"Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Nian was putting the lighter into her pocket when she turned around and saw the person standing a few steps away from her.","She narrowed her eyes and recalled who he was for a second as she focused on his face. \"What's the matter?\"","Simon clearly felt her pause for a second. She seemed to... not have recognized him.","Qiao Nian did not recognize him.","At the very least, she did not recognize him immediately.","This realization gave him an indescribable feeling. He almost could not maintain his good social manners. His smile stiffened as he looked at the girl and said, \"Miss Qiao caused quite a commotion at the harbor. May I ask if you want to take over the Ji family?\"","The girl was still wearing the black baseball cap. The brim was pressed low, and from his angle, he could only see the girl's red lips suddenly curl up, flamboyant and fierce.","Not even looking at him, the girl put the lighter into her pocket and stood with her hands in her pockets, with no intention of approaching him.","\"Why?\"","What?","Qiao Nian looked at him disdainfully. \"Is Ji Lingfeng dead?\"","They were all thinking about dividing up the Ji family."]},{"number":3480,"title":"Chapter 3480: Sister Nian’s Decision","paragraphs":["No matter how slow Simon was, he could tell from the other party's tone that she was unhappy. He thought to himself that he was unlucky today.","For some reason, Qiao Nian seemed to be in a bad mood.","However, he was the one who brought up this topic. There was no reason for him not to respond.","Simon could only harden his face and explain awkwardly while the people sent by Xie Yun stared at him. \"I didn't mean that. I was just curious...\"","\"Then you should be less curious.\" Qiao Nian didn't give him any face this time. \"So-and- so's grandma has lived for 80 years because she has never been curious about anything that has nothing to do with her.\"","Simon's expression changed. After all, he had reached his current status in the independent continent. His background wasn't low. It didn't feel good to be slapped in the face in public.","However, he knew better than the others in the independent continent how terrible it was to provoke this girl.","This person even dared to provoke the reclusive families. He wasn't so hot-headed as to think she didn't dare to go after the small Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","Therefore, even though Qiao Nian had stepped on his face and rubbed it against the ground, he endured it and even tried to smooth things over for himself. \"I've learned something.","\"Then I won't disturb Miss Qiao. I'll go see Emperor Ji first.\"","Silence.","Qiao Nian didn't even look up this time, as if she did not hear him.","Simon's expression turned ugly. Suppressing his humiliation, he turned around and strode into the hospital.","The Ji family members in charge of leading the way quickly followed him.","Qiao Nian was left alone.","She had originally planned to go back inside after getting some fresh air. Now Simon had ruined her mood. In addition, it was very likely that she would encounter other people who had come to visit Ji Lingfeng...","She didn't want to deal with that.","Qiao Nian returned to Ye Wangchuan's car. She opened the passenger door, got in, and closed the door.","The space inside was narrow, so she could only bend her long legs. She lowered her head uncomfortably and sent a message to Xie Yun and Nan Tianyi telling them she wouldn't be returning.","Not waiting for a reply, Qiao Nian called Feng Yu.","It rang a dozen times before Feng Yu picked up the call. It sounded like he was outside. \"Nian Nian, what's the matter? I'm...\"","Qiao Nian did not wait for him to finish and explained her intentions concisely. \"I might have to offend many people. Have the First Research Institute issue a statement cutting ties with me.\"","What?","Feng Yu paused before saying, \"Wait for me.\"","Qiao Nian heard him talking to someone on the other end. She could also hear Shi Fu's voice. Right on the heels of that, Feng Yu walked out. The other end of the call became much quieter. It seemed he had found a quiet place to talk to her.","\"What are you talking about? What do you mean by offending a lot of people? What are you going to do?\"","Qiao Nian briefly told him about the Ji family's situation. She didn't mention that Ji Lingfeng had been poisoned. She only said that his condition was not good and that Zhong Yiliu was also in the hospital.","How could a smart person like Feng Yu not understand what she meant?","\"So you want to stand up for the Ji family?\"","\"No.\"","Qiao Nian looked at the cars arriving.","\"I'm standing up for Ji Nan.\"","Silence.","Feng Yu almost laughed out of anger.","What did she mean by standing up for Ji Nan? She was clearly protecting Ji Lingfeng's bloodline.","\"Do you know how bad the Ji family's situation is currently? Many eyes in the independent continent are watching this huge pie and preparing to divide it.\""]},{"number":3481,"title":"Chapter 3481: Sister Nian Was Expelled from the First Research Institute?","paragraphs":["At this moment, Qiao Nian jumped out to protect this pie and prevent anyone from touching it.","This was akin to offending the entire independent continent.","She was humble when she told him over the phone that she would offend many people.","She could have directly said she was prepared to fight the entire independent continent alone! Most importantly, this was not the main point.","Feng Yu suppressed his anger. \"The Ji family is also a mess. Even if you want to protect them, they might not appreciate your kindness. They might even cause you trouble later. Why do you have to...\"","In the end, Feng Yu didn't say what was in his heart: Why do you have to meddle in other people's business?","However, Qiao Nian rarely changed her mind after making a decision. \"Those people have nothing to do with me. It's best if they're obedient. If they're not, I don't mind making them obedient.\"","\"But...\"","\"Dean, I'm serious this time.\"","Feng Yu sighed upon hearing the girl's calm and firm voice. He knew she had thought it through.","\"You really shouldn't have gotten involved in this mess.\"","Qiao Nian lowered her head so her eyelashes covered her eyes. \"The First Research Institute...\"","Feng Yu knew what her decision meant. He didn't want to cut ties with her, he wanted to protect her.","However, he wasn't just Feng Yu. He was also responsible for everyone in the First Research Institute.","He shook his head. \"We'll do as you say.\"","\"Okay.\"","Feng Yu still couldn't help but say, \"But you have to tell me when you need help. I'm half your teacher. No matter what, if anything really happens, they can't blame me for protecting my successor!\"","Qiao Nian's lips curled up, and a trace of warmth surged in her heart.","\"Okay.\"","***","Qiao Nian was never sloppy when she decided on a course of action.","She had spoken with Feng Yu yesterday.","Today, they waited for the First Research Institute to make the announcement.","Although Feng Yu gave them an internal notice, many people in the independent continent were still shocked.","Back then, Feng Yu spent a lot of effort to make Qiao Nian his successor.","Now, Qiao Nian proved that Feng Yu did not misjudge her back then. Why did Feng Yu suddenly cut ties with Qiao Nian?","Many people in the First Research Institute went to reason with him.","However, Feng Yu was exceptionally unyielding this time and did not see anyone. He even found an excuse to avoid Shi Fu.","This caused the discussion about Qiao Nian in the First Research Institute to reach its peak- \"What does the dean mean? Has he finally figured out not to let outsiders take over the research institute? But he clearly thought highly of Qiao Nian previously.\"","\"I heard that Team Leader Zhou and the Deputy Director tried to see the dean, but he didn't see anyone. It seems he's determined not to change his mind.\"","\"What's Qiao Nian doing? Why did the dean suddenly chase her out of the First Research Institute?\"","\"Who knows? She's used to doing whatever she wants. Didn't she run to Continent M not long ago to attend some weapons exhibition with the Beijing team? The dean might be angry about this.\"","\"You're right.\"","\"This is going to be interesting.\"","People softly mentioned Qiao Nian no matter where Xue Zhu went, all looking like they were watching a good show.","They were waiting to see Qiao Nian in dire straits.","Xue Zhu tightened her fists and walked briskly, afraid she wouldn't be able to control her temper and slap those b*tches.","Finally rushing into the laboratory, she slammed the door, shutting out the unpleasant voices."]},{"number":3482,"title":"Chapter 3482: Which Word of That Email Said Qiao Nian Was Expelled?","paragraphs":["Everyone in the laboratory heard it.","Cao Yanhua and Han Cheng put down their test tubes and looked at her.","Xu Yi also looked over as Xue Zhu angrily walked in. No emotion could be seen on his handsome face, but his cold eyes seemed to know what Xue Zhu was angry about. He lowered his thick eyelashes and focused on his experiment.","Shen Qingfeng was used to taking care of others. Seeing that Xue Zhu's face was red with anger, he asked her, \"What's wrong? Why are you so angry?\"","Xue Zhu slammed the experimental report on the table, feeling upset. \"It's all because of those people outside.\"","Seeing everyone looking at her, she endured it and stood up for Qiao Nian. \"They're all talking about Qiao Nian's expulsion! All of them are making it sound so unpleasant, as if they can enter the laboratory just because Qiao Nian was expelled!\"","She knew those people were jealous of Qiao Nian, who was not from the independent continent. Not only did she successfully enter the research institute, but she was also valued by Feng Yu and Shi Fu.","Now, seeing Qiao Nian encounter setbacks...","Those people couldn't hide their jealousy and gleefully watched the commotion.","Xue Zhu sat on the stool, unable to understand. \"Why do you think the dean expelled Qiao Nian? I really don't understand...\"","Shen Qingfeng and the others fell silent.","Not to mention Xue Zhu, the others didn't understand either!","Based on their understanding of the dean over the past year, the dean had high hopes for Qiao Nian. In the future, he would likely plead with her to take over the First Research Institute.","It was impossible to expel Qiao Nian.","However, just like the people outside, they also received an internal email.","Feng Yu clearly wrote that Qiao Nian had nothing to do with the First Research Institute anymore.","Han Cheng comforted her. \"Don't overthink. There's still a chance for things to turn around. Didn't Team Leader Zhou and the Deputy Director go look for the dean? We'll know after they return.\"","\"But the dean doesn't want to see them, right?\" Xue Zhu's voice gradually became softer and weaker.","This time, even Han Cheng didn't know how to comfort her.","Because he didn't know what the dean and Qiao Nian were doing.","Why did it suddenly become like this?","While the others were wallowing in their thoughts, only Xu Yi was focused on his experiment. Even Xue Zhu noticed him. She pursed her lips and opened her mouth to say something.","Before, they were ostracized by the entire research institute, even nicknamed the 'Dead Team' in private.","It was all thanks to Qiao Nian that they could get to where they were and become group members of the Deputy Director.","But why didn't Xu Yi seem anxious at all?","\"Xu Yi, don't you care about Sister Nian?\"","Xue Zhu was actually a little older than Qiao Nian. It was just that Qiao Nian's aura was too strong. Occasionally, she would unconsciously call her Sister Nian like the others.","Xu Yi shook the test tube. The light from overhead refracted on him, making him look even more cold and aloof. He did not look up as he replied, \"The dean did not say he expelled her.\" His tone was neutral.","He was calmer than everyone else.","Xue Zhu was stunned and forgot to refute for a moment.","Xu Yi waited for the reagent in the test tube to finish its chemical reaction and recorded the data in his notebook before looking into her eyes. \"Which word in the email said that she won't be a member of the First Research Institute in the future?\"","Xue Zhu was stunned again. She thought about it and bit her lip in uncertainty. \"I don't think he said that.\"","-But that email indicated the intention of severing ties."]},{"number":3483,"title":"Chapter 3483: The Ji Family’s Situation Is Harder Than I Thought","paragraphs":["Xu Yi didn't want to argue with her about this nonsense. He turned on the tap and rinsed the test tube before calmly saying, \"Since it wasn't mentioned, it's just wordplay. Let's wait and see.\"","Xue Zhu's restless heart calmed down for no reason upon seeing him throwing himself into the next set of data collection.","She didn't know if Xu Yi was right. After some hesitation, she went to the cabinet and grabbed her cell phone before sending a message to Qiao Nian.","——[Are you alright?]","There was no response even after she waited for some time.","Xue Zhu couldn't sit still and found an excuse to see if the dean had returned.","***","In fact, Qiao Nian had been so busy these past two days that she had no time to care about the boring gossip in the First Research Institute.","Since she had decided to help the Ji family through its most difficult time, she had to take action.","Bright Gate had a certain deterrent force in the independent continent, and she could indeed ask Ye Wangchuan for help... However, what happened at the pier was an anomalous event. It was impossible to stabilize the Ji family's internal chaos by relying on this alone, and others couldn't give up on the Ji family.","For the past two days, most forces had sent people to the hospital to visit Ji Lingfeng.","Xie Yun and Nan Tianyi discussed the news of Ji Lingfeng's hospitalization and agreed to let these people visit. However, after careful consideration, they still used the excuse that Ji Lingfeng had just undergone surgery and it was not suitable for him to receive visitors to keep them out of the ward.","This approach seemed impeccable.","However, people also realized that Ji Lingfeng's health was pretty bad.","Some of them, intimidated by Qiao Nian's tough methods at the harbor, began to think again.","Recently, many factions had begun to privately interact with the few uncontrolled halls in the south.","Fortunately, Qiao Nian had previously forced Second Elder and the others to publicly deal with the Third Southern Hall. This could be considered a reminder to the disobedient halls.","At least those people listened to his advice and did not dare to easily ally with outsiders.","Qiao Nian knew these deterrences couldn't suppress the Ji family for long. They just didn't dare to act rashly for the time being.","Once they were given a chance, they would definitely bite her hard from the inside.","Hence, she looked for Ji Nan and Xie Yun to learn more about the Ji family's situation.","Forget about Ji Nan, he didn't know much.","Xie Yun, on the other hand, knew a little more. She roughly explained who could be used, who were disobedient, and who were wily old foxes...","Qiao Nian's head almost exploded. She rubbed her throbbing temples hard. After not resting for two days, her eyes were bloodshot, cold, and dry.","\"So there aren't many obedient people in the Ji family now?\"","\"... You're right to think of it that way.\"","In the past two to three days, Xie Yun had watched Qiao Nian rush around dealing with the series of trivial matters caused by Ji Lingfeng's sudden hospitalization. She felt a little guilty looking at her tired expression.","\"Nian Nian, why don't you go back and sleep? Anyway, these things can't be rushed. When Lingfeng wakes up...\" She couldn't continue.","Not to mention that they didn't know when Ji Lingfeng would wake up, even if he woke up right now, he couldn't do anything in his current condition. It was even difficult for him to get out of bed.","Qiao Nian knew this too. She waved at Xie Yun. \"I'm fine.\"","She just hadn't rested, and her mind was buzzing. Coincidentally, Qiao Nian remembered something Ji Nan had inadvertently mentioned."]},{"number":3484,"title":"Chapter 3484: I Can’t Let You Take the Risk","paragraphs":["Looking up with bloodshot eyes, she was cold and arrogant. \"You said an event is being held in the independent continent?\"","Ji Nan had learned a lot from Second Elder over the past few days. Upon hearing this, a little worry appeared on his handsome face. \"Yes, it's just a small treasure-hunting game. Any faction in the independent continent with a bit of status will participate.","\"It'll be held at Mingshui Mansion this year. It's said that a 21-carat diamond is being used this time. It has some history and is quite expensive.\"","In the past, the Ji family had always been able to take first place in such events as all the forces in the independent continent participated. This could also be considered as implicit proof of their status in the independent continent.","But this year, Ji Lingfeng was unconscious in the hospital. It was hard to say.","\"Second Elder and I talked. We won't be participating this year.\" Ji Nan didn't want her to worry and tried his best to look relaxed. \"It shouldn't affect us much if we're absent once.\" Although he spoke casually, he knew well the impact it would cause if they didn't go this time. The Ji family's absence from such a collective event was equivalent to telling others Ji Lingfeng's illness caused the Ji family's strength to plummet.","However, if they forcefully participated and failed to get the gem, it would also be a slap in the face!","After all, the Ji family always obtained the gem. But if they couldn't get it this year... The outcome would be equally embarrassing.","He had a good discussion with Second Elder and the others. Between the two types of embarrassment, they reluctantly chose the less embarrassing choice-absence.","Qiao Nian subconsciously tapped the table with her finger. After a moment of silence, she said, \"I'll go.\"","Ji Nan frowned and immediately objected. \"No!\"","Qiao Nian glanced at him.","Ji Nan thought she didn't know the game rules and immediately explained, \"This game only cares about results and not the process. No one's going to be held responsible if anything happens to the participants! In the past, nothing happened to us because others were afraid of our power. This time's different... It's too risky for you to go!\"","Qiao Nian easily provoked others.","Those people usually couldn't find an opportunity to make a move. If Qiao Nian represented the Ji family in this game... it would be hard to say if something might happen.","Ji Nan would never agree to let her participate.","\"I've already discussed it with Second Elder and the others. Don't worry about this. If it really doesn't work out, I'll find someone else to participate. But that person is definitely not you.\" Xie Yun also didn't agree. \"Ji Nan is right. Nian Nian, don't go. This is too dangerous.\"","Mingshui Mansion would be closed for the duration of the game.","They could see what was happening inside through the surveillance cameras, but they couldn't intervene immediately to prevent any accidents from happening.","Qiao Nian stood up with her legs propped up. Her eyes were quite dry, and it was obvious that she wasn't listening. \"I've already decided.\"","Ji Nan's eyes widened and he clenched his fists. \"Qiao Nian! Stop fooling around.\"","He rarely called the girl by her name. When serious, he would at most call her Sun.","This was the first time Ji Nan called her by her full name.","The girl just pulled the collar of her sweater, covering her snow-white jawline. Her dark eyes were clear as she stared at Ji Nan.","\"Can the Ji family afford to wait?\"","Silence.","Ji Nan's face turned pale. He avoided her gaze and said in a low and hoarse voice, \"I don't want you to take the risk!\"","Otherwise, when his father woke up and found out, he would definitely beat him to death!"]},{"number":3485,"title":"Chapter 3485: Sister Nian: Then Let’s Decide On This First","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian didn't buy it. \"Since there's no better way, it's decided.\"","Veins bulged on Ji Nan's forehead.","He clenched his fists and was about to say something when the girl picked up her bag, walked over, and patted his shoulder. \"Let's go.\"","Not waiting for his reaction, Qiao Nian turned to Xie Yun and said, \"Auntie Xie, I still have something on. I'll leave first.\"","Xie Yun looked at her son, then at the unmoved Qiao Nian. Her eyebrows twitched, and she nodded lovingly.","The girl left Ji Nan's apartment without hesitation.","Click!","Ji Nan walked to the sofa in frustration and sat down. He buried his head in his knees and scratched his hair forcefully.","His neatly trimmed short hair was fluffy and messy from his actions. The usually refined and handsome Young Master Ji looked up, his eyes faintly bloodshot as he stared fixedly at his Mom.","\"Mom, why didn't you persuade her?\"","\"You tried to persuade her. Did it work?\"","Xie Yun rolled her eyes at him.","However, he was still her biological son. She knew Ji Nan was venting his anger, so she tolerated it. Bending down and grabbing her bag, she glanced at Ji Nan, sitting on the sofa scratching his head and cheeks. \"It's very difficult to change Nian Nian's mind. Instead of thinking about how to convince her, why don't you think about ensuring her safety?\"","\"Mom, you mean...\" Ji Nan gradually calmed down and glanced at her.","Why did she give birth to a stupid boy!","Xie Yun walked over and flicked his forehead. Seeing him frown in pain, she retracted her hand in satisfaction and looked down at him. \"Does Nian Nian representing the Ji family in the game this time solve the urgent needs of those old men?\"","\"...Yes.\"","Seeing that he wasn't too stupid, Xie Yun nodded and continued, \"Nian Nian is going to resolve their urgent needs. Don't you know how to use this as a condition to get those old men to show some 'sincerity'?\"","Silence.","Ji Nan wasn't stupid. He had already started to think along this line of thought.","Xie Yun briefly explained the workings to him.","\"This isn't the first time those old men are participating in this activity. The independent continent will hold a treasure hunt event every two years. They know more tricks than you!\"","Ji Nan understood. \"You want me to use Nian Nian's willingness to represent the Ji family in the treasure hunt to speak terms?\"","Xie Yun smiled and did not say anything. She just looked at him quietly.","\"What you have to do is not to wallow in self-pity here, but to protect your sister as your father expects. Nian Nian has already done a lot for us. If we can't even do anything for her, why are you still talking about being a family and wishing her well?\"","Xie Yun's voice was calm. There was no criticism or resentment.","She just wanted to reason with him calmly.","\"Ji Nan, I don't blame you for refusing to participate in the family's business back then.\"","\"You were young and weren't interested in family matters. That's why I allowed you to pursue your hobbies. After all, life is short. Mom will be happy if you can find something you love!\"","Xie Yun's tone suddenly changed. \"But it's different now. You've also seen the family's chaotic situation. Ever since your father vomited blood and fainted, no one among the family's underlings submitted to you. Those elders even relied on their qualifications to not take you seriously... You can ignore all of this, but you're an adult. Through these few days, you should be able to tell that just because you gave in doesn't mean that others will let you off.\""]},{"number":3486,"title":"Chapter 3486: Don’t Worry, The Deputy Director and I Are Here","paragraphs":["\"If you want to protect the people and important things around you, you have to learn to be independent and strong like Nian Nian.","\"No one can always protect you. You're a brother and a man. You need to stand up and protect her. You shouldn't let her stand up every time and become a knife to open a path for you!\"","Xie Yun had never spoken like that to Ji Nan.","She had said a lot today. She didn't know how much her son would listen to.","Xie Yun didn't force him to grow up overnight. She brushed her curly hair behind her ear and broke the heavy atmosphere.","\"I remember that Mingshui Mansion is your Aunt Xiaoxiao's place. Since I have nothing to do in the afternoon, I'll treat her to tea to inquire about her progress.\"","Before leaving, Xie Yun stopped and turned to look at Ji Nan sitting on the sofa. \"The Ji family","Behind his hand, Ji Nan's eyes were cold and firm. \"I'll ask Second Uncle to come over.\"","Xie Yun's mouth curled up. She was gratified that her son had grown up but sighed at the same time since he had been forced. She shook her head and turned around to leave, thinking about the Mingshui Mansion's owner.","In addition, she called Xie Tingyun and asked about the rumors about the First Research Institute cutting ties with Qiao Nian.","She wanted to see if there was anything she could do to help.","***","Qiao Nian didn't know that after she had left, Xie Yun took the opportunity to educate Ji Nan and make him take responsibility as soon as possible.","She had just left Ji Nan's apartment and had yet to get into the car when she received a call from Zhou Zhou.","In fact, ever since she came to look for Ji Nan in the morning, her cell phone had never stopped vibrating.","It was just that she didn't take it out inside.","Zhou Zhou called relentlessly.","Qiao Nian entered the car, closed the door, and accepted the call. \"Speak.\"","Falling silent, Qiao Nian opened the window to get some air.","Coincidentally, the chauffeur asked her where to go.","Qiao Nian gave him an address, and the chauffeur started the car.","The October wind was indescribably wet and cold on her face. Fortunately, Ye Wangchuan had forced her to change into a thicker sweater. However, the sweater wasn't enough to withstand the cold that entered her bones when the wind blew.","\"Why aren't you saying anything?","\"I'm hanging up if you keep quiet.\"","As she spoke, she rested her arm on the edge of the car window. She had no intention of hanging up. She was just bluffing.","However, someone just had to fall for it.","Sure enough, silent all this time, Zhou Zhou immediately said in a muffled tone, \"Don't hang up. I've looked for the dean. For some reason, he won't let go this time. He won't tell me why he sent that email. Sun, tell me honestly. Did you say something to him? What you're going to do is very dangerous and you're afraid of implicating the First Research Institute, so you asked the dean to send that email?\"","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows. She had to admit that a woman's sixth sense was on point. Her guess was very accurate, but she did not admit it. \"No.\"","Zhou Zhou believed her. Qiao Nian never lied.","Since Qiao Nian said no, it would be too stupid of her to insist on getting her to admit it.","Zhou Zhou took a deep breath and seemed to have figured it out. She said to the girl, \"Don't worry. I've discussed it with the Deputy Director. We'll continue to reason with the dean until he relents. Stay at home and wait for our news.\""]},{"number":3487,"title":"Chapter 3487: If You Really Don’t Care, You Won’t Mind These Nosy Matters","paragraphs":["When the email came out today, she also heard gossip about Qiao Nian at the First Research Institute.","She wasn't a newbie like Xue Zhu.","Hearing the gossip, she wasn't as impulsive as Xue Zhu but was still furious.","Those people were too unpleasant.","Someone even brought up Xie Xinyao's matter back then, saying she had been wronged when","she was chased out of the First Research Institute. It was all Qiao Nian's fault for framing and ostracizing her.","Zhou Zhou chuckled!","Xie Xinyao was kicked out of the First Research Institute purely by her own doing. It had nothing to do with Sun!","Moreover, not only was Xie Xinyao chased out of the First Research Institute, but her family even sent her overseas overnight. She didn't dare to return to the independent continent at all. Wasn't this enough to prove Xie Xinyao's wrong?","However, she couldn't argue with them every day. It was meaningless. Human prejudice was hard to shift.","As long as their eyes were filled with prejudice, even the most perfect person would be at fault in their eyes.","Besides, she knew that Qiao Nian didn't care what these people thought!","\"Sure.\"","Hearing the girl's nonchalant voice, Zhou Zhou's heart finally calmed.","\"Be careful.\"","She had a feeling Qiao Nian's expulsion from the First Research Institute had something to do with the recent storm in the Ji family. However, she was in the research field.","The First Research Institute had an extraordinary status in the independent continent, but it was different from other forces.","They didn't have fighters or weapons raised like the major families. They relied on their brains and the research results of those at the forefront of the world.","All forces wanted to obtain benefits from them, so they naturally treated them as distinguished guests and were usually respectful to them.","However, there was a limit to what they could do against real power struggles. Zhou Zhou: \"Anyway, be careful.\"","***","Qiao Nian went to the hospital after leaving Ji Nan's place.","Zhong Yiliu was in charge of Ji Lingfeng's health condition.","Qiao Nian went straight to the second floor.","The entire floor was guarded by the Ji family, and only a few people could pass through them to visit.","Qiao Nian was one of the few.","Ding!","The elevator doors opened.","The girl pressed down her baseball cap and walked straight to Ji Lingfeng's ward with her hands in her pockets.","He Lin's people were everywhere here.","He Lin had already instructed them to let Qiao Nian pass. There was no need to ask.","Therefore, upon seeing the girl, the burly bodyguards lowered their heads and made way for the girl. They didn't say anything.","This scene was quite strange.","Qiao Nian walked to the ward but did not go in. Instead, she stood in the corridor and sent a message to Zhong Yiliu.","After a while, an old man came out.","Upon seeing her, he sized her up and said unpleasantly, \"Aren't you going in to take a look?\"","Qiao Nian put her cell phone back in her pocket and said lazily, \"No. I just came over to ask how he is.\"","\"He woke up once in the morning, for about 10 minutes. He just opened his eyes and did not regain consciousness. It will take some time for him to really wake up.\"","Zhong Yiliu reported like a machine gun.","\"You clearly care about him. Why don't you go into the ward to look at him? Anyway, he's not awake. He won't know. If you didn't call me over in advance, he would have died that day. Even if he didn't die, he wouldn't be as good as he is now. You're already doing this, but you're still stubborn. If you don't care about his life or death, why would you be asking about him!\""]},{"number":3488,"title":"Chapter 3488: If You Know The Person Who Poisoned You, You Still Have a Chance","paragraphs":["Zhong Yiliu didn't want her to get involved in the matter of the independent continent. However, Qiao Nian had fallen into it and looked like she wanted to interfere to the end.","\"How does that Young Master Ye manage you? If it was Lu Zhi...\"","He stopped mid-sentence.","The other half was obvious.","If the person with Qiao Nian today was Lu Zhi, he would definitely not let her get involved.","Qiao Nian reached for the lighter in her pocket. She wanted to touch it but accidentally touched the candy wrapper instead.","She took two candies from her pocket and tossed one to Zhong Yiliu. She tore open the wrapper and threw the candy into her mouth.","This one was watermelon-flavored.","It tasted sweet.","Coincidentally, it suppressed the sharp buzzing of her nerves. The blood vessels in Qiao Nian's eyes had faded a lot, and she only looked sleepy.","\"Have a candy.\"","Zhong Yiliu had long caught the candy Qiao Nian threw to him. Looking at it, he didn't react for a moment. \"When did you start eating such things?\"","He remembered that her pockets were filled with small pills.","Qiao Nian said casually, \"Recently.\"","Seeing Zhong Yiliu look at her strangely, she continued, \"Someone gave it to me.\"","No matter how stupid Zhong Yiliu was, he knew who it was.","He shut his mouth and put away the candy. \"You know Emperor Ji's condition. I've said before that he was poisoned. His blood is filled with poison. With current medical standards, he can live for another year and a half at most.\"","\"What about at your standard?\" The girl looked at him with clear eyes.","Zhong Yiliu straightened his back for no reason. \"If he cooperates, I can give him another two to three years. If he doesn't... pretend I didn't say anything.\"","One year and three years... there wasn't much difference.","Qiao Nian frowned and recalled how the poison in Ji Lingfeng's body had taken a turn. It was because he had been injured when he was at sea that his immune system was weak, causing him to be unable to suppress the poison in his body, thus causing a series of consequences.","The poison itself was already present.","However, if Ji Lingfeng had not insisted on going out to sea at that time, he might not have known there was poison in his body for another eight to ten years.","Qiao Nian felt frustrated for no reason as she looked at Zhong Yiliu with dark eyes. \"Is there no other way?\"","\"And you said you don't care about his life or death.\" Zhong Yiliu frowned and spoke slowly. \"It's not that there isn't. There's another way, but that method is equivalent to none.","\"Do you know about snake venom?\"","\"Mm?\"","\"There are hundreds of types of venomous snakes in the world. Each venom corresponds to a different inhibitor. Similarly, the poison in his body is the same as that of a venomous snake. If I can get the antidote or the original poison, I can develop an antidote.\"","It was best to have an antidote.","However, many poisons didn't have a corresponding antidote, so they needed to develop one.","The Pharmacy Association was the best at this.","Zhong Yiliu was also a top master in this aspect.","He was confident that if he obtained the original poison, he could develop a targeted inhibitor in a short time. Even if he couldn't cure Ji Lingfeng, he could at least let him live for a few more years.","\"Do you know who poisoned him? If you know, you can look for that person. If they're willing to give the antidote or the original poison, the patient will have a chance to live for eight to ten years or even longer...\"","Qiao Nian looked at Zhong Yiliu and did not answer him. She just rubbed her eyebrows, looking extremely frustrated.","Zhong Yiliu noticed she seemed to know who had poisoned Ji Lingfeng, but he did not probe further. Instead, he said, \"He's inside. Since you're already here, go inside and take a look.\""]},{"number":3489,"title":"Chapter 3489: A Sir Who Claims to Be From Continent M Is Looking For You","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian stood at the door for a while before entering and looking at the person lying on the bed.","The ventilator covered half of Ji Lingfeng's face. His eyes were tightly shut, and there was stubble on his chin. His arrogant and calm self from when they first met was nowhere to be seen. He looked like another sick and dispirited person.","Qiao Nian looked at his hospital gown and his skinny arms.","She stayed at the door for a minute before turning around and saying, \"I'm leaving.\"","Zhong Yiliu was still asking about the follow-up treatment with Ji Lingfeng's other chief surgeon. Seeing Qiao Nian come out so quickly, he asked, \"Aren't you going to stay for a while more?\"","Qiao Nian's eyes were calm beneath her pulled-down baseball cap. \"There's nothing to stay for.\"","Zhong Yiliu didn't know what to say and just waved his hand. \"Go. Leave quickly... Otherwise, I'll have a headache when I see you!\"","The attending doctor sized up the girl curiously.","The girl looked young.","He didn't know how a master-level figure like Zhong Yiliu, who lived in seclusion all year round, could know such a young friend.","Moreover, from their conversation, it could be seen that the girl had a good relationship with him.","Zhong Yiliu had already asked her to leave. Qiao Nian waved at him and walked towards the elevator. She entered it without looking back.","Zhong Yiliu looked at the girl's stubborn back and shook his head, sighing softly. \"...It's easy to suffer if one's feelings are too heavy. Why doesn't she listen?!\"","The attending doctor vaguely heard him mutter something and asked, \"Elder Zhong, what did you just say?\"","Zhong Yiliu dropped his regretful expression and said coldly, \"It's nothing. Let's go to the office to discuss this. I'll take a look at your report.\"","\"Okay.\"","The attending doctor took the lead.","Zhong Yiliu followed him and walked towards the office next door.","***","Simon's residence.","A black Phantom slowly stopped in front of the European-style villa.","The nanny immediately opened the door and reported in a low voice, \"Mr. Simon, we have a guest.\"","\"Mm?\"","Simon got out of the car. His suit's pants hung naturally around his ankles, making him look extraordinary.","\"Who's here?\"","\"A gentleman who claims to be from Continent M. Very young.\"","The nanny naturally took his briefcase and carefully followed a step behind him, maintaining a respectful distance.","A dark glint flashed across Simon's sharp eyes. He undid his tie and strode inside.","He was a person who valued quality of life and was extremely good at enjoying life.","Therefore, while everyone in the independent continent kept a low profile, his car was still a Rolls-Royce Phantom.","His residence naturally had the same undisguised luxury style.","The owner's luxurious taste was displayed everywhere in the European-style mansion. The crystal chandelier hung high above reflected colorful light spots.","The villa had a state-of-the-art thermostat system that controlled the temperature all year round. Whether spring, summer, autumn, or winter outside, it was always the most comfortable temperature inside.","Simon entered the house and took off his tie. He tossed it at a servant who lowered her head to greet him before he asked them to leave.","The servants all went out to give him privacy.","Simon was sure there were no outsiders in the house.","Seeing the young man sitting calmly on the sofa waiting for him, he frowned and impolitely asked, \"Why are you here again?\""]},{"number":3490,"title":"Chapter 3490: These People Really Want to Take the Opportunity to Touch Sister Nian","paragraphs":["\"Tsk~ President Simon is too heartless!\"","The young man restrained his words and actions in front of others. Seeing that Simon had cleared the area and only the two of them were left in the villa, he raised his leg and placed it on the coffee table fearlessly. His long legs under the short boots were flamboyant and slender.","\"I came to see you about something.\"","Simon narrowed his eyes and looked at the man who acted as if he was at his own home. His eyes darkened as he walked around him to get a glass of water. \"What's the matter?\"","\"It's about Qiao Nian,\" the young man said calmly.","Simon's hand trembled and he almost lost his grip on the glass. His heart was definitely not as calm as it looked on the surface. He looked straight at the man. \"What are you trying to do?\"","\"Don't be so nervous.\" The young man smiled.","His smile did not ease the tension between the two sides. He shrugged nonchalantly and reminded Simon, \"Didn't we agree to cooperate? That's why I came.\"","Silence.","Simon wasn't a young boy and did not respond.","The young man continued nonchalantly, \"Now's the chance. I've received the latest news that Qiao Nian is representing the Ji family in this year's treasure hunt.\"","Simon only felt an invisible hand around his neck, and his tone was complicated. \"Are you asking me to attack her during the event?\"","The young man glanced at him as if to say that he was not stupid.","Simon's face darkened. He slammed the glass on the coffee table and sneered. \"I did agree to cooperate with you, but that doesn't mean I'm a fool.","\"The cooperation is based on an agreement between both sides. Why should I take the risk to help you get rid of Qiao Nian?","\"You should know better than me what it means to touch her! The Chamber of Commerce Alliance can't withstand the anger and revenge from Bright Gate and Continent F.\"","He was so angry that his words were so unpleasant. He was just short of falling out with the other party.","The young man gestured for him to calm down as his lips curled up. He had expected this reaction.","\"I'm not selling out my partner yet.\"","\"Then what do you mean?\"","Simon didn't buy it!","The young man retracted his leg and tilted his head to look at him. \"I've released news that Qiao Nian has the complete design of the Tsar. Guess how many people in the independent continent would want to take this opportunity to get it.\"","Silence.","\"It's reasonable for Continent F to take revenge on a single person, but will David blow up the independent continent for her if everyone participates?\"","The young man spoke casually, as if he was talking about daily matters. His tone was flat and calm.","However, a storm brewed in Simon's heart.","Simon was considered an ambitious and ruthless person. Otherwise, he wouldn't have led the Chamber of Commerce Alliance from a small alliance to its current status.","He believed that his methods were decisive and he dared to do whatever he wanted.","It was only at this moment that he realized that he was just an ordinary person.","The man in front of him was more like a lunatic.","The venomous snake lurking in the dark was sinister, vicious, and unscrupulous!","However, he had to admit that the method proposed by the other party was very good. It was the only way to protect himself and get rid of Qiao Nian.","The law does not punish the masses.","No matter how complicated the forces behind Qiao Nian were, if everyone participated in the hunt...","Whether it was the First Research Institute, the arms dealer David, or the Ji family or Bright Gate, they couldn't hold anyone accountable.","This was the only way to deal with Qiao Nian.","However, it was too despicable!"]},{"number":3491,"title":"Chapter 3491: Right and Wrong Are Left for the Victor to Write","paragraphs":["The young man seemed to see through his hesitation and said with a mocking smile, \"Right and wrong are left to the winner to decide. If you miss this opportunity, you might not find a suitable opportunity even if you wait another year.","\"Sun isn't that easy to deal with!\"","Sun.","Behind them were the illegal Red Alliance and Continent F's David.","Feng Yu from the First Research Institute said he wanted to cut ties with her. But if something really happened, that old man might not neglect her as he said.","And the Ji family...","Even if Ji Lingfeng was sick, Ji Nan and Xie Yun still existed. Behind Xie Yun were also Xie Tingyun, Nan Tianyi, and the others...","These connections formed a natural net.","Even if Qiao Nian didn't rely on Bright Gate, her connections alone were enough to ensure her safety in the independent continent.","Simon's hesitant expression gradually began to waver.","He knew well that the man was right.","This was their only chance to defeat Qiao Nian. If they missed this opportunity, even if they went after Qiao Nian, the Chamber of Commerce Alliance would have to pay a tragic price.","Since that was the case, and the best opportunity was right before him, what was there to hesitate about?","***","Qiao Nian didn't know that before the news of her representing the Ji family in the event had spread on a large scale, someone had already set their eyes on getting rid of her.","She had been busy with Ji Lingfeng's matters for the past two days. When she got home, she showered and switched off her phone to catch up on her sleep.","Qin Si wanted to wake her for dinner, but Ye Wangchuan stopped him.","Qiao Nian slept soundly without anyone disturbing her.","She only woke up at eight o'clock the next morning.","It was already dawn outside.","She was dizzy upon waking, so she took a cold shower. Now she was much more awake.","Coming out of the bathroom, she put her cell phone to charge and turned it on.","Placing it in a corner and pulling out a chair to sit down, she picked up the glass of water on the table.","Qiao Nian's dry throat was nourished after a night's sleep. Her furrowed brows relaxed, and she turned on the computer to plug in Ji Qing's USB drive.","The file popped up on the screen.","Qiao Nian opened the last document and saw all kinds of calculation formulas. She then thought of the core arguments she had discussed with Master Cheng previously.","She went online to search for relevant documents, but unfortunately, these were all top- notch technologies. There was too little information on the Internet.","She pondered before writing on the paper. She still encountered a bottleneck and could not figure out what the program blocking her was doing.","According to her calculations, it was not a regular program, but an anti-program.","It was just like a computer that had a self-destruct program installed inside.","Then what was the point of this computer's existence?","However, there was a complete program on Ji Qing's USB drive. It was as if... the anti-program","in the middle was a bug she had accidentally written wrongly and forgotten to cross out.","However, Qiao Nian knew that Ji Qing wouldn't make such a mistake.","Everything in this USB drive she had carefully hidden was completely deduced without any mistakes.","There was nothing wrong with all the previous documents.","There was no reason why the last file she encrypted could go wrong.","And it was such a major mistake that could be seen at a glance.","Since the existence of this anti-program was not wrong, it meant that she didn't understand the meaning behind it."]},{"number":3492,"title":"Chapter 3492: The Next Time I See Jiang Li, I’ll Call Him ’Brother’ and Learn From Him","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian tapped the paper with the tip of her pen, leaving behind points of black on the spotless white paper.","She frowned and fell into deep thought.","However, she still didn't come up with anything. She could only put down her pen temporarily and think of another way.","It didn't seem like a long time for her to calculate the reasoning on the draft paper, but it had actually been more than two hours since she woke up.","Because she was completely immersed in the sea of numbers and advanced physics, she did not notice the passage of time outside.","Downstairs.","Qin Si woke up at nine and finished his breakfast.","He looked upstairs and walked straight to his two good brothers. \"Why isn't Sister Qiao up yet? She slept for too long. Won't she feel dizzy after waking up?\"","Ye Wangchuan lowered his head to look at his cell phone. He was arrogant and noble and had no intention of paying attention to him. He couldn't even be bothered to look at him.","Bo Jingxing had to give him some face. After talking to someone from the Ninth Branch, he put down his cell phone and replied indifferently, \"Why are you watching Miss Qiao all day? Those who don't know might think you want to woo her.\"","\"Me? Wooing Sister Qiao?\" Qin Si couldn't help but curse. \"Damn, are you crazy?!\"","Bo Jingxing wasn't angry at being scolded. He shrugged his shoulders, fully displaying his refined and degenerate temperament. His slender fingers pushed his glasses up the bridge of his nose. \"Then why are you always concerned about Miss Qiao getting up and eating?\"","Qin Si knew he was deliberately finding trouble early in the morning, but he still said angrily, \"Can't I f*cking care about my sister?\"","\"Oh.\" Bo Jingxing glanced at a certain someone at the side and drawled, \"Master Wang, when are you going to call him 'big brother'?\"","Qin Si was stunned. He looked at the shameless Bo Jingxing, then at Ye Wangchuan, who was looking at him. He defended himself. \"That's not what I meant. Don't listen to his nonsense. How could I want to be your brother! I mean, Sister Qiao is my sister. You might not be my big brother, but I am your big brother!!\"","\"Mm?\"","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and glanced at him. \"Are you my brother?\"","Qin Si realized he had spoken too quickly and waved his hand to slap his mouth. \"Pfft, pfft, pfft! You're my big brother, you're my big brother. Master Wang, don't listen to this nonsense.\"","He wanted to capture that fox and beat it up. Damn it, this was too much.","Ye Wangchuan knew they were just bickering and joking. He wouldn't take such a small matter to heart. Instead, seeing Qin Si's red face from anger, he smiled and said casually, \"Don't say that. I really should change my habit one of these days.","\"Next time I see Jiang Li, I'll call him brother.\"","Silence.","Qin Si's face twitched, already picturing the scene.","He could almost imagine Jiang Li's expression.","His eyelids twitched. He sat on the sofa and spoke for Jiang Li in a muffled tone, \"Well, Master Wang, call him that. The Jiang Family only has two offspring, him and Jiang Yao. If you scare another one to death, only your brother-in-law will be left.","\"You should leave Jiang Li alive. It's better than letting Jiang Yao carry Sister Qiao downstairs when you marry her in the future. Think about that scene... You're unwilling, so stop!\"","There was such a segment for marriage in Beijing.","The bride would be carried down by her brother and sent to the wedding carriage.","Qin Si had attended many weddings. He had never experienced it himself, but he had seen it before, so he casually mentioned it.","Ye Wangchuan's eyes were deep. Not continuing on this topic, he stood up and said to the two of them, \"I'll go up and see if she's awake.\""]},{"number":3493,"title":"Chapter 3493: Qin Si Is Waiting for You to Eat","paragraphs":["Qin Si and Bo Jingxing started fighting again.","Ye Wangchuan ignored them and went upstairs to look for Qiao Nian.","\"Knock, knock-\"","Qiao Nian's door was closed. He raised his hand and knocked twice.","He thought she was still sleeping, but the next second, the door was opened from the inside. He saw the girl unhurriedly make way for him to enter.","Qiao Nian was wearing homely pajamas. The furry coral velvet pajamas gave her an inexplicable sense of laziness as she returned to the computer and sat down. Then, she raised her eyebrows and looked up. \"Sit.\"","Ye Wangchuan grabbed a seat and asked her, \"When did you get up?\"","Qiao Nian was still looking at her laptop. She pulled out Ji Qing's USB drive and placed it in the drawer before replying indifferently, \"About two hours ago. I didn't look at the time. It was about nine o'clock.\"","She then searched for the counter equations she had thought of previously on the browser. The results that popped up on the webpage were unsatisfactory, and there were still not many references.","Qiao Nian gave up searching online and pushed away the mouse. Remembering there was someone else in the room, she leaned back against the swivel chair and turned to him. \"Why are you here?\"","Ye Wangchuan looked at her fair face and saw that she did not realize what time it was. The corners of his thin lips curled up. \"Qin Si is waiting for you to eat downstairs.\"","Qiao Nian looked at the time on the computer.","-13:00","One o'clock? She was a little surprised.","Qiao Nian noticed the time and rubbed her eyebrows. She restrained her world-weary aura and said, \"I'll change my clothes and go down.\"","Logically speaking, Ye Wangchuan should go out so that Qiao Nian could change her clothes.","Unexpectedly, he was still sitting by the bed.","Qiao Nian's temples throbbed. She didn't understand why he didn't leave. Could it be that he wanted to see her change her clothes?","Soon, Ye Wangchuan dispelled her thoughts.","His eyes, as deep as the sea, held her in place. \"I heard you're representing the Ji family in this year's treasure hunt held at Mingshui Mansion.\"","He placed his hands on the bed and sank, looking lazy and unrestrained. \"Goddess Qiao, aren't you going to explain yourself?\"","He was still smiling, but the smile did not reach his eyes.","No matter how slow Qiao Nian was, she could tell he was unhappy. She subconsciously removed her hand from her temple and opened her mouth.","\"I...\"","Ye Wangchuan stared at her narrowly. \"Goddess Qiao is used to being alone. It's not your fault that you don't have the habit of discussing with others.\"","Qiao Nian was speechless.","Why did she feel that although he said he did not blame her, it sounded like it?","However, Ye Wangchuan mentioning this matter made her realize that she had been too rash when she made the decision back then. At the very least, she should have informed him.","\"I'll remember to tell you next time.\"","Qiao Nian admitted her mistake with a good attitude.","It was just barely good.","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes but did not say anything. \"Do you know how many eyes are watching this treasure hunt?\"","Qiao Nian did not deny. \"I know.\"","Ye Wangchuan kept looking at her. \"Then do you know that they will definitely take this opportunity to eliminate you, their biggest obstacle?\"","Qiao Nian had already considered this.","Her black eyelashes rose, highlighting her overly young face, unable to hide her unruliness and her unrestrained gaze. \"I know.\"","She continued, \"Many people want me to meet with an accident, but not many people really dare to make a move. The Ji family needs a victory to stabilize the hearts of the people. They can't find a more suitable person, and only I can save the situation. This can't be helped...\""]},{"number":3494,"title":"Chapter 3494: As Expected of Sister Nian, She’s Direct","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan's eyes suddenly darkened. He stared at her for a while without saying anything. His sitting posture became normal and he sat up straight.","Just as Qiao Nian thought he was going to try to persuade her, he pursed his thin lips, looked away, and stood up. \"Let's go down and eat first.\"","Qiao Nian looked at his silent back. For some reason, her hand acted faster than her brain, and she grabbed his left wrist, refusing to let go.","Ye Wangchuan felt a cool touch on his wrist and stopped in his tracks. Turning around, he saw the girl approaching him with burning eyes. \"Are you angry?\"","Ye Wangchuan raised his head slightly, his Adam's apple bobbing, but he refused to speak. \"You're willing to take the risk yourself. What can I say?\"","It didn't matter what he said. In any case, she never listened.","Qiao Nian could tell what he was implying. She blinked but didn't let go of his hand. \"It's not that I didn't listen. I didn't think too much at that time. I just wanted to resolve the matter and forgot to discuss it with you in advance...\"","She didn't say what was right or wrong. The meaning between the lines was that she wouldn't take such a risk next time. Even if she encountered such an emergency, she would discuss it with him in advance.","\"This is an exception. This is the last time.\" Qiao Nian wasn't good at making promises, but she always did what she promised no matter the difficulty!","Ye Wangchuan knew her personality. He also knew that the environment she grew up in nurtured her independent thinking. Even if she trusted him, it was difficult to subconsciously accommodate someone else into her decision-making.","\"I'm not angry.\" Ye Wangchuan rubbed the girl's hair before slowly lowering his hand, his proud eyes reflecting Qiao Nian's face as if thousands of stars had fallen into them. \"Have you thought about how worried Old Master Jiang, your father, and Jiang Li would be if they knew? And Aunt Yuan, Old Master Su, Master Cheng, Master Nie, and the others... If they knew, would they be able to sleep well?\"","\"What about you?\" Qiao Nian's eyes suddenly lit up with fire. She didn't know why she suddenly asked.","Ye Wangchuan was pressed against the wall by her. His eyes met hers, and everything was left unspoken.","Qiao Nian stopped asking and stood on her tiptoes to peck his lips.","It was very light.","They parted at the first touch.","She seemed to be thinking about a very serious question. In the blink of an eye, she frowned, tilted her head, and naturally said, \"Um... Must you wait until I'm 21 years old?\"","Ye Wangchuan's neck was originally covered by her breath, and his body was tense. Hearing her question, he subconsciously held her slender waist.","Qiao Nian's waist was quite slender. It was usually hidden under the sweater and not revealed. She would usually go to the shooting range to play. Although she didn't seem to exercise much, Ye Wangchuan knew she often went out for a jog. One could vaguely see the lines on her waist.","\"Do you know what you're talking about?\"","His breathing was hot, and his gaze showed that Qiao Nian was very persistent.","Qiao Nian gave him a look that said \"Do I look like a fool?\" as she unhurriedly reminded him, \"I know. I'm already an adult.\"","She didn't have parents to teach her growing up, but had she not known all these?","People dated in her high school class. Occasionally, a few girls would talk about some colorful topics behind her seat.","She heard even if she didn't want to.","Therefore, it would be pure nonsense if she said she didn't understand.","People from Continent F weren't kind. The illegal district wasn't a modest place either.","She knew everything she needed to know since she wandered those places. It was just that she experienced it before and never thought about experiencing it."]},{"number":3495,"title":"Chapter 3495: If Not, Can I Break Up?","paragraphs":["In the past, she felt she couldn't fall in love with anyone in this life, nor could she get married. She planned to leave the Qiao Family's sight after graduating from high school and going to a distant university. Then, she would find an excuse to leave the country in two years and never return.","In the future, she would stay in the Red Alliance or the Continent F.","When she wanted to play, she would walk around.","That was her plan until... the Qiao Family exposed her lie and she started to investigate her background.","Then she met him.","Qiao Nian's eyes brewed emotions and seriousness as she raised her chin and asked, \"Why don't... we try?\"","She reached down.","Ye Wangchuan felt her lift his shirt and touch him. If he endured it any longer, he wouldn't be a man. He switched places with Qiao Nian and imprisoned her.","His nose was straight and his lips thin. His eyes seemed to hook her. When he lowered his head, one could see the deep desire in his eyes.","\"Nian Nian, have you thought it through?\"","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows arrogantly. \"If I haven't, can I break up?\"","\"Tsk.\" Ye Wangchuan couldn't help but laugh. He covered her mischievous hand and looked as gentle and easy to talk to as usual, but his gaze was aggressive. \"Sure, we'll talk about it when I die.\"","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes. She didn't like to hear that, although in the past, before she was with him, it was... just like that.","She didn't even care about her own life.","However, her heart suddenly skipped a beat when Ye Wangchuan said it. She pursed her lips and opened her mouth to say something when his handsome face suddenly pressed down and he kissed her.","Qiao Nian wasn't one to sit back and do nothing.","After a short adaptation, she no longer accepted that the initiative was in his hands. She began to counterattack with her strong learning ability.","The wind blew through the white veil of the floor-to-ceiling window on the second floor. The sunlight seeped into her eyes from the camphor leaves, and her usually cynical eyes became deep and arousing.","A drop of sweat slid down Ye Wangchuan's brow. He grabbed her hand and lowered his voice. \"Help me.\"","His voice was low and hoarse, as if he was blowing into her ear.","Qiao Nian knew what was going on. She didn't refuse.","Half an hour later.","The sound of running water could be heard from the bathroom.","Qiao Nian took a shower, changed into a clean sweater, and lowered her head to look at her right hand. Her wrist bones were slightly sore, and her fingers were still slightly trembling. It could be seen how... intense it was just now.","She recalled the scene half an hour ago. Qiao Nian suppressed her heartbeat and turned on the tap. She placed her right hand in the cold water for a while before finally feeling less hot.","She adjusted her breathing before walking out.","She saw that a certain someone had returned to his room to shower and change his clothes. He greeted her in a refreshed manner. \"You're out? Are you going down to eat?\"","Qiao Nian's elbow was still sore. Seeing he did not seem to be affected, the corners of her mouth twitched and she said angrily, \"You can go down first.\"","Ye Wangchuan could tell she was still not used to it, despite her expressionless face, so he nodded. \"Okay.\"","He walked to the door and, thinking of something, stopped and said to the girl bending down to take her cell phone, \"You don't have to worry about Mingshui Mansion. I'll think of a way.\"","Qiao Nian had put her phone to charge upon waking up. It had just finished charging it when he came and they \"disagreed\".","She looked up slightly and saw that Ye Wangchuan had already left. She didn't have time to ask him what he was going to do.","However, Qiao Nian didn't dwell on this matter."]},{"number":3496,"title":"Chapter 3496: Only Sister Nian Can Have Master Wang Cook","paragraphs":["For things that didn't happen, there was only one rule in Qiao Nian's dictionary: I'll deal with whatever comes my way.","If those people wanted to make a move at Mingshui Mansion, she would accompany them to the end!","***","Downstairs.","Qin Si waited until the cauliflower had cooled before he saw Ye Wangchuan coming down.","He looked left and right and suddenly realized that something was wrong. He loudly asked, \"Master Wang, you went to call her down to eat, why did you end up taking a shower and changing your clothes? What are you doing? Burning incense and bathing!\"","Bo Jingxing was holding a video conference on his laptop. Hearing this, he glanced at Ye Wangchuan from the corner of his eye and saw that his clothes had changed from a casual long-sleeved shirt to a light-colored thin sweater.","He usually dressed mainly in dark colors and rarely tried light colors. The camel-colored sweater actually looked good on him, giving him a feeling of smugness.","Bo Jingxing was speechless.","What was he so proud of?","Didn't he just go upstairs to call Qiao Nian down for lunch?","Ye Wangchuan walked over with a smile, completely different from his usual half-smile. Even a fool could tell he was in a very good mood.","\"Hotpot for lunch?\"","What?","Qin Si looked at him.","Master Wang looked like a peacock spreading its tail.","He asked, \"Who's going to do it? You're ordering takeout at this time?\"","The hotpot in the independent continent did not taste good.","Boring.","Unexpectedly, Ye Wangchuan walked to the fridge and looked at the inventory before casually saying, \"I'll make it.\"","Silence.","Bo Jingxing watched as Ye Wangchuan took the vegetables, meat, and seafood needed to cook the hotpot from the fridge. Then, he turned around and called them.","\"Come and help me wash the vegetables.\"","Qin Si cursed and got up, but he did not notice anything. He only complained, \"Master Wang, why did you think of such an outstanding idea to eat hotpot in the afternoon? And where's Sister Qiao? Didn't you go see if Sister Qiao got up? Why didn't she come down?\"","Bo Jingxing informed the person on the other end of the video conference, turned off his laptop, took off his earpiece, and walked over to help.","Passing by Ye Wangchuan with the food, he asked casually, \"Are you in a good mood?\"","Ye Wangchuan glanced at him and did not say anything.","Bo Jingxing's heart skipped a beat. He didn't expect such a reaction. He was still thinking about what was going on when a few garlic cloves were distributed to him.","\"I'll leave this to you.\"","Ye Wangchuan also gave him a garlic-peeling tool. \"Do it properly.\"","Was he complaining that he was clumsy?","This was the first time Bo Jingxing had been so despised. He was so depressed that he forgot about the possibility he had thought of previously and insisted on peeling a few perfect garlic to prove it to him.","Qiao Nian stayed upstairs for a while longer. When her wrist was less sore, she took her cell phone and left her room to go downstairs.","Upon reaching the staircase, she smelled the fragrance of hotpot and quickened her pace.","As expected, the dining hall below was filled with cutlery for hotpot and her favorite dishes. The red oil was boiling in the pot.","The fragrance she had smelled just now had drifted out of the pot.","Qiao Nian automatically pulled out a chair and sat down before asking, \"Are we eating hotpot today?\"","Qin Si was in charge of serving the dishes. Seeing her coming down, he smacked his lips and said, \"I don't know what's wrong with Master Wang, but he cooked it himself. He's still in the kitchen.\"","They had been in the independent continent for so long and rarely used the kitchen. They were all rich young masters who lived a luxurious life. Who was good at cooking?","Qin Si and Bo Jingxing were barely able to cook edible food.","Only Ye Wangchuan really knew how to cook.","However, Qiao Nian was often out, so Qin Si and Bo Jingxing had no chance to eat the famous Young Master Ye's cooking."]},{"number":3497,"title":"Chapter 3497: Master Wang Is a Dad-Type Boyfriend?","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian looked over and saw a busy figure in the kitchen.","Tsk, broad shoulders, narrow waist, what a back view.","It was her man.","Qiao Nian lowered her thick eyelashes and rested her arm casually on the back of the chair. She had no intention of helping.","Qin Si muttered in her ear, \"He made a lot of dishes. I can eat my fill at noon. I just don't know why he suddenly thought of making hotpot.\"","Silence.","Qiao Nian did not say a word.","Qin Si placed the dishes on the table. Only then did he notice the laziness in the girl's eyes, as if she was tired.","He was stunned. He carefully sized up the fatigue in the girl's eyes before asking, \"Sister Qiao, didn't you sleep? Why do you look so tired? Did you not sleep well?\"","As he spoke, he sized Qiao Nian up.","The more he looked at her, the more he felt she looked different today. He couldn't tell exactly what was different, mainly because he didn't think in that direction.","However, his sharp eyes noticed her red and swollen mouth. \"Sister Qiao, why is your mouth so red? Uh, have you been angry recently?\"","Bo Jingxing happened to come out of the kitchen with the dishes. Hearing this, he narrowed his fox-like eyes and looked curiously in the girl's direction.","Without batting an eyelid, Qiao Nian touched the skin of her swollen mouth with her fingertips and casually said, \"I accidentally bit it.\"","\"Oh.\" Only Qin Si believed it and even revealed something. \"I often hit my knee or something. Be careful. Your mouth is swollen.\"","Qiao Nian glanced at the last person to come out of the kitchen expressionlessly. Her eyes were bright and serious. \"We should be careful.\"","Qin Si felt that Sister Qiao's words had a hidden meaning, as if she was still looking at him. Who's behind him?","He subconsciously turned his head and happened to place the chopped onions and garlic on the table beside him with one hand. He also handed a prepared dip to the girl.","She said to him, \"Why are you standing? Sit down and eat.\"","Qin Si didn't think too much about it. He pulled out a chair and sat down, then took the seasoning and prepared to make a light dipping dish.","Bo Jingxing adjusted his glasses and looked at Qiao Nian, then at Ye Wangchuan sitting beside her.","He pursed his thin lips and smiled faintly but did not say anything. He casually sat beside Qin","Si.","Ye Wangchuan took a jar of sesame oil and asked the girl, \"Do you want this?\"","Qiao Nian took a look and nodded lazily. \"A little.\"","He naturally served the girl. He opened the tab and poured a third for Qiao Nian. When she said \"Enough\", he poured the rest into his bowl.","The entire process was natural and smooth as if he was used to serving Qiao Nian.","Upon eating the hotpot later, Qin Si also saw him constantly putting food into the girl's bowl. Every time Qiao Nian was almost done eating, he would put more food onto her plate.","He even carefully observed what Sister Qiao liked to eat.","If Sister Qiao ate first, he would pick more of that dish next time. If Sister Qiao didn't like it, he wouldn't touch it next time.","The meal stunned Qin Si.","He saw that besides moving her chopsticks to eat, Qiao Nian didn't do anything else. Master Wang did everything else.","He immediately thought of a few online terms that Zhang Yang and the others had mentioned when talking dirty. They said that he was the popular boyfriend type now.","Master Wang could become that so-called 'dad-type boyfriend'!"]},{"number":3498,"title":"Chapter 3498: Still Dreaming","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian went to prepare for the Treasure Hunt after dinner.","Ji Nan had already invited Second Elder and the rest to inform the elders. The Ji family tacitly agreed to Qiao Nian representing them in the Treasure Hunt.","This year's Mingshui Mansion event was said to be a competition game organized by various forces in the independent continent. It was more like the first undercurrent collision after Ji Lingfeng's accident.","All the forces wanted to use this treasure hunt to become the new top force, replacing the Ji family.","The Xie family.","Old Madam Xie and Mother Xie sat upright on the sofa in the middle of the living room. They looked like they were drinking tea, but in fact, they were barely able to sit still.","Finally, a car stopping could be heard outside.","Mother Xie was the first to put down her teacup and get up to welcome her husband.","Old Madam Xie glared at her. \"What's the hurry? There are no rules at all!\"","Mother Xie's face turned pale. Due to the old lady's might, she could only endure the humiliation of being reprimanded. She sat on the sofa with a red face and waited anxiously for her husband to come in.","Fortunately, Father Xie didn't make them long. After parking the car, he entered the house and walked straight over to greet them. \"Mom, Hui Lan.\"","\"Mm.\" Old Madam Xie replied nasally, then indifferently asked, \"Did you see your sister?\"","Father Xie took off his coat and handed it to a servant. His broad face was expressionless. \"Yes, I talked to Yun'er and was delayed.\"","Mother Xie couldn't hold her anger when he just walked past her. \"What did she say? Can Xinyao return from overseas?\"","Old Madam Xie was unhappy that her daughter-in-law had interrupted her. She glared at her fiercely. Seeing the other party was not looking at her, she held her breath and turned to her","son.","\"What did Xie Yun say? She still refuses to come home?!\"","She emphasized the word 'come home' and suppressed her anger with the meaning between the lines. She was extremely dissatisfied with Xie Yun's unwillingness to return home for the past few months.","\"You even personally went to look for her. She should have nothing to say this time!\"","Father Xie looked at the two women asking him questions, especially his mother's high and mighty attitude. He couldn't help but press his swollen temples, feeling a headache. \"Mom, Sister isn't coming back. And about Xinyao... She asked me to talk to Brother-in-law. If the Nan family agrees, she will agree. If the Nan family doesn't agree, she won't help us persuade them.\"","Back then, the person who wanted Xie Xinyao to never return to the independent continent was Nan Tianyi.","However, Nan Tianyi and Ji Lingfeng were part of the reason the Xie family agreed. Now that Ji Lingfeng was in trouble, they naturally wanted to take the opportunity to get Xie Xinyao back.","It was inconvenient for them to do this, so they thought of asking Xie Yun to mediate. Xie Yun and Xie Tingyun had always had a good relationship.","If Xie Yun asked Xie Xinyao to return, Xie Tingyun and Nan Tianyi probably wouldn't say anything.","They thought it was wonderful, but reality slapped them in the face.","This time, he went to see Xie Yun. Although Xie Yun also saw him and even sat down with him for afternoon tea...","Her attitude did not change.","She was as tough as ever.","She even didn't want to have anything to do with them anymore.","Father Xie felt a headache every time he thought of this. He didn't know how to face his sister, nor did he know how to face his powerful old mother.","Sure enough.","Old Madam Xie became angry after recovering from her initial shock. She slammed the table, causing the water to splash on the surface."]},{"number":3499,"title":"Chapter 3499: Scum Looking For Sister Nian’s Death","paragraphs":["\"This unfilial daughter! Evil creature, does she want to sever ties with me?!\"","Father Xie looked at her with a dark expression and said without a trace of emotion, \"Sister also said that if the Xie family doesn't want to fight with her to the point of not having any contact with her anymore, don't participate in the treasure hunting competition at Mingshui Mansion this time. Otherwise, we don't have to look for her in the future.\"","\"She threatened me?\" Old Madam Xie widened her eyes in disbelief.","Silence.","Father Xie didn't answer.","Silence was the best answer.","Old Madam Xie was so angry that she clutched her chest, looking like she was about to faint. Her vision darkened and she almost passed out.","Father Xie didn't want to agitate her, but he still had some things to tell her.","\"Sister is serious this time. If we participate in the event, I'm afraid that in the future...\" \"Whatever! I've never seen anyone disobey and threaten their biological mother! If she wants to sever ties, so be it. I don't believe she can change the fact that I was the one who gave birth to her after nine months of pregnancy!\"","Old Madam Xie looked fierce on the outside but was timid on the inside.","Father Xie rubbed his eyebrows. Not wanting to argue with her, he said, \"The person representing the Ji family this time is Qiao Nian.\"","Silence.","Old Madam Xie's neck seemed to have been grabbed by an invisible hand, and she immediately fell silent.","How could it be... her?!","She wasn't afraid of Xie Yun, but she was afraid of Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian had rebellious blood flowing in her bones. It was said that she had even personally killed Nie Qixing, who was related to her by blood...","She didn't dare to provoke such a god of death.","Moreover, she knew that Qiao Nian was behind the harbor incident a few days ago.","\"Mom, the Xie family has relied on our in-laws to get to where we are now. You know very well our current ability. Even if we risk falling out with Yun'er to participate in this event, we won't be able to get first place. There's no need to offend Yun'er...\"","Old Madam Xie was flustered and sat back down. No longer as domineering as before, she waved her hand and said, \"I'll think about it again. I'll think about it again.\"","Father Xie didn't force her. \"Then take your time to think about it.\"","He gave his wife a look and asked her to follow him up.","They went upstairs together.","Mother Xie was still thinking about her daughter. \"Xinyao, she...\"","Father Xie placed his hand on her shoulder and said in all seriousness, \"Xinyao's matter was Mom's idealization. As long as Nan Tianyi doesn't relent, Xinyao won't be able to return. As for this event... I received a piece of news.\"","Mother Xie's eyebrows twitched and she looked up. \"What news?\"","Father Xie's face was tense. He exhaled before daring to say, \"Someone wants Qiao Nian's life at this event! I heard that she had all the data of the Tsar when it was unveiled in Continent M. Someone has already targeted her and is taking this opportunity to get the Tsar's design. If she participates this time... she'll probably die!\"","Mother Xie had yet to figure out what the Tsar was.","Father Xie had no intention of explaining too much to her. \"You just need to know that having the Tsar is equivalent to being able to compete with the Ji family's black gunpowder.\"","Who wouldn't want a weapon of this level?","The thought had also crossed his mind.","However, firstly, the Xie family didn't have the strength to compete with other forces. Secondly, even if the Xie family could obtain the Tsar's data, they couldn't keep it.","Therefore, he had already made up his mind.","No matter the Old Madam's attitude, he would never let the Xie family participate in the treasure hunt.","This was not for anyone, but purely for the sake of benefits.","\"Qiao Nian... I'm afraid she won't live for more than a few days.\""]},{"number":3500,"title":"Chapter 3500: Master Wang: Where You Can See","paragraphs":["Mother Xie didn't understand what he said, but she understood what he meant. A trace of pleasure flashed across her eyes, and she said coldly, \"It's good that she'll die!\"","Father Xie pursed his lips into a straight line and did not say anything.","In his heart, he was thinking the same thing as Mother Xie.","If it weren't for Qiao Nian, Xie Xinyao wouldn't have ended up like that.","Of course, he couldn't wait for Qiao Nian to die.","\"Let's just wait and see!\"","The Xie family wasn't participating in this killing, but their status was enough for him to watch the commotion. He could watch through the surveillance cameras of Mingshui Mansion how that girl walked step by step towards destruction.","Imagining the scene, Father Xie felt extremely happy. His breathing became lighter, and he even had the mood to say, \"I'll bring you along when the time comes.\"","\"Okay.\"","Mother Xie also smiled.","She had already begun to think about which clothes and jewelry to wear that day to be worthy of a good show!","She even wanted to record the scene and send it to Xie Xinyao, who was living a life worse than death overseas. She wanted her to see what happened to Qiao Nian.","***","A few days later.","Mingshui Mansion.","Qiao Nian arrived early. But she wasn't in a hurry to enter. Instead, she pulled up her hoodie and found a quiet corner to send a message to a certain someone.","-[Q: Where did you go?]","Qin Si and Bo Jingxing didn't know that she was participating in this treasure hunt, let alone the danger of this event.","When Qiao Nian left in the morning, she only told them she was participating in a competitive game.","Qin Si even joked that it could be a real-life Crossfire game.","Her eyes flickered, and a domineering dark glint flashed across them. Her red lips curled up as what Qin Si said made sense.","They were playing real-life CF today.","She had just sent a message to Ye Wangchuan to ask where he was when she received a call from Feng Yu.","She didn't want to answer it at first.","However, after thinking about it, she still pressed on the Bluetooth earpiece on her left.","As expected, as soon as the call was connected, Feng Yu's exasperated roar came from the other end. \"Where are you? Why didn't you tell me you were going to represent the Ji family in this year's treasure hunt at Mingshui Mansion?! Are you crazy?! I have no objections if you want to help them, but you shouldn't risk your life!\"","Qiao Nian said patiently, \"I'll be fine.\"","Feng Yu was infuriated. \"Who can guarantee their safety after entering?! If I had known earlier that you were talking about helping the Ji family this way, I wouldn't have agreed to your suggestion to cut ties with you. It's not too late for you to withdraw from the competition now. I'm here too. I'll speak up for you. They will have to give me face...\"","Qiao Nian didn't know where Feng Yu was, but she knew it wasn't far from her.","She licked her lower lip and said impatiently, \"Teacher, I've decided.\"","Her tone was neither fast nor slow.","There were no particularly strong emotions in it.","However, Feng Yu could tell he wouldn't be able to change Qiao Nian's mind.","Although angry, Feng Yu slowly calmed down. His voice still carried traces of anger, but even more of worry. \"The First Research Institute isn't participating in this event. You have to be... careful alone.\"","The First Research Institute had an extraordinary status in the academic field. They wouldn't participate in such competitions.","No one from the First Research Institute was participating this time, so Qiao Nian was alone.","Qiao Nian briefly comforted him before hanging up.","She looked down at the screen and saw that a certain someone had finally replied to her message.","-[Y: Where you can see.]"]}]);
